div>\n                <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-icon\">🏖️</div>\n                    <h3>沙滩瑜伽</h3>\n                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ======================== 图片画廊 ======================== -->\n    <section class=\"gallery section-padding\" id=\"gallery\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">风景画廊</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Moments from Paradise</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-grid\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=1\" alt=\"海洋风景 1\"></div>\n                <div class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=2\" alt=\"海洋风景 2\"></div>\n                <div class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=3\" alt=\"椰子树\"></div>\n                <div class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=4\" alt=\"沙滩\"></div>\n                <div class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=5\" alt=\"海豚\"></div>\n                <div class=\"gallery-item\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=6\" alt=\"珊瑚礁\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ======================== 联系 / 预订 ======================== -->\n    <section class=\"contact section-padding\" id=\"contact\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">预订咨询</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Let\'s Plan Your Escape</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"contact-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"contact-info\">\n                    <h3>联系我们</h3>\n                    <p><span class=\"info-icon\">📍</span> 海南省三亚市亚龙湾度假区</p>\n                    <p><span class=\"info-icon\">📞</span> +86 123 4567 8900</p>\n                    <p><span class=\"info-icon\">✉️</span> hello@paradise.com</p>\n                    <div class=\"social-links\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"微信\">👋</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"微博\">📱</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"小红书\">📖</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contactForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"您的姓名\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"email\">邮箱</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"您的邮箱\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"message\">留言</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"告诉我们您的需求…\" required></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">提交预订</button>\n                    <p class=\"form-status\" id=\"formStatus\"></p>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ======================== 页脚 ======================== -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <p>© 2025 碧海椰风 · 海洋度假村 | 所有照片来源于 Unsplash / Picsum</p>\n            <p>Made with 💙 在大海边</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n### 设计亮点与视觉体验\n\n整体以“海洋·海风·椰子树”为灵感，打造轻松治愈的度假氛围。\n\n- **沉浸式英雄区**：动态波浪叠加在蓝色渐变背景上，配合左右两株椰子树剪影，瞬间将用户带入海边场景。\n- **色彩与布局**：主色为海洋蓝与沙滩白，搭配清爽的绿色点缀。页面采用Flexbox与Grid混合布局，在桌面和移动端都能获得舒适的浏览体验。\n- **互动细节**：导航栏在移动端自动转换为汉堡菜单；预订表单带有实时校验和成功提示，提升用户参与感。\n- **视觉节奏**：从hero区的沉浸化展示，到特色卡片、画廊网格和联系表单，层层递进，引导用户从欣赏风景到完成咨询预订，形成完整的浏览动线。\n\n---\n\n**优化建议：** 画廊中的图片使用了picsum.photos占位服务，您可以替换为真实的景点照片；联系表单的提交逻辑目前为演示用途，可对接实际后端接口。','ai',447682482347671552,447528512765485056,'2026-08-19 22:12:12','2026-09-09 13:59:49',1),(447959425660108800,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 16:11:49','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447960550484402176,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 16:16:17','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447965499784056832,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 16:35:57','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447967752637009920,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 16:44:55','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447976938447982592,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 17:21:25','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447978345775390720,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 17:27:00','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447989835454713856,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传网页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 18:12:40','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447994996378038272,'LOL艾瑞利亚宣传网页','user',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 18:33:10','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447995245955903488,'以下是您所需的LOL艾瑞莉娅宣传页HTML代码，包含完整的页面结构、样式与交互脚本，可直接运行使用。\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>艾瑞莉娅 — 刀锋舞者 | 英雄联盟</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- ========== 导航栏 ========== -->\n    <nav class=\"navbar\" id=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <span class=\"logo-text\">Irelia</span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"nav-links\" id=\"nav-links\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#lore\">背景故事</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#skills\">技能</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#stats\">数据</a></li>\n            </ul>\n            <!-- 移动端汉堡按钮 -->\n            <div class=\"hamburger\" id=\"hamburger\">\n                <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- ========== Hero 英雄展示区 ========== -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image: url(\'https://picsum.photos/1920/1080?random=1\');\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n            <h1 class=\"hero-title\">IRELIA</h1>\n            <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">刀锋舞者</p>\n            <p class=\"hero-quote\">「为了艾欧尼亚 — 我绝不后退半步！」</p>\n            <a href=\"#lore\" class=\"btn-primary\">探索传奇</a>\n        </div>\n        <!-- 滚动指示器 -->\n        <div class=\"scroll-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span></span>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== 背景故事 ========== -->\n    <section class=\"lore\" id=\"lore\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2>背景故事</h2>\n                <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lore-grid\">\n                <div class=\"lore-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=2\" alt=\"艾瑞莉娅在艾欧尼亚\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"lore-text\">\n                    <p>艾瑞莉娅是艾欧尼亚的刀锋舞者。当诺克萨斯大军入侵她的家园时，这位曾经的舞者放下了手中的丝带，拾起了传世的剑刃，以优雅而致命的剑舞捍卫故土。</p>\n                    <p>她挥舞着巨大的金色剑刃，每一次转身都是一次杀机的绽放，每一次跳跃都是对敌人的审判。她坚信，只要心中的热忱不灭，艾欧尼亚便永远不会倒下。</p>\n                    <p>如今，她已成为所有反抗者的精神旗帜，一支在风中绽放的利刃之花。</p>\n                    <blockquote>「我们的土地值得捍卫，我们的热血值得洒落。」—— 艾瑞莉娅</blockquote>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== 技能介绍 ========== -->\n    <section class=\"skills\" id=\"skills\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2>技能介绍</h2>\n                <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"skills-grid\">\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">\n                    <div class=\"skill-icon\">P</div>\n                    <h3>艾欧尼亚热忱</h3>\n                    <p>技能命中敌人时获得攻击速度加成，叠满后附带额外魔法伤害。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">\n                    <div class=\"skill-icon\">Q</div>\n                    <h3>利刃冲锋</h3>\n                    <p>向目标冲刺并造成物理伤害，若击杀目标或命中带有标记的敌人则会立即重置冷却时间。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">\n                    <div class=\"skill-icon\">W</div>\n                    <h3>距破之舞</h3>\n                    <p>凝聚剑刃格挡伤害，并进入减伤状态，释放后对前方敌人造成伤害与减速。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">\n                    <div class=\"skill-icon\">E</div>\n                    <h3>比翼双刀</h3>\n                    <p>投掷两柄剑刃，两剑交错时产生爆炸并造成魔法伤害，同时眩晕所有被命中的敌人。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">\n                    <div class=\"skill-icon\">R</div>\n                    <h3>先锋之刃</h3>\n                    <p>释放巨型剑刃风暴，对敌方英雄造成伤害并施加缴械效果，使其短时间内无法普攻。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== 能力数据 ========== -->\n    <section class=\"stats-section\" id=\"stats\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2>能力数据</h2>\n                <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">攻击</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-fill\" data-level=\"80\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">防御</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-fill\" data-level=\"55\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">魔法</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-fill\" data-level=\"40\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">难度</div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-bar\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-fill\" data-level=\"70\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== 页脚 ========== -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>⚔ 艾瑞莉娅 — 刀锋舞者</p>\n        <p>英雄联盟玩家粉丝页面 · 非官方创作</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n### 设计思路与视觉亮点\n\n从暗黑质感与金色锋芒的搭配中，我们尝试构建出艾瑞莉娅作为“刀锋舞者”的传奇氛围：\n\n- **色彩与氛围**：整体以深色背景搭配金色渐变文字和点缀，突出英雄的尊贵与战场上的危险气息。Hero区域的大标题采用金属渐变，配合隐约的滚动指示器，营造出史诗降临的视觉冲击。\n- **叙事节奏**：页面从上至下依次展开“英雄亮相 → 背景故事 → 核心能力 → 数据一览”，跟随玩家了解英雄的流程，让浏览更像一场沉浸式的角色介绍。\n- **交互与反馈**：导航栏在滚动后变得沉实，移动端点击汉堡按钮可展开菜单；技能卡片支持点击放大，数据条则会在滚动到该区域时以动画填充——这些细微的响应让浏览者感觉页面对操作有“知觉”。\n- **布局适配**：主要内容模块采用弹性网格和栅格布局，在桌面端并排展示故事图文、技能卡片，在移动端自然堆叠，保证任何屏幕尺寸下都能清晰阅读。','ai',447959190653255680,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 18:34:09','2026-09-09 13:59:39',1),(447997019152445440,'按我之前生成的内容元素汇总成一个页面，能看就行 少消耗token','user',1,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 18:41:12','2026-09-09 13:59:59',1),(447997648407097344,'```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>海洋海风椰子树</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"logo\">🏝️ 椰风海洋</div>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"#home\">首页</a>\n            <a href=\"#features\">特色</a>\n            <a href=\"#gallery\">图集</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <section id=\"home\" class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n            <h1>海洋 · 海风 · 椰子树</h1>\n            <p>在蔚蓝与诗意的交界，等一阵风</p>\n            <a href=\"#features\" class=\"btn\">开始探索</a>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"features\" class=\"features\">\n        <h2>海岛日常</h2>\n        <div class=\"cards\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=20\" alt=\"海浪\">\n                <h3>海浪</h3>\n                <p>潮起潮落，都是时间的呼吸。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=21\" alt=\"海风\">\n                <h3>海风</h3>\n                <p>带着咸味，穿过每一扇窗。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=22\" alt=\"椰子树\">\n                <h3>椰子树</h3>\n                <p>向着天空，也向着海洋生长。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"gallery\" class=\"gallery\">\n        <h2>影像独白</h2>\n        <div class=\"gallery-grid\">\n            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/400?random=30\" alt=\"沙滩\">\n            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/400?random=31\" alt=\"日落\">\n            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/400?random=32\" alt=\"椰影\">\n            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/400?random=33\" alt=\"浪花\">\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>© 2025 椰风海洋 · 简单生活</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```css\n/* 基础 */\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; color: #2c3e50; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n.nav {\n    position: fixed;\n    width: 100%;\n    top: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 1rem 5%;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    z-index: 100;\n}\n.nav .logo { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; }\n.nav nav a { margin-left: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none; color: #35514f; font-weight: 500; }\n.nav nav a:hover { color: #d97060; }\n\n.hero {\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #afd6e5 0%, #d4edea 100%);\n    padding: 2rem;\n}\n.hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);\n    color: #1e3d3b;\n    margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n.hero p {\n    font-size: 1.1rem; color: #3f6b68; margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n.btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 0.7rem 2rem;\n    background: #d97060;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }\n\n.features, .gallery {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 4rem auto;\n    padding: 0 2rem;\n}\n.features h2, .gallery h2 {\n    font-size: 2rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    color: #1e3d3b;\n}\n.cards {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n}\n.card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n.card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }\n.card img { width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; }\n.card h3 { padding: 1rem 1rem 0.5rem; }\n.card p { padding: 0 1rem 1.5rem; color: #6b8a88; }\n\n.gallery-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n.gallery-grid img { width: 100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; }\n\n.footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    background: #e3f0ee;\n    color: #4d6e6b;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; padding: 0.8rem; }\n    .nav nav a { margin: 0 0.5rem; }\n}\n```\n\n```javascript\n// 简单的滚动渐显效果（少代码）\nconst observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n            entry.target.style.opacity = 1;\n            entry.target.style.transform = \'translateY(0)\';\n        }\n    });\n}, { threshold: 0.1 });\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\'.card, .gallery-grid img\').forEach((el, i) => {\n    el.style.opacity = 0;\n    el.style.transform = \'translateY(20px)\';\n    el.style.transition = \'opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease\';\n    observer.observe(el);\n});\n```','ai',1,447528512765485056,'2026-08-20 18:43:42','2026-09-09 13:59:59',1),(448373746051227648,'简单页面','user',1,447528512765485056,'2026-08-21 19:38:11','2026-09-09 13:59:59',1),(448373771661647872,'```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>简单海洋</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>🌊 海风椰子树</h1>\n    <p>简单，就是海岛生活。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/400\" alt=\"海面\">\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```css\n/* 极简风格 */\nbody {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 2rem;\n    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n    background: #e0f2fe;\n    color: #1e3a5f;\n    text-align: center;\n}\nh1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }\nimg { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 1rem; }\n```\n\n```javascript\n// 无交互，纯展示\nconsole.log(\"简单页面加载完成\");\n```','ai',1,