er;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    }\n    h1 { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    p { font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.9; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h1>你好，世界！</h1>\n    <p>这是一个简单页面</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n\n\n环境工具仍报错，无法创建文件。我已停止，不再重试。请在新会话中发起需求。','ai',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:07:28','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454828786366713856,'清空会话','user',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:08:12','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454828790183530496,'已清空。有什么可以帮您？','ai',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:08:13','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454828819652710400,'生成一个简单的页面','user',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:08:20','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454828831015079936,'\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 index.html\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>简单页面</title>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%);\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 48px 64px;\n      text-align: center;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    }\n    h1 { color: #333; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n    p { color: #666; font-size: 18px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h1>你好，世界！</h1>\n    <p>这是一个简单页面</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n\n\n工具环境仍然报错（NullPointerException），无法创建文件。我已停止重试。\n\n请在新会话中重新发起\"生成一个简单页面\"的需求，届时即可正常生成。','ai',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:08:23','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454828911835123712,'生成一个简单的页面','user',454812075701817344,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:08:42','2026-09-08 15:08:42',0),(454829060376399872,'下面是一个简洁美观的博客网站HTML代码，包含文章卡片、侧边栏和响应式布局，适合个人博客首页展示。\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>静读小站 · 个人博客</title>\n    <!-- 内联样式 -->\n    <style>\n        /* ===== CSS Reset & 全局变量 ===== */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        :root {\n            --primary: #4a6fa5;\n            --primary-dark: #34558b;\n            --accent: #e67e22;\n            --bg: #f7f8fa;\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\n            --text: #333333;\n            --text-light: #666666;\n            --text-lighter: #999999;\n            --border: #e8e8e8;\n            --radius: 12px;\n            --shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n            --transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\",\n                \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n            background: var(--bg);\n            color: var(--text);\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 顶部导航 ===== */\n        .site-header {\n            background: var(--card-bg);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            position: sticky;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 100;\n            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n        }\n        .header-inner {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 24px;\n            height: 64px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--primary);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n        .logo span {\n            color: var(--accent);\n        }\n        .nav-links {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n        .nav-links a {\n            display: block;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: var(--text-light);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n        .nav-links a:hover,\n        .nav-links a.active {\n            color: var(--primary);\n            background: rgba(74, 111, 165, 0.08);\n        }\n        /* 移动端菜单按钮 */\n        .menu-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 1.6rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            color: var(--text);\n            padding: 4px 8px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 主布局 ===== */\n        .main-wrapper {\n            flex: 1;\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 40px 24px;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;\n            gap: 40px;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 博客文章列表 ===== */\n        .post-list {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 36px;\n        }\n        .post-card {\n            background: var(--card-bg);\n            border-radius: var(--radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n        .post-thumbnail {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            background: #eee;\n        }\n        .post-body {\n            padding: 28px 30px 24px;\n        }\n        .post-meta {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 12px;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: var(--text-lighter);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        .post-meta .date::before {\n            content: \"📅 \";\n        }\n        .post-meta .category {\n            background: rgba(74, 111, 165, 0.12);\n            color: var(--primary);\n            padding: 2px 10px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n        }\n        .post-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--text);\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n        .post-title a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n        .post-title a:hover {\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n        .post-excerpt {\n            color: var(--text-light);\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n            font-size: 0.97rem;\n        }\n        .read-more-btn {\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            color: var(--primary);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 4px;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n        .read-more-btn:hover {\n            color: var(--accent);\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n        /* 展开全文 */\n        .full-content {\n            display: none;\n            margin-top: 12px;\n            color: var(--text-light);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n        .full-content.show {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 侧边栏 ===== */\n        .sidebar {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 28px;\n        }\n        .widget {\n            background: var(--card-bg);\n            border-radius: var(--radius);\n            padding: 24px;\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n        }\n        .widget-title {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--primary);\n            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);\n            padding-left: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n        .widget-about p {\n            color: var(--text-light);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .widget-about .avatar {\n            width: 72px;\n            height: 72px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            margin-bottom: 14px;\n            border: 3px solid var(--primary);\n        }\n        /* 分类列表 */\n        .category-list {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n        .category-list li+li {\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n        .category-list a {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 4px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: var(--text-light);\n            font-size: 0.92rem;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n        .category-list a:hover {\n            color: var(--primary);\n            padding-left: 10px;\n        }\n        .category-list .count {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: var(--text-lighter);\n            background: var(--bg);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 2px 10px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 页脚 ===== */\n        .site-footer {\n            background: var(--card-bg);\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n            margin-top: 60px;\n        }\n        .footer-inner {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 24px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 16px;\n            color: var(--text-light);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .footer-inner a {\n            color: var(--primary);\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n        .footer-tags {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 回到顶部 ===== */\n        .back-top {\n            display: none;\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 32px;\n            right: 32px;\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            width: 44px;\n            height: 44px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(74, 111, 165, 0.35);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n            z-index: 99;\n        }\n        .back-top:hover {\n            background: var(--accent);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n        .back-top.show {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 响应式 ===== */\n        @media (max-width: 992px) {\n            .main-wrapper {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 32px;\n            }\n            .sidebar {\n                display: grid;\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n            }\n            .widget-about {\n                grid-row: span 1;\n            }\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            .header-inner {\n                padding: 0 16px;\n            }\n            .nav-links {\n                display: none;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 64px;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background: var(--card-bg);\n                padding: 8px 16px 16px;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n                box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n                gap: 2px;\n            }\n            .nav-links.open {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n            .nav-links a {\n                padding: 12px 16px;\n            }\n            .menu-toggle {\n                display: block;\n            }\n            .main-wrapper {\n                padding: 20px 16px;\n            }\n            .post-body {\n                padding: 20px;\n            }\n            .post-thumbnail {\n                height: 180px;\n            }\n            .post-title {\n                font-size: 1.25rem;\n            }\n            .sidebar {\n                display: flex;\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n            .footer-inner {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n            .back-top {\n                right: 16px;\n                bottom: 16px;\n                width: 40px;\n                height: 40px;\n                font-size: 1rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- 顶部导航 -->\n    <header class=\"site-header\">\n        <div class=\"header-inner\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">静读<span>小站</span></a>\n            <button class=\"menu-toggle\" id=\"menuToggle\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\">☰</button>\n            <nav>\n                <ul class=\"nav-links\" id=\"navLinks\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"active\">首页</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">归档</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">分类</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">关于</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- 主体：文章区 + 侧边栏 -->\n    <div class=\"main-wrapper\">\n\n        <!-- 文章列表 -->\n        <main class=\"post-list\">\n\n            <!-- 文章 1 -->\n            <article class=\"post-card\">\n                <img class=\"post-thumbnail\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/450?random=1\" alt=\"文章封面配图\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"post-body\">\n                    <div class=\"post-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date\">2025年6月12日</span>\n                        <span class=\"category\">生活随想</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"post-title\"><a href=\"#\">清晨的光，适合读书写字</a></h2>\n                    <p class=\"post-excerpt\">清晨五点，城市还未完全醒来，窗外的鸟鸣像细碎的银铃。我泡了一杯茶，翻开昨晚未读完的书页，忽然觉得这样的时刻最为珍贵。</p>\n                    <button class=\"read-more-btn\" data-target=\"full1\">阅读全文 →</button>\n                    <div class=\"full-content\" id=\"full1\">\n                        <p>现代人的生活节奏越来越快，每天被各种信息洪流裹挟，能够静下心来读一本书，写几行字，竟成了一种奢侈。</p>\n                        <p>但恰恰是在这样的寂静清晨，我们才有机会真正与自己相处。那些未完成的思考，未梳理的情绪，都在这时慢慢浮现。或许生活的意义，就藏在这样的时刻里。</p>\n                        <p>愿你也能找到属于自己的安静角落，哪怕片刻也好。</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- 文章 2 -->\n            <article class=\"post-card\">\n                <img class=\"post-thumbnail\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/450?random=2\" alt=\"文章封面配图\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"post-body\">\n                    <div class=\"post-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date\">2025年6月8日</span>\n                        <span class=\"category\">技术手记</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"post-title\"><a href=\"#\">用原生 JavaScript 构建交互组件</a></h2>\n                    <p class=\"post-excerpt\">很多人习惯了一上来就引入各种框架和库，但其实原生的 JavaScript 在很多时候已经足够完成漂亮的交互效果，关键在于我们如何思考。</p>\n                    <button class=\"read-more-btn\" data-target=\"full2\">阅读全文 →</button>\n                    <div class=\"full-content\" id=\"full2\">\n                        <p>比如一个简单的折叠面板，只需要监听 click 事件，切换一个 class 就能实现。再比如回到顶部按钮、移动端菜单，都是纯 JavaScript 可以轻松解决的需求。</p>\n                        <p>使用原生代码可以减少依赖，提高性能，也能让我们对浏览器底层有更深的理解。在真正需要复杂状态管理时，再考虑引入重型框架也不迟。</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- 文章 3 -->\n            <article class=\"post-card\">\n                <img class=\"post-thumbnail\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/450?random=3\" alt=\"文章封面配图\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"post-body\">\n                    <div class=\"post-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date\">2025年5月30日</span>\n                        <span class=\"category\">城市摄影</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"post-title\"><a href=\"#\">雨后的街头，自带滤镜</a></h2>\n                    <p class=\"post-excerpt\">昨天傍晚下了一场急雨，躲雨的人都聚在屋檐下。雨停之后，街面上的积水倒映着灯光，整个城市忽然变得温柔起来。</p>\n                    <button class=\"read-more-btn\" data-target=\"full3\">阅读全文 →</button>\n                    <div class=\"full-content\" id=\"full3\">\n                        <p>我拿起相机跑了出去。人行道上的水洼把霓虹灯拉成流淌的色块，车轮碾过时溅起的水花，此刻显得那么有诗意。路人行色匆匆，而我只想记录这些片刻。</p>\n                        <p>后期几乎没有怎么处理，因为雨后天然的色调就很好看。在这个滤镜泛滥的时代，最真实的反而愈发动人。</p>\n                        <p>下一次下雨的时候，不妨也走出门看看。</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- 侧边栏 -->\n        <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n\n            <!-- 关于博主 -->\n            <div class=\"widget widget-about\">\n                <h3 class=\"widget-title\">关于站长</h3>\n                <img class=\"avatar\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/100/100?random=10\" alt=\"博主头像\">\n                <p>你好，我是阿澄。白天写代码，晚上读书写作，周末背着相机四处闲逛。这里是我分享生活与思考的小角落，感谢你的驻足。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 文章分类 -->\n            <div class=\"widget widget-categories\">\n                <h3 class=\"widget-title\">文章分类</h3>\n                <ul class=\"category-list\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">📖 生活随想 <span class=\"count\">12</span></a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">💻 技术手记 <span class=\"count\">28</span></a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">📷 城市摄影 <span class=\"count\">9</span></a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">✍️ 读书笔记 <span class=\"count\">15</span></a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 热门标签（纯展示） -->\n            <div class=\"widget widget-tags\">\n                <h3 class=\"widget-title\">标签云</h3>\n                <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;\">\n                    <span style=\"background:#f0f3f8;color:var(--primary);font-size:0.82rem;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;\">JavaScript</span>\n                    <span style=\"background:#f0f3f8;color:var(--primary);font-size:0.82rem;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;\">CSS3</span>\n                    <span style=\"background:#f0f3f8;color:var(--primary);font-size:0.82rem;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;\">生活</span>\n                    <span style=\"background:#f0f3f8;color:var(--primary);font-size:0.82rem;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;\">摄影</span>\n                    <span style=\"background:#f0f3f8;color:var(--primary);font-size:0.82rem;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;\">读书</span>\n                    <span style=\"background:#f0f3f8;color:var(--primary);font-size:0.82rem;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;\">随笔</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 页脚 -->\n    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n            <div>© 2025 静读小站 · 由 <a href=\"#\">阿澄</a> 用心维护</div>\n            <div class=\"footer-tags\">\n                <a href=\"#\">RSS 订阅</a>\n                <a href=\"#\">隐私声明</a>\n                <a href=\"#\">联系我</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- 回到顶部按钮 -->\n    <button class=\"back-top\" id=\"backTop\" aria-label=\"回到顶部\">↑</button>\n\n    <!-- 原生 JavaScript -->\n    <script>\n        // ===== 1. 移动端菜单切换 =====\n        const menuToggle = document.getElementById(\'menuToggle\');\n        const navLinks = document.getElementById(\'navLinks\');\n\n        menuToggle.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n            navLinks.classList.toggle(\'open\');\n            // 切换图标 ☰ / ✕\n            menuToggle.textContent = navLinks.classList.contains(\'open\') ? \'✕\' : \'☰\';\n        });\n\n        // 点击导航链接后自动关闭菜单（移动端体验）\n        navLinks.querySelectorAll(\'a\').forEach(link => {\n            link.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n                navLinks.classList.remove(\'open\');\n                menuToggle.textContent = \'☰\';\n                // 简单切换 active 类\n                navLinks.querySelectorAll(\'a\').forEach(a => a.classList.remove(\'active\'));\n                this.classList.add(\'active\');\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ===== 2. \"阅读全文\" 展开 / 折叠 =====\n        document.querySelectorAll(\'.read-more-btn\').forEach(btn => {\n            btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n                const targetId = this.dataset.target;\n                const targetContent = document.getElementById(targetId);\n                if (!targetContent) return;\n\n                // 如果已展开，则收起\n                if (targetContent.classList.contains(\'show\')) {\n                    targetContent.classList.remove(\'show\');\n                    this.innerHTML = \'阅读全文 →\';\n                } else {\n                    // 收起其他已展开的内容（同一篇文章只会有一个）\n                    // 同时重置所有按钮文本\n                    document.querySelectorAll(\'.full-content\').forEach(content => {\n                        content.classList.remove(\'show\');\n                    });\n                    document.querySelectorAll(\'.read-more-btn\').forEach(otherBtn => {\n                        otherBtn.innerHTML = \'阅读全文 →\';\n                    });\n\n                    // 展开当前目标\n                    targetContent.classList.add(\'show\');\n                    this.innerHTML = \'收起 ↑\';\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ===== 3. 回到顶部 =====\n        const backTop = document.getElementById(\'backTop\');\n\n        window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', function() {\n            // 页面滚动超过300px 显示按钮\n            if (window.scrollY > 300) {\n                backTop.classList.add(\'show\');\n            } else {\n                backTop.classList.remove(\'show\');\n            }\n        });\n\n        backTop.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n            window.scrollTo({\n                top: 0,\n                behavior: \'smooth\'\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ===== 4. 显示当前年份（页脚）=====\n        const footerYear = document.querySelector(\'.footer-inner div\');\n        // 已通过静态文案给出 2025，这里可忽略，但保留灵活性：\n        // 不需要额外处理\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n### 设计理念与视觉亮点\n\n页面以清爽、温和的视觉风格为基调，旨在营造适合阅读的安静的博客氛围。\n\n- **色彩与氛围**：以蓝灰色（`#4a6fa5`）作为主色调，传递冷静与可靠的专业感；搭配暖橙色的强调色（`#e67e22`），为页面增添一抹活力与温度。大面积使用的浅灰色背景（`#f7f8fa`）和白色卡片（`#ffffff`）形成了清晰的内容层级，让读者的视线自然聚焦于文章本身。\n- **布局与可读性**：采用经典的主栏加侧边栏的网格布局，主文章列表以独立卡片形式呈现，间距宽松，降低了密集阅读带来的压迫感。卡片内的元信息（日期、分类）用色彩和圆角徽章进行区分，帮助读者快速定位感兴趣的内容。\n- **交互与体验细节**：所有交互控件（如“阅读全文”按钮、移动端菜单按钮、回到顶部按钮）都经原生JavaScript实现，点击反馈平滑自然。卡片内的展开功能实现了手风琴式的互斥逻辑，避免页面信息显得杂乱，保证了阅读节奏的连续。\n\n---\n\n**优化建议：** 页面中的文章列表内容为演示数据，您可以替换为真实的文章标题与摘要。侧边栏的“关于站长”头像及分类计数，也建议更新为匹配您个人资料的真实信息。','ai',454812075701817344,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:09:18','2026-09-08 15:09:18',0),(454829705300971520,'生成一个简单的网站即可 不需要使用VUE工程模式','user',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:11:52','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454829736837943296,'\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 index.html\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>晨光书店 - 简单网站</title>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      color: #333;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    /* 导航 */\n    header {\n      background: #2c3e50;\n      padding: 16px 40px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n    }\n    .logo { color: #fff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; }\n    nav a {\n      color: #ddd;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      margin-left: 24px;\n      transition: color .2s;\n    }\n    nav a:hover { color: #f39c12; }\n    /* 横幅 */\n    .banner {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #8e44ad);\n      color: #fff;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 80px 20px;\n    }\n    .banner h1 { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n    .banner p { font-size: 18px; opacity: .9; }\n    /* 内容 */\n    main { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }\n    h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 28px; }\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .card {\n      border: 1px solid #eee;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\n      transition: transform .2s;\n    }\n    .card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); }\n    .card img { width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }\n    .card-body { padding: 16px; }\n    .card-body h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #2c3e50; }\n    .card-body p { color: #666; font-size: 14px; }\n    footer {\n      background: #2c3e50;\n      color: #aaa;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      header { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }\n      .banner h1 { font-size: 30px; }\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"logo\">📚 晨光书店</div>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#home\">首页</a>\n      <a href=\"#books\">热门图书</a>\n      <a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"banner\" id=\"home\">\n    <h1>阅读，遇见更好的自己</h1>\n    <p>精选好书，送货上门，让阅读成为习惯</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <main>\n    <h2 id=\"books\">热门图书推荐</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/book1/400/240\" alt=\"图书封面\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>《活着》</h3>\n          <p>余华经典之作，讲述人与命运之间的不屈抗争。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/book2/400/240\" alt=\"图书封面\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>《百年孤独》</h3>\n          <p>马尔克斯的魔幻现实主义代表作，值得反复品读。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/book3/400/240\" alt=\"图书封面\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>《小王子》</h3>\n          <p>写给大人的童话，关于爱与责任的温暖寓言。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <p>© 2024 晨光书店 · 让阅读点亮生活</p>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n\n\n抱歉，当前文件工具环境持续报错（NullPointerException），无法成功创建文件，我已停止重试。\n\n请在新会话中重新发起\"生成一个简单网站\"的需求，届时工具恢复后即可正常生成完整可用的页面。','ai',454822130371170304,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:11:59','2026-09-09 13:59:31',1),(454829953377275904,'构建一个功能完整的在线商城，包含商品展示、购物车、用户注册登录、订单管理、支付结算等功能。设计现代化的商品卡片布局，支持商品搜索筛选、用户评价、优惠券系统和会员积分功能。','user',454829952114790400,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:12:51','2026-09-09 13:59:16',1),(454831070249189376,'简单的关于小猫的页面','user',454831066751139840,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:17:17','2026-09-09 13:59:24',1),(454831216542318592,'下面是一个关于小猫的静态展示页面HTML代码，包含导航、英雄区、特征介绍、品种卡片和页脚，适合简单浏览与信息展示。\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>可爱的小猫世界</title>\n    <style>\n        /* ===== 全局重置与基础样式 ===== */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n            color: #2c2c2c;\n            background: #fdf8f4;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            display: block;\n        }\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 工具类 ===== */\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .section-subtitle {\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #888;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 导航栏 ===== */\n        .navbar {\n            background: rgba(250, 240, 230, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            position: sticky;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 999;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n        }\n\n        .navbar .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            height: 70px;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #e0795a;\n        }\n\n        .logo .cat-icon {\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            list-style: none;\n            gap: 32px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            transition: color 0.3s;\n            padding: 6px 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n        }\n        .nav-menu a:hover {\n            color: #e0795a;\n            border-bottom-color: #e0795a;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            color: #444;\n        }\n\n        /* 移动端菜单 */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: fixed;\n                top: 70px;\n                left: 0;\n                width: 100%;\n                background: #fdf8f4;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: center;\n                gap: 0;\n                box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n                max-height: 0;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                transition: max-height 0.4s ease;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.open {\n                max-height: 320px;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu li {\n                width: 100%;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu a {\n                display: block;\n                padding: 14px 0;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n            }\n            .nav-menu a:hover {\n                border-color: #eee;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 英雄区 ===== */\n        .hero {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3e0 0%, #faddc4 100%);\n            padding: 80px 0 60px;\n        }\n        .hero .container {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 60px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-text h1 {\n            font-size: 3.2rem;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n            color: #2c2c2c;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n        .hero-text h1 span {\n            color: #e0795a;\n        }\n        .hero-text p {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            color: #666;\n            margin-bottom: 28px;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #e0795a;\n            color: #fff;\n            padding: 14px 36px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: #c95f43;\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(224, 121, 90, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image {\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .hero-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 420px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            transition: transform 0.4s;\n        }\n        .hero-image:hover img {\n            transform: scale(1.02);\n        }\n\n        /* 响应式 */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .hero {\n                padding: 50px 0 40px;\n            }\n            .hero .container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 30px;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n            .hero-text h1 {\n                font-size: 2.4rem;\n            }\n            .hero-image img {\n                height: 280px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 特征区 ===== */\n        .features {\n            padding: 80px 0;\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .cards-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card {\n            background: #fdf8f4;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 30px 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n            transition: all 0.4s;\n            border: 2px solid transparent;\n        }\n        .feature-card:hover {\n            border-color: #e0795a;\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(224, 121, 90, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .feature-icon {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n        }\n        .feature-card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .feature-card p {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 992px) {\n            .cards-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .cards-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 品种区 ===== */\n        .breeds-section {\n            padding: 80px 0;\n            background: #fdf8f4;\n        }\n\n        .breeds-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .breed-card {\n            background: #fff;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n            transition: all 0.4s;\n        }\n        .breed-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.01);\n            box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        .breed-card img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 230px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n        }\n\n        .breed-info {\n            padding: 22px;\n        }\n        .breed-info h3 {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .breed-info p {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #888;\n        }\n\n        /* Tab切换 */\n        .tab-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        .tab-btn {\n            background: #fff;\n            border: 2px solid #e5d8cd;\n            padding: 8px 28px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n            color: #666;\n        }\n        .tab-btn:hover {\n            border-color: #e0795a;\n            color: #e0795a;\n        }\n        .tab-btn.active {\n            background: #e0795a;\n            border-color: #e0795a;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 992px) {\n            .breeds-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            .breeds-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 页脚 ===== */\n        footer {\n            background: #2c2c2c;\n            color: #aaa;\n            padding: 50px 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-logo {\n            color: #fff;\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        .footer-col p {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            max-width: 280px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-col h4 {\n            color: #fff;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n        }\n        .footer-col ul {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n        .footer-col li {\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .footer-col a {\n            color: #aaa;\n            transition: color 0.3s;\n        }\n        .footer-col a:hover {\n            color: #e0795a;\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            border-top: 1px solid #444;\n            padding-top: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: #666;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- ===== 导航栏 ===== -->\n    <nav class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\n                <span class=\"cat-icon\">🐱</span> 小猫星球\n            </a>\n\n            <button class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\">☰</button>\n\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#features\">特征</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#breeds\">猫咪品种</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contact\">关于我们</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- ===== 英雄区 ===== -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"hero-text\">\n                <h1>爱猫的人，<br>内心都有一片<span>柔软的宇宙</span>。</h1>\n                <p>猫咪是这个星球上最令人着迷的小生灵之一。下面让我们一起走进猫的世界，了解它们的魅力所在。</p>\n                <a href=\"#breeds\" class=\"btn-primary\">探索猫咪品种</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-image\">\n                <img\n                src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/cat-hero/800/600\"\n                alt=\"一只可爱的猫\"\n                >\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== 特征区 ===== -->\n<section class=\"features\" id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">猫咪的迷人之处</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\">每一个细节都让人着迷</p>\n\n        <div class=\"cards-grid\">\n            <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">🐾</div>\n                <h3>敏捷灵巧</h3>\n                <p>猫咪天生拥有出色的弹跳力和平衡感，总是优雅地行走在高处。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">😻</div>\n                <h3>治愈人心</h3>\n                <p>研究表明，与猫互动能有效降低压力，带来平静与愉悦。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">🎓</div>\n                <h3>独行侠</h3>\n                <p>猫独立而不依赖，却也渴望陪伴——像一位有品味的朋友。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                <div class=\"feature-icon\">🧶</div>\n                <h3>好奇心</h3>\n                <p>它们对周围世界永远保持着惊人的好奇心，从不厌倦日常的趣味。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== 品种区 ===== -->\n<section class=\"breeds-section\" id=\"breeds\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">人气猫咪品种</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle\">点击标签查看不同品种的猫咪</p>\n\n        <!-- Tab 切换 -->\n        <div class=\"tab-buttons\">\n            <button class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"all\">全部</button>\n            <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"longhair\">长毛猫</button>\n            <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"shorthair\">短毛猫</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 使用 JS 动态渲染的卡片容器 -->\n        <div class=\"breeds-grid\" id=\"breedsGrid\"></div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ===== 页脚 ===== -->\n<footer id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"footer-content\">\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                <div class=\"footer-logo\">🐱 小猫星球</div>\n                <p>一个分享关于猫咪的一切可爱与奇妙的地方。愿你每天都有小猫咪的温柔陪伴。</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                <h4>快速链接</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\">首页</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#features\">特征介绍</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#breeds\">猫咪品种</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                <h4>联系我</h4>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"mailto:hello@catplanet.com\">hello@catplanet.com</a></li>\n                    <li>📞 +86 138 0000 0000</li>\n                    <li>📍 广州市荔湾区恩宁路</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n            &copy; 2025 小猫星球 · 用 💕 制作\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n    // ===== 移动端导航菜单 =====\n    const navToggle = document.getElementById(\'navToggle\');\n    const navMenu = document.getElementById(\'navMenu\');\n\n    navToggle.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n        navMenu.classList.toggle(\'open\');\n    });\n\n    // 点击菜单项后自动关闭移动端菜单\n    navMenu.querySelectorAll(\'a\').forEach(function(link) {\n        link.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n            navMenu.classList.remove(\'open\');\n        });\n    });\n\n    // ===== Tab 切换 + 品种卡片渲染 =====\n    // 定义品种数据（图片使用 picsum.photos 占位）\n\n    const catsData = {\n        all: [\n            { name: \'英国短毛猫\', desc: \'体格圆胖、性格温顺，标志性的\"蓝猫\"颜色深入人心。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-british-1\' },\n            { name: \'波斯猫\', desc: \'举止优雅的长毛猫，脸部扁平，性情安静亲人。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-persian-2\' },\n            { name: \'暹罗猫\', desc: \'短毛猫中的贵族，拥有醒目的重点色和湛蓝的眼睛。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-siamese-3\' },\n            { name: \'布偶猫\', desc: \'像布偶一样柔软优雅，蓝宝石般的眼睛令人沉醉。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-ragdoll-4\' },\n            { name: \'橘猫\', desc: \'短毛猫中的小吃货，性格温暖且十分粘人。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-orange-5\' },\n            { name: \'缅因猫\', desc: \'长毛猫中的庞然大物，极亲人和聪明，是理想的伙伴。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-maine-6\' },\n            { name: \'狸花猫\', desc: \'中国本土短毛猫，身上带花纹，性格独立而机敏。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-lihua-7\' },\n            { name: \'挪威森林猫\', desc: \'长毛猫品种，性格友善坚韧，尾巴像松鼠一样蓬松。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-forest-8\' },\n            { name: \'加菲猫\', desc: \'异国短毛猫，大饼脸加圆眼睛，呆萌又爱撒娇。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-garfield-9\' },\n        ],\n        longhair: [\n            { name: \'波斯猫\', desc: \'举止优雅的长毛猫，脸部扁平，性情安静亲人。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-persian-2\' },\n            { name: \'布偶猫\', desc: \'像布偶一样柔软优雅，蓝宝石般的眼睛令人沉醉。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-ragdoll-4\' },\n            { name: \'缅因猫\', desc: \'长毛猫中的庞然大物，极亲人和聪明，是理想的伙伴。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-maine-6\' },\n            { name: \'挪威森林猫\', desc: \'长毛猫品种，性格友善坚韧，尾巴像松鼠一样蓬松。\', type: \'longhair\', seed: \'cat-forest-8\' },\n        ],\n        shorthair: [\n            { name: \'英国短毛猫\', desc: \'体格圆胖、性格温顺，标志性的\"蓝猫\"颜色深入人心。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-british-1\' },\n            { name: \'暹罗猫\', desc: \'短毛猫中的贵族，拥有醒目的重点色和湛蓝的眼睛。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-siamese-3\' },\n            { name: \'橘猫\', desc: \'短毛猫中的小吃货，性格温暖且十分粘人。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-orange-5\' },\n            { name: \'狸花猫\', desc: \'中国本土短毛猫，身上带花纹，性格独立而机敏。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-lihua-7\' },\n            { name: \'加菲猫\', desc: \'异国短毛猫，大饼脸加圆眼睛，呆萌又爱撒娇。\', type: \'shorthair\', seed: \'cat-garfield-9\' },\n        ]\n    };\n\n    // 获取 DOM 中的容器\n    const breedsGrid = document.getElementById(\'breedsGrid\');\n\n    // 渲染卡片\n    function renderBreeds(key) {\n        const items = catsData[key];\n        // 清空容器\n        breedsGrid.innerHTML = \'\';\n        items.forEach(function(cat) {\n            const card = document.createElement(\'div\');\n            card.className = \'breed-card\';\n\n            // 每个品类用内置 800/600 的图（picsum 允许相同 seed）\n            const imgUrl = \'https://picsum.photos/seed/\' + cat.seed + \'/800/600\';\n\n            card.innerHTML = `\n                <img src=\"${imgUrl}\" alt=\"${cat.name}\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"breed-info\">\n                    <h3>🐈 ${cat.name}</h3>\n                    <p>${cat.desc}</p>\n                </div>\n            `;\n            breedsGrid.appendChild(card);\n        });\n    }\n\n    // 监听 Tab 切换按钮\n    const tabButtons = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-btn\');\n    tabButtons.forEach(function(btn) {\n        btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n            // 高亮当前 tab\n            tabButtons.forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove(\'active\'); });\n            btn.classList.add(\'active\');\n\n            // 重新渲染列表\n            const key = btn.getAttribute(\'data-tab\');\n            renderBreeds(key);\n        });\n    });\n\n    // 页面加载后首次渲染\n    renderBreeds(\'all\');\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n### 视觉亮点\n\n页面围绕“可爱小猫”主题，营造温暖、治愈、亲切的视觉氛围。\n\n布局上，尺寸不同的圆形猫咪图像叠加排布，能容纳更多产品细节。导航与页面交互按钮保持样式统一，用户可快速筛选查看不同猫咪品种，操作直观流畅。\n\n配色以奶油色和柔和的橘色为主要基调，配合圆角卡片和柔和阴影，带来如毛绒般的包裹感。文字使用深灰色，配合留白，保证阅读舒适。这种风格适合传递猫咪的温顺、柔软和治愈感，让浏览者产生情感共鸣。','ai',454831066751139840,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:17:52','2026-09-09 13:59:24',1),(454833754876284928,'简单的商城页面 不要使用VUE项目模式','user',454833752695246848,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:27:57','2026-09-08 15:27:57',0),(454834365927657472,'以下是完整可直接运行的商城页面 HTML 代码：\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>乐品商城 - 精选好物</title>\n  <style>\n    /*************** CSS 变量与基础样式 ***************/\n    :root {\n      --primary: #4f46e5;\n      --primary-light: #818cf8;\n      --primary-bg: #eef2ff;\n      --text-main: #1e293b;\n      --text-secondary: #64748b;\n      --text-light: #94a3b8;\n      --border: #e2e8f0;\n      --bg: #f6f7fb;\n      --white: #ffffff;\n      --danger: #ef4444;\n      --radius: 14px;\n      --shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    * {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto,\n        \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n\n    button {\n      font-family: inherit;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    img {\n      display: block;\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    a {\n      text-decoration: none;\n      color: inherit;\n    }\n\n    /*************** 导航栏 ***************/\n    .navbar {\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 100;\n      height: 64px;\n      padding: 0 32px;\n      background: var(--white);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    .logo {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      user-select: none;\n    }\n\n    .logo-badge {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: var(--white);\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 28px;\n      list-style: none;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n      padding: 6px 2px;\n      transition: color .2s;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a::after {\n      content: \'\';\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 2px;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      border-radius: 2px;\n      transform: scaleX(0);\n      transition: transform .2s;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a:hover,\n    .nav-links a.active {\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a:hover::after,\n    .nav-links a.active::after {\n      transform: scaleX(1);\n    }\n\n    .nav-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-btn {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      border: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      transition: background .2s;\n    }\n\n    .cart-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--primary-bg);\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .cart-count {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 2px;\n      right: 2px;\n      display: none;\n      min-width: 18px;\n      height: 18px;\n      padding: 0 5px;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: var(--danger);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    .cart-count.bump {\n      animation: countBump .35s ease;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes countBump {\n      0% { transform: scale(1); }\n      35% { transform: scale(1.45); }\n      100% { transform: scale(1); }\n    }\n\n    /*************** Hero 横幅 ***************/\n    .hero {\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--primary-bg), var(--bg));\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 56px 24px 32px;\n    }\n\n    .hero h1 {\n      font-size: 36px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .hero p {\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n      font-size: 16px;\n      max-width: 520px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    /*************** 主体容器 ***************/\n    .container {\n      max-width: 1260px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 24px 24px 56px;\n    }\n\n    .section-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 28px;\n    }\n\n    .section-header h2 {\n      font-size: 26px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    .section-header p {\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n      font-size: 14px;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n\n    /*************** 商品网格 ***************/\n    .product-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n      gap: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .product-card {\n      background: var(--white);\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      border: 1px solid #eef2f6;\n      transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .product-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-6px);\n      box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.09);\n    }\n\n    .product-media {\n      width: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 1;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #f1f5f9;\n    }\n\n    .product-media img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      transition: transform .45s ease;\n    }\n\n    .product-card:hover .product-media img {\n      transform: scale(1.06);\n    }\n\n    .product-body {\n      padding: 16px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .product-category {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .product-name {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .product-desc {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n      flex: 1;\n      display: -webkit-box;\n      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .product-footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 8px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    .product-price {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--danger);\n    }\n\n    .product-price::before {\n      content: \'¥\';\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .add-btn {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      border: none;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      padding: 9px 16px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      transition: background .2s, transform .1s;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);\n    }\n\n    .add-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--primary-light);\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.28);\n    }\n\n    .add-btn:active {\n      transform: scale(0.96);\n    }\n\n    /*************** 页脚 ***************/\n    .footer {\n      background: var(--white);\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding: 28px 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .footer p {\n      color: var(--text-light);\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    /*************** 遮罩层 ***************/\n    .overlay {\n      position: fixed;\n      inset: 0;\n      z-index: 200;\n      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);\n      opacity: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      transition: opacity .3s;\n    }\n\n    .overlay.show {\n      opacity: 1;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    /*************** 购物车抽屉 ***************/\n    .cart-drawer {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      z-index: 300;\n      height: 100%;\n      width: 390px;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      background: var(--white);\n      box-shadow: -8px 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      transform: translateX(100%);\n      transition: transform .35s ease;\n    }\n\n    .cart-drawer.open {\n      transform: translateX(0);\n    }\n\n    .cart-drawer-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 20px 20px 14px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n    }\n\n    .cart-drawer-header h3 {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    .close-btn {\n      width: 34px;\n      height: 34px;\n      border: none;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      transition: background .2s, color .2s;\n    }\n\n    .close-btn:hover {\n      background: #fee2e2;\n      color: var(--danger);\n    }\n\n    .cart-items {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 8px 20px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-items::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-items::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: var(--border);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-empty {\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 60px 20px;\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n    }\n\n    .cart-empty svg {\n      width: 64px;\n      height: 64px;\n      color: var(--border);\n      margin: 0 auto 16px;\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .cart-empty-desc {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: var(--text-light);\n      margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 14px;\n      padding: 14px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-img {\n      width: 76px;\n      height: 76px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      background: #f1f5f9;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-info {\n      flex: 1;\n      min-width: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-name {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-price {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--danger);\n      margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 2px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-actions button {\n      width: 26px;\n      height: 26px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--white);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      transition: all .15s;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-actions button:hover {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      color: var(--primary);\n      background: var(--primary-bg);\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-actions .remove-btn {\n      border: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      color: var(--text-light);\n      margin-left: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-actions .remove-btn:hover {\n      color: var(--danger);\n      background: #fee2e2;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-item-quantity {\n      min-width: 26px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .cart-footer {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: #fafbfc;\n      padding: 18px 20px 20px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-total {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .cart-total span {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .cart-total span:last-child {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--danger);\n    }\n\n    .checkout-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 13px;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      transition: background .2s, transform .1s;\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.22);\n    }\n\n    .checkout-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--primary-light);\n    }\n\n    .checkout-btn:active {\n      transform: scale(0.98);\n    }\n\n    /*************** Toast 提示 ***************/\n    .toast {\n      position: fixed;\n      bottom: 32px;\n      left: 50%;\n      z-index: 999;\n      background: #1e293b;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      padding: 12px 22px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35);\n      opacity: 0;\n      visibility: hidden;\n      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(16px);\n      transition: all .3s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .toast.show {\n      opacity: 1;\n      visibility: visible;\n      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);\n    }\n\n    /*************** 响应式适配 ***************/\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .navbar {\n        padding: 0 16px;\n      }\n\n      .nav-links {\n        display: none;\n      }\n\n      .hero {\n        padding: 40px 16px 24px;\n      }\n\n      .hero h1 {\n        font-size: 28px;\n      }\n\n      .hero p {\n        font-size: 14px;\n      }\n\n      .container {\n        padding: 16px 16px 40px;\n      }\n\n      .section-header {\n        margin-bottom: 18px;\n      }\n\n      .section-header h2 {\n        font-size: 20px;\n      }\n\n      .product-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));\n        gap: 12px;\n      }\n\n      .product-body {\n        padding: 12px;\n      }\n\n      .product-name {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        margin-bottom: 4px;\n      }\n\n      .product-desc {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n      }\n\n      .product-price {\n        font-size: 18px;\n      }\n\n      .product-price::before {\n        font-size: 12px;\n      }\n\n      .add-btn {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        padding: 8px 10px;\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        width: 100%;\n        justify-content: center;\n      }\n\n      .product-footer {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: stretch;\n      }\n\n      .cart-drawer {\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 380px) {\n      .product-body {\n        padding: 10px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <!-- ==================== 顶部导航 ==================== -->\n  <header class=\"navbar\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      🛍️ 乐品商城\n      <span class=\"logo-badge\">LUPIN</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"active\">首页</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">全部商品</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">新品热卖</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">关于我们</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"nav-actions\">\n      <button class=\"cart-btn\" id=\"cart-btn\" aria-label=\"打开购物车\">\n        <!-- 购物车图标 -->\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\"\n             stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n             stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle>\n          <path d=\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\"></path>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"cart-count\" id=\"cart-count\">0</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- ==================== Hero 区域 ==================== -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <h1>发现生活之美</h1>\n    <p>精心挑选的每一件好物，只为让日常更有质感</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ==================== 商品列表 ==================== -->\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>🔥 精选商品</h2>\n        <p>热门推荐 · 品质之选</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"product-grid\" class=\"product-grid\"></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ==================== 页脚 ==================== -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <p>© 2024 乐品商城  ·  用心挑选每一件好物</p>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- ==================== 购物车遮罩层 ==================== -->\n  <div class=\"overlay\" id=\"overlay\"></div>\n\n  <!-- ==================== 购物车抽屉 ==================== -->\n  <aside class=\"cart-drawer\" id=\"cart-drawer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"cart-drawer-header\">\n      <h3>🛒 我的购物车</h3>\n      <button class=\"close-btn\" id=\"close-cart\" aria-label=\"关闭购物车\">✕</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cart-items\" id=\"cart-items\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cart-footer\" id=\"cart-footer\">\n      <div class=\"cart-total\">\n        <span>合计</span>\n        <span id=\"cart-total\">¥0</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"checkout-btn\" id=\"checkout-btn\">去结算</button>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <!-- ==================== Toast 横幅 ==================== -->\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\"></div>\n\n  <script>\n    /*************** 商品数据（模拟） ***************/\n    const products = [\n      {\n        id: 1,\n        name: \'极简城市通勤背包\',\n        category: \'箱包\',\n        price: 298,\n        image: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/urbanpack/600/600\',\n        desc: \'防泼水面料，多分隔收纳设计，日常通勤与短途出行都很合适。\'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 2,\n        name: \'经典纯棉白T恤\',\n        category: \'服饰\',\n        price: 89,\n        image: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/whitetshirt/600/600\',\n        desc: \'新疆长绒棉材质，柔软亲肤，洗后不易变形，衣橱必备百搭款。\'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 3,\n        name: \'轻便缓震跑步鞋\',\n        category: \'运动\',\n        price: 399,\n        image: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/runningshoes/600/600\',\n        desc: \'回弹缓震中底，透气网面鞋身，为每一次奔跑提供稳定支撑。\'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 4,\n        name: \'高性能智能手表\',\n        category: \'数码\',\n        price: 1299,\n        image: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/smartwatch/600/600\',\n        desc: \'心率血氧实时监测，50米防水，全天候守护你的每一刻。\'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 5,\n        name: \'主动降噪无线耳机\',\n        category: \'数码\',\n        price: 699,\n        image: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/headphone/600/600\',\n        desc: \'40dB 深度主动降噪，30小时超长续航，沉浸式静听体验。\'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 6,\n        name: \'手工陶艺马克杯\',\n        category: \'生活\',\n        price: 59,\n        image: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/coffeecup/600/600\',\n        desc: \'匠人手作温润釉色，每一只都独一无二，让喝水也有仪式感。\'\n      }\n    ];\n\n    /*************** 状态与 DOM 元素 ***************/\n    let cart = [];             // 购物车数组：{ product, quantity }\n    let toastTimer = null;\n\n    const productGrid = document.getElementById(\'product-grid\');\n    const cartItemsEl = document.getElementById(\'cart-items\');\n    const cartFooterEl = document.getElementById(\'cart-footer\');\n    const cartCountEl = document.getElementById(\'cart-count\');\n    const cartTotalEl = document.getElementById(\'cart-total\');\n    const cartDrawerEl = document.getElementById(\'cart-drawer\');\n    const overlayEl = document.getElementById(\'overlay\');\n    const cartBtn = document.getElementById(\'cart-btn\');\n    const closeCartBtn = document.getElementById(\'close-cart\');\n    const checkoutBtn = document.getElementById(\'checkout-btn\');\n    const toastEl = document.getElementById(\'toast\');\n\n    /*************** 商品列表渲染 ***************/\n    function renderProducts() {\n      productGrid.innerHTML = products.map(product => `\n        <article class=\"product-card\">\n          <div class=\"product-media\">\n            <img src=\"${product.image}\" alt=\"${product.name}\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"product-body\">\n            <span class=\"product-category\">${product.category}</span>\n            <h3 class=\"product-name\">${product.name}</h3>\n            <p class=\"product-desc\">${product.desc}</p>\n            <div class=\"product-footer\">\n              <span class=\"product-price\">${product.price}</span>\n              <button class=\"add-btn\" data-id=\"${product.id}\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\"\n                     stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                  <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"></line>\n                  <line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"8\"></line>\n                </svg>\n                加入购物车\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      `).join(\'\');\n    }\n\n    /*************** 购物车 UI 更新 ***************/\n    function updateCartUI() {\n      const totalCount = cart.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.quantity, 0);\n\n      // 导航栏角标\n      cartCountEl.textContent = totalCount;\n      cartCountEl.style.display = totalCount > 0 ? \'flex\' : \'none\';\n\n      // 购物车为空状态\n      if (cart.length === 0) {\n        cartItemsEl.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"cart-empty\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                 stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle>\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle>\n              <path d=\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <p>购物车还是空的</p>\n            <p class=\"cart-empty-desc\">快去挑选心仪的商品吧！</p>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        cartFooterEl.style.display = \'none\';\n        return;\n      }\n\n      /* 渲染购物车列表 */\n      cartItemsEl.innerHTML = cart.map(({ product, quantity }) => {\n        const thumbUrl = product.image.replace(\'/600/600\', \'/200/200\');\n        return `\n          <div class=\"cart-item\">\n            <img class=\"cart-item-img\" src=\"${thumbUrl}\" alt=\"${product.name}\">\n            <div class=\"cart-item-info\">\n              <h4 class=\"cart-item-name\">${product.name}</h4>\n              <div class=\"cart-item-price\">¥${product.price}</div>\n              <div class=\"cart-item-actions\">\n                <button data-action=\"decrease\" data-id=\"${product.id}\" aria-label=\"减少数量\">−</button>\n                <span class=\"cart-item-quantity\">${quantity}</span>\n                <button data-action=\"increase\" data-id=\"${product.id}\" aria-label=\"增加数量\">+</button>\n                <button class=\"remove-btn\" data-action=\"remove\" data-id=\"${product.id}\" title=\"删除商品\" aria-label=\"删除商品\">\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\"\n                       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                    <polyline points=\"3 6 5 6 21 6\"></polyline>\n                    <path d=\"M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n      }).join(\'\');\n\n      // 购物车底部信息\n      cartFooterEl.style.display = \'block\';\n      const total = cart.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.product.price * item.quantity, 0);\n      cartTotalEl.textContent = `¥${total}`;\n    }\n\n    /*************** 加入购物车 ***************/\n    function addToCart(productId) {\n      const product = products.find(p => p.id === productId);\n      if (!product) return;\n\n      const foundItem = cart.find(item => item.product.id === productId);\n      if (foundItem) {\n        foundItem.quantity += 1;\n      } else {\n        cart.push({ product, quantity: 1 });\n      }\n\n      updateCartUI();\n      bumpCartCount();\n      showToast(`${product.name} 已加入购物车`);\n    }\n\n    // 购物车角标弹跳动画\n    function bumpCartCount() {\n      cartCountEl.classList.remove(\'bump\');\n      void cartCountEl.offsetWidth; // 强制触发 reflow\n      cartCountEl.classList.add(\'bump\');\n    }\n\n    /*************** 购物车打开 / 关闭 ***************/\n    function openCart() {\n      cartDrawerEl.classList.add(\'open\');\n      overlayEl.classList.add(\'show\');\n      cartDrawerEl.setAttribute(\'aria-hidden\', \'false\');\n      document.body.style.overflow = \'hidden\';\n    }\n\n    function closeCart() {\n      cartDrawerEl.classList.remove(\'open\');\n      overlayEl.classList.remove(\'show\');\n      cartDrawerEl.setAttribute(\'aria-hidden\', \'true\');\n      document.body.style.overflow = \'\';\n    }\n\n    cartBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', openCart);\n    closeCartBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', closeCart);\n    overlayEl.addEventListener(\'click\', closeCart);\n    document.addEventListener(\'keydown\', (e) => {\n      if (e.key === \'Escape\') closeCart();\n    });\n\n    /*************** 事件委托：购物车数量操作 ***************/\n    cartItemsEl.addEventListener(\'click\', (e) => {\n      const btn = e.target.closest(\'[data-action]\');\n      if (!btn) return;\n\n      const { action, id } = btn.dataset;\n      const productId = Number(id);\n      const item = cart.find(i => i.product.id === productId);\n      if (!item) return;\n\n      if (action === \'increase\') {\n        item.quantity += 1;\n      } else if (action === \'decrease\') {\n        item.quantity -= 1;\n        if (item.quantity <= 0) {\n          cart = cart.filter(i => i.product.id !== productId);\n        }\n      } else if (action === \'remove\') {\n        cart = cart.filter(i => i.product.id !== productId);\n      }\n\n      updateCartUI();\n    });\n\n    /*************** 去结算（模拟） ***************/\n    checkoutBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\n      if (cart.length === 0) return;\n\n      cart = [];\n      updateCartUI();\n      closeCart();\n      showToast(\'✅ 模拟支付成功，感谢你的购买！\');\n    });\n\n    /*************** Toast 提示 ***************/\n    function showToast(message) {\n      toastEl.textContent = message;\n      toastEl.classList.add(\'show\');\n      clearTimeout(toastTimer);\n      toastTimer = setTimeout(() => {\n        toastEl.classList.remove(\'show\');\n      }, 2200);\n    }\n\n    /*************** 事件委托：加入购物车 ***************/\n    productGrid.addEventListener(\'click\', (e) => {\n      const btn = e.target.closest(\'.add-btn\');\n      if (!btn) return;\n      addToCart(Number(btn.dataset.id));\n    });\n\n    /*************** 导航链接点击（纯演示） ***************/\n    document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-links a\').forEach(link => {\n      link.addEventListener(\'click\', (e) => {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-links a\').forEach(a => a.classList.remove(\'active\'));\n        link.classList.add(\'active\');\n      });\n    });\n\n    /*************** 初始化 ***************/\n    renderProducts();\n    updateCartUI();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```','ai',454833752695246848,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 15:30:23','2026-09-08 15:30:23',0),(454879452170719232,'简单网页','user',454879448563617792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 18:29:32','2026-09-09 13:59:10',1),(454879666285744128,'```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>简单网页 · 山月创意工作室</title>\n    <!-- 所有样式内联于本<style>标签内 -->\n    <style>\n        /* ===== 基础重置与全局变量 ===== */\n        :root {\n            --color-primary: #4A6CF7;\n            --color-secondary: #6C63FF;\n            --color-dark: #1E293B;\n            --color-gray: #64748B;\n            --color-light: #F8FAFC;\n            --color-border: #E2E8F0;\n            --shadow-card: 0 4px 20px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);\n            --radius: 16px;\n            --transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif;\n            color: var(--color-dark);\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        button {\n            font-family: inherit;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            border: none;\n            background: none;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 24px;\n        }\n\n        section {\n            padding: 80px 0;\n        }\n\n        .text-center {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 2.2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        .section-subtitle {\n            color: var(--color-gray);\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n            max-width: 560px;\n            margin-left: auto;\n            margin-right: auto;\n            margin-bottom: 48px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 导航栏 ===== */\n        .navbar {\n            position: sticky;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.7);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .navbar .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            height: 70px;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: var(--color-dark);\n        }\n\n        .logo span {\n            color: var(--color-primary);\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 8px 20px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-gray);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a:hover,\n        .nav-menu a.active {\n            color: var(--color-primary);\n            background-color: rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.08);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            background-color: var(--color-primary) !important;\n            color: #FFFFFF !important;\n            padding: 10px 24px !important;\n            margin-left: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background-color: #3B5DE7 !important;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.35);\n        }\n\n        /* 汉堡按钮 — 移动端 */\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            padding: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle span {\n            width: 22px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background-color: var(--color-dark);\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        /* ===== Hero区域 ===== */\n        .hero {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EEF2FF 0%, #F8FAFC 50%, #FFFFFF 100%);\n            padding: 100px 0 80px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .hero .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 60px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            flex: 1.1;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.1);\n            color: var(--color-primary);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 6px 16px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title .highlight {\n            background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-secondary));\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            background-clip: text;\n        }\n\n        .hero-desc {\n            color: var(--color-gray);\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 32px;\n            max-width: 500px;\n        }\n\n        .btn-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 14px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 12px 28px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background-color: var(--color-primary);\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.35);\n        }\n\n        .btn-outline {\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-border);\n            color: var(--color-dark);\n            background: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .btn-outline:hover {\n            border-color: var(--color-primary);\n            color: var(--color-primary);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image {\n            flex: 0.9;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.15);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 420px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 特性卡片区 ===== */\n        .features {\n            background-color: var(--color-light);\n        }\n\n        .feature-grid {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card {\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            border-radius: var(--radius);\n            padding: 36px 28px;\n            flex: 1 1 280px;\n            max-width: 360px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);\n            text-align: center;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-6px);\n            border-color: rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.3);\n            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        .feature-icon {\n            width: 64px;\n            height: 64px;\n            border-radius: 18px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EFF2FF, #E0E7FF);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n            margin: 0 auto 20px;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card p {\n            color: var(--color-gray);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            line-height: 1.55;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 作品画廊 / 轮播 ===== */\n        .carousel-section {\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .simple-carousel {\n            max-width: 860px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-track-container {\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            transition: transform 0.5s ease;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide {\n            min-width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 460px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            padding: 40px 28px 20px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), transparent);\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption h3 {\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption p {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            opacity: 0.9;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-indicators {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 18px;\n            right: 24px;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .indicator-dot {\n            width: 8px;\n            height: 8px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .indicator-dot.active-dot {\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            transform: scale(1.3);\n        }\n\n        .carousel-btn {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n            color: var(--color-dark);\n            width: 44px;\n            height: 44px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n            z-index: 5;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-btn:hover {\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.08);\n        }\n\n        .prev-btn {\n            left: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .next-btn {\n            right: 18px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== Tab 交互区 ===== */\n        .tabs-section {\n            background-color: var(--color-light);\n        }\n\n        .tab-panels {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);\n            padding: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .tab-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 6px;\n            margin-bottom: 28px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);\n            padding-bottom: 16px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn {\n            padding: 8px 20px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--color-gray);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn:hover {\n            background-color: rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.08);\n            color: var(--color-primary);\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn.active-tab {\n            background-color: var(--color-primary);\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.25);\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel {\n            display: none;\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease;\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel.active-panel {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeInUp {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(15px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .panel-title {\n            font-size: 1.45rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 14px;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content {\n            color: var(--color-gray);\n            line-height: 1.8;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content li {\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .panel-flex {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 24px;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .panel-flex img {\n            width: 200px;\n            height: 160px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            border-radius: 14px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 联系表单 ===== */\n        .contact {\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .contact-wrapper {\n            max-width: 640px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .form-group label {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--color-dark);\n        }\n\n        .form-group input,\n        .form-group textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 12px 18px;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-border);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            font-family: inherit;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n            background-color: #FBFDFF;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input:focus,\n        .form-group textarea:focus {\n            border-color: var(--color-primary);\n            outline: none;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.12);\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .form-group textarea {\n            min-height: 120px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .contact-submit-btn {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 14px 28px;\n            background-color: var(--color-primary);\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: var(--transition);\n        }\n\n        .contact-submit-btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.35);\n        }\n\n        /* 表单提交成功消息提示 简单实现 */\n        .form-message {\n            display: none;\n            background-color: #D1FAE5;\n            color: #065F46;\n            padding: 14px 18px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            margin-top: 16px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 页脚 ===== */\n        .footer {\n            background-color: var(--color-dark);\n            color: #CBD5E1;\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n\n        .footer-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .footer .logo {\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer .logo span {\n            color: #93B4FF;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 24px;\n            list-style: none;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .copyright {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            margin-top: 24px;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 滚动到顶部按钮 ===== */\n        .back-to-top {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 30px;\n            right: 30px;\n            width: 48px;\n            height: 48px;\n            background-color: var(--color-primary);\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.3);\n            opacity: 0;\n            visibility: hidden;\n            transform: translateY(12px);\n            transition: var(--transition);\n            z-index: 999;\n        }\n\n        .back-to-top.show {\n            opacity: 1;\n            visibility: visible;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        .back-to-top:hover {\n            background-color: #3B5DE7;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 响应式友好 ===== */\n\n        /* 平板及以下 */\n        @media (max-width: 992px) {\n            .hero .container {\n                flex-direction: column-reverse;\n                gap: 40px;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-desc {\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n            }\n\n            .hero-image img {\n                height: 320px;\n            }\n\n            .hero-title {\n                font-size: 2.4rem;\n            }\n\n        }\n\n        /* 移动端 */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 70px;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background-color: #FFFFFF;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: 20px 24px;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n                transform: translateY(-110%);\n                transition: var(--transition);\n                align-items: stretch;\n                opacity: 0;\n                pointer-events: none;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.open {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n                opacity: 1;\n                pointer-events: auto;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu a {\n                display: block;\n                padding: 12px 16px;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .nav-cta {\n                margin-left: 0;\n                margin-top: 4px;\n            }\n\n            /* 轮播图高度调整 */\n            .carousel-slide img {\n                height: 300px;\n            }\n\n            .hero {\n                padding: 60px 0;\n            }\n\n            .hero-title {\n                font-size: 2.2rem;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                padding: 60px 0;\n            }\n\n            .panel-flex {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n\n            .panel-flex img {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: auto;\n            }\n\n            .tab-panels {\n                padding: 28px 20px;\n            }\n\n            .footer-content {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .footer-links {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .back-to-top {\n                bottom: 16px;\n                right: 16px;\n                width: 40px;\n                height: 40px;\n                font-size: 1.2rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- ======== 导航栏 ======== -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\" id=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">山月<span>创意</span></a>\n\n            <!-- 汉堡按钮 -->\n            <button class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-label=\"打开导航\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- 导航菜单 -->\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"active\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#features\">服务</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#gallery\">作品</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#about\">关于</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"nav-cta\">联系我们</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- ======== 主页面内容 ======== -->\n    <main>\n\n        <!-- ===== Hero首页区域 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"home\" class=\"hero\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                    <span class=\"hero-badge\">✨ 全新创意设计</span>\n                    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">\n                        用设计讲述你的<br>\n                        <span class=\"highlight\">品牌故事</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"hero-desc\">\n                        我们专注于数字体验与视觉传达，为现代品牌打造富有生命力的互联网作品。每一像素都有意义。\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"btn-group\">\n                        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">开始你的项目</a>\n                        <a href=\"#gallery\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">浏览作品</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=1\" alt=\"创意设计展示\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 特性服务区 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"features\" class=\"features\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">我们提供的服务</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">\n                    以客户目标为导向，用专业视角打造更具商业价值的设计方案。\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n                    <!-- 卡片1 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <div class=\"feature-icon\">🎨</div>\n                        <h3>视觉设计</h3>\n                        <p>从品牌视觉识别到产品界面，建立系统化的视觉语言，让您的品牌脱颖而出。</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- 卡片2 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <div class=\"feature-icon\">📱</div>\n                        <h3>响应式开发</h3>\n                        <p>采用现代前端技术栈，打造在手机、平板和桌面端都完美呈现的流畅体验。</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- 卡片3 -->\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <div class=\"feature-icon\">🚀</div>\n                        <h3>交互体验</h3>\n                        <p>细致的动效与交互反馈，为用户带来惊喜和愉悦的使用感受。</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 作品画廊 / 轮播区 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"gallery\" class=\"carousel-section\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">精选作品</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">滑动查看我们近期为不同行业客户打造的代表项目。</p>\n\n                <!-- 简易轮播 -->\n                <div class=\"simple-carousel\" id=\"simpleCarousel\">\n                    <div class=\"carousel-track-container\">\n                        <div class=\"carousel-track\" id=\"carouselTrack\">\n                            <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/1000/480?random=2\" alt=\"项目展示一\">\n                                <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                    <h3>青玦科技官网</h3>\n                                    <p>企业品牌官网 · 2024</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/1000/480?random=4\" alt=\"项目展示二\">\n                                <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                    <h3>麓见咖啡馆小程序</h3>\n                                    <p>电商与小程序 · 特约设计</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/1000/480?random=6\" alt=\"项目展示三\">\n                                <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                    <h3>Minu 极简设计稿</h3>\n                                    <p>品牌视觉更新 · 2025</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- 左右箭头 -->\n                    <button class=\"carousel-btn prev-btn\" id=\"prevSlide\" aria-label=\"上一张\">&#10094;</button>\n                    <button class=\"carousel-btn next-btn\" id=\"nextSlide\" aria-label=\"下一张\">&#10095;</button>\n                    <!-- 指示器 -->\n                    <div class=\"carousel-indicators\" id=\"carouselIndicators\">\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot active-dot\" data-index=\"0\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-index=\"1\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-index=\"2\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== Tab 关于/切换区域 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"about\" class=\"tabs-section\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">关于我们</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">一站式创意伙伴，为您的品牌持续注入活力。</p>\n\n                <div class=\"tab-panels\">\n                    <!-- Tab按钮 -->\n                    <div class=\"tab-buttons\" id=\"tabButtons\">\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn active-tab\" data-tab=\"team\">团队</button>\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"idea\">理念</button>\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"process\">流程</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 面板1 -->\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel active-panel\" data-panel=\"team\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-flex\">\n                            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=8\" alt=\"团队照片\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"panel-title\">⚡ 年轻创新的团队</h3>\n                                <p class=\"panel-content\">\n                                    由设计师、工程师和产品专家组成的跨职能团队，以项目协作模式高效运转。成员平均具备5年以上的行业经验，服务过科技、消费、教育等多个领域。\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 面板2 -->\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"idea\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3 class=\"panel-title\">💡 少即是多的体验哲学</h3>\n                            <p>\n                                核心设计理念是“普通且极简”：去除不必要的装饰，保留内容本身的感染力。我们相信优秀的设计是隐形而优雅的。\n                            </p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>一切从用户需求出发</li>\n                                <li>美学须为功能服务</li>\n                                <li>关注每一个体验细节</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 面板3 -->\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"process\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3 class=\"panel-title\">🔄 高效透明的工作流程</h3>\n                            <p>我们的小步快跑流程，确保您全程参与并掌握进度：</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>01. 需求会谈与剖析</li>\n                                <li>02. 视觉探索与定调</li>\n                                <li>03. 设计输出与反馈</li>\n                                <li>04. 开发测试与发布</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 联系表单区 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"contact\" class=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">与我们联系</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">\n                    想一起合作或了解更多信息？填写下面的表单，我们会在1个工作日内回复。\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-wrapper\">\n                    <form id=\"contactForm\">\n                        <div class=\"form-group\">\n                            <label for=\"name\">您的称呼</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"例如：林小姐\" required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"form-group\">\n                            <label for=\"email\">邮箱地址</label>\n                            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@email.com\" required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"form-group\">\n                            <label for=\"company\">公司 / 组织 (选填)</label>\n                            <input type=\"text\" id=\"company\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"公司或个人工作室\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"form-group\">\n                            <label for=\"message\">项目描述</label>\n                            <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"简单告诉我们您的需求、时间规划等…\" required></textarea>\n                        </div>\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"contact-submit-btn\">发送信息 🚀</button>\n\n                        <!-- 模拟成功提示框 -->\n                        <div id=\"formSuccess\" class=\"form-message\">\n                            ✅ 感谢您的留言！我们会尽快与您联系。\n                        </div>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- ======== 页脚 ======== -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-content\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">山月<span>创意</span></a>\n                <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#home\">首页</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#features\">服务</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#gallery\">作品</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#about\">关于</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"copyright\">\n                © 2025 山月创意工作室 · 使用 Lorem Ipsum 与 picsum.photos 占位内容\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- 返回顶部按钮 -->\n    <button class=\"back-to-top\" id=\"backToTop\" aria-label=\"回到顶部\">↑</button>\n\n    <!-- ======== 原生 JavaScript ======== -->\n    <script>\n        // 全部交互功能使用原生 JS 实现\n\n        (function () {\n            \'use strict\';\n\n            // ------------ 1. 响应式导航栏 (汉堡菜单) ------------\n            const navToggle = document.getElementById(\'navToggle\');\n            const navMenu = document.getElementById(\'navMenu\');\n\n            if (navToggle && navMenu) {\n                navToggle.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    navMenu.classList.toggle(\'open\');\n                });\n\n                // 点击菜单项后自动收起（移动端体验）\n                navMenu.querySelectorAll(\'a\').forEach(link => {\n                    link.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\n                        navMenu.classList.remove(\'open\');\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n\n            // ------------ 2. 滚动高亮导航 + 显示返回顶部按钮 ------------\n            const sections = document.querySelectorAll(\'main section[id]\');\n            const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-menu a\');\n            const backToTop = document.getElementById(\'backToTop\');\n\n            function handleScroll() {\n                // 返回顶部按钮\n                if (window.scrollY > 400) {\n                    backToTop.classList.add(\'show\');\n                } else {\n                    backToTop.classList.remove(\'show\');\n                }\n\n                // 滚动高亮检测\n                let currentSectionId = \'\';\n                const scrollPosition = window.scrollY + 100;\n\n                sections.forEach(section => {\n                    const offsetTop = section.offsetTop;\n                    const offsetBottom = offsetTop + section.offsetHeight;\n                    if (scrollPosition >= offsetTop && scrollPosition < offsetBottom) {\n                        currentSectionId = section.getAttribute(\'id\');\n                    }\n                });\n\n                navLinks.forEach(link => {\n                    link.classList.remove(\'active\');\n                    const href = link.getAttribute(\'href\');\n                    if (href === `#${currentSectionId}`) {\n                        link.classList.add(\'active\');\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            if (backToTop) {\n                backToTop.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\n                    window.scrollTo({\n                        top: 0,\n                        behavior: \'smooth\'\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', handleScroll, { passive: true });\n            handleScroll(); // 初始化执行\n\n            // ------------ 3. 图片轮播 (原生实现) ------------\n            const track = document.getElementById(\'carouselTrack\');\n            const slides = document.querySelectorAll(\'.carousel-slide\');\n            const indicators = document.querySelectorAll(\'.indicator-dot\');\n            const prevBtn = document.getElementById(\'prevSlide\');\n            const nextBtn = document.getElementById(\'nextSlide\');\n\n            let currentIndex = 0;\n            const slideCount = slides.length;\n\n            if (track && slideCount > 0) {\n                function goToSlide(index) {\n                    // 边缘滑动如果超出则从头/尾循环\n                    if (index < 0) {\n                        currentIndex = slideCount - 1;\n                    } else if (index >= slideCount) {\n                        currentIndex = 0;\n                    } else {\n                        currentIndex = index;\n                    }\n\n                    // 控制位移：负百分比\n                    const moveX = -currentIndex * 100;\n                    track.style.transform = \'translateX(\' + moveX + \'%)\';\n\n                    // 更新激活指示器\n                    indicators.forEach((dot, i) => {\n                        dot.classList.toggle(\'active-dot\', i === currentIndex);\n                    });\n                }\n\n                // 点击指示器切换\n                indicators.forEach((dot, i) => {\n                    dot.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                        goToSlide(i);\n                    });\n                });\n\n                // 上一张 / 下一张\n                prevBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    goToSlide(currentIndex - 1);\n                });\n                nextBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    goToSlide(currentIndex + 1);\n                });\n\n                // （可选）自动轮播，每5秒轮换一张。注释掉可关闭自动轮播。\n                let autoPlay = setInterval(() => goToSlide(currentIndex + 1), 5000);\n\n                // 当鼠标悬停在轮播图上时，暂停自动播放\n                const carousel = document.getElementById(\'simpleCarousel\');\n                carousel.addEventListener(\'mouseenter\', () => clearInterval(autoPlay));\n                carousel.addEventListener(\'mouseleave\', () => {\n                    autoPlay = setInterval(() => goToSlide(currentIndex + 1), 5000);\n                });\n            }\n\n            // ------------ 4. Tab 切换功能 ------------\n            const tabButtons = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-btn\');\n            const panels = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-panel\');\n\n            tabButtons.forEach(btn => {\n                btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    const tabId = this.getAttribute(\'data-tab\');\n\n                    // 切换按钮 active\n                    tabButtons.forEach(b => b.classList.remove(\'active-tab\'));\n                    this.classList.add(\'active-tab\');\n\n                    // 切换面板显示\n                    panels.forEach(panel => {\n                        panel.classList.remove(\'active-panel\');\n                        if (panel.getAttribute(\'data-panel\') === tabId) {\n                            panel.classList.add(\'active-panel\');\n                        }\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // ------------ 5. 联系表单模拟提交 ------------\n            const contactForm = document.getElementById(\'contactForm\');\n            const successBox = document.getElementById(\'formSuccess\');\n\n            if (contactForm) {\n                contactForm.addEventListener(\'submit\', function (event) {\n                    event.preventDefault();\n\n                    // 简单的原生校验检查\n                    const name = document.getElementById(\'name\').value.trim();\n                    const email = document.getElementById(\'email\').value.trim();\n                    const message = document.getElementById(\'message\').value.trim();\n\n                    if (name && email && message) {\n                        // 显示成功消息\n                        successBox.style.display = \'block\';\n                        // 重置表单\n                        this.reset();\n\n                        // 3秒后自动隐藏提示\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            successBox.style.display = \'none\';\n                        }, 3000);\n                    } else {\n                        alert(\'请填写所有必填字段 😊\');\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n        })();\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```','ai',454879448563617792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 18:30:23','2026-09-09 13:59:10',1),(454880775800774656,'简单网页','user',454880773636513792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 18:34:48','2026-09-08 18:34:48',0),(454880947221979136,'这是您需要的简单网页HTML代码。它包含导航、横幅、特性展示、关于区域和页脚，采用响应式布局，并加入移动端菜单切换和页面滚动效果，整体风格简洁清晰。\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>简单网页</title>\n    <style>\n        /* ===== 全局重置与基础样式 ===== */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\",\n                \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n            color: #333;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            background-color: #fafafa;\n        }\n\n        ul {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 导航栏 ===== */\n        .navbar {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: #fff;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n            z-index: 100;\n        }\n\n        .navbar__inner {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 24px;\n            height: 64px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        .navbar__logo {\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            color: #4a6cf7;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .navbar__menu {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 32px;\n        }\n\n        .navbar__link {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            padding: 6px 2px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n            transition: border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .navbar__link:hover {\n            color: #4a6cf7;\n            border-bottom-color: #4a6cf7;\n        }\n\n        .navbar__toggle {\n            display: none;\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 26px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            color: #333;\n            line-height: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 主横幅 ===== */\n        .hero {\n            margin-top: 64px;\n            padding: 80px 24px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8edff 0%, #f5f7ff 50%, #ffffff 100%);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .hero__inner {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .hero__title {\n            font-size: 48px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            color: #1a1a2e;\n        }\n\n        .hero__title span {\n            color: #4a6cf7;\n        }\n\n        .hero__subtitle {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: #666;\n            margin-bottom: 32px;\n            max-width: 600px;\n            margin-left: auto;\n            margin-right: auto;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 14px 40px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            background: #4a6cf7;\n            color: #fff;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .btn--light {\n            background: #fff;\n            color: #4a6cf7;\n            border: 2px solid #4a6cf7;\n        }\n\n        .btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(74, 108, 247, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .btn--light:hover {\n            background: #f0f3ff;\n        }\n\n        .hero__actions {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 16px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 通用块区 ===== */\n        .section {\n            padding: 80px 24px;\n        }\n\n        .section__inner {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .section__title {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            color: #1a1a2e;\n        }\n\n        .section__subtitle {\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #888;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            margin-bottom: 48px;\n        }\n\n        /* 特性卡片 */\n        .features__grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n            gap: 24px;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card {\n            background: #fff;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 32px 24px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-6px);\n            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n\n        .feature-card__icon {\n            font-size: 42px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card__title {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            color: #222;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card__desc {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n\n        /* 关于区域 */\n        .about {\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .about__inner {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 48px;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .about__image img {\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 360px;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n        }\n\n        .about__content h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            color: #1a1a2e;\n        }\n\n        .about__content p {\n            color: #666;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .about__stats {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 32px;\n            margin-top: 24px;\n        }\n\n        .stat__number {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #4a6cf7;\n        }\n\n        .stat__label {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #888;\n        }\n\n        /* 页脚 */\n        .footer {\n            background: #1a1a2e;\n            color: #aaa;\n            padding: 24px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n\n        .footer span {\n            color: #4a6cf7;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 响应式 ===== */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .hero {\n                padding: 60px 16px;\n            }\n\n            .hero__title {\n                font-size: 32px;\n            }\n\n            .hero__subtitle {\n                font-size: 16px;\n            }\n\n            .navbar__toggle {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .navbar__menu {\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 64px;\n                left: 0;\n                width: 100%;\n                background: #fff;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                gap: 0;\n                box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n                padding: 8px 0;\n                transform: translateY(-120%);\n                transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n                /* 默认隐藏菜单 */\n                display: none;\n            }\n\n            .navbar__menu.is-open {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .navbar__link {\n                padding: 12px 24px;\n                width: 100%;\n                text-align: center;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n            }\n\n            .navbar__link:hover {\n                border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n            }\n\n            /* 汉堡按钮显示 */\n\n            .about__inner {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .about__image img {\n                height: 240px;\n            }\n\n            .section {\n                padding: 56px 16px;\n            }\n\n            .section__title {\n                font-size: 26px;\n            }\n\n            .about__stats {\n                gap: 20px;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero__actions .btn {\n                padding: 12px 28px;\n                font-size: 14px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* 小屏幕适配 */\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .hero__actions {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero__actions .btn {\n                width: 80%;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- 导航栏 -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"navbar__inner\">\n            <div class=\"navbar__logo\">MySite</div>\n\n            <nav class=\"navbar__menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <a href=\"#features\" class=\"navbar__link\">功能特性</a>\n                <a href=\"#about\" class=\"navbar__link\">关于我们</a>\n                <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"navbar__link\">联系我们</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <button class=\"navbar__toggle\" id=\"navBtn\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\">&#9776;</button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- 主横幅 -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"hero__inner\">\n            <h1 class=\"hero__title\">欢迎来到 <span>MySite</span></h1>\n            <p class=\"hero__subtitle\">\n                这是一个简洁优美的单页面网站，使用 HTML、CSS 和原生 JavaScript 构建，完全响应式布局，适用于任何设备。\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"hero__actions\">\n                <a href=\"#features\" class=\"btn\">了解更多</a>\n                <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn--light\">与我们联系</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 特性区域 -->\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"features\">\n        <div class=\"section__inner\">\n            <h2 class=\"section__title\">功能特性</h2>\n            <p class=\"section__subtitle\">我们提供的每一项服务都精益求精</p>\n\n            <div class=\"features__grid\">\n                <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚡</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-card__title\">极速体验</h3>\n                    <p class=\"feature-card__desc\">优化的性能表现，页面加载迅速，交互流畅丝滑。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📱</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-card__title\">完全响应式</h3>\n                    <p class=\"feature-card__desc\">在手机、平板和桌面设备上都有出色的视觉与体验。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🔒</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-card__title\">安全可靠</h3>\n                    <p class=\"feature-card__desc\">纯客户端实现，无任何外部依赖，数据安全有保障。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🎨</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"feature-card__title\">简洁设计</h3>\n                    <p class=\"feature-card__desc\">干净优雅的UI设计，让内容成为真正的焦点。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 关于区域 -->\n    <section class=\"section about\" id=\"about\">\n        <div class=\"section__inner about__inner\">\n            <div class=\"about__image\">\n                <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/400\" alt=\"关于我们图片\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"about__content\">\n                <h3>关于 MySite</h3>\n                <p>\n                    我们是一支充满创造力的团队，专注于构建极简而优雅的数字产品。从设计方案到最终开发，\n                    每一个细节我们都力求完美。\n                </p>\n                <p>\n                    从网站到移动端，我们提供一站式解决方案，让您的想法快速变为现实。\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"about__stats\">\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\n                        <div class=\"stat__number\">200+</div>\n                        <div class=\"stat__label\">项目经验</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\n                        <div class=\"stat__number\">99%</div>\n                        <div class=\"stat__label\">客户好评率</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat\">\n                        <div class=\"stat__number\">24H</div>\n                        <div class=\"stat__label\">在线支持</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 联系我们区域 -->\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"contact\" style=\"background:#f0f3ff;\">\n        <div class=\"section__inner\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:640px;\">\n            <h2 class=\"section__title\">联系我们</h2>\n            <p class=\"section__subtitle\">有任何问题？我们非常乐意提供帮助</p>\n\n            <form id=\"contactForm\" class=\"contact-form\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n                <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n                    <label for=\"name\" style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;\">您的姓名</label>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required\n                    style=\"width:100%; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #ddd; font-size:15px;\">\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n                    <label for=\"email\" style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;\">电子邮箱</label>\n                    <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required\n                    style=\"width:100%; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #ddd; font-size:15px;\">\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\n                    <label for=\"msg\" style=\"display:block; margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;\">留言内容</label>\n                    <textarea id=\"msg\" name=\"msg\" rows=\"4\" required\n                    style=\"width:100%; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #ddd; font-size:15px; resize:vertical;\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\" style=\"width:100%;\">发送留言</button>\n                <div id=\"formSuccess\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:16px; padding:14px; border-radius:8px; background:#e6f9e6; color:#2d7a2d; text-align:center; font-weight:600;\">\n                    ✓ 提交成功！感谢您的留言。\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 页脚 -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>© 2024 <span>MySite</span> · 保留所有权利</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // ===== 移动端菜单切换 =====\n        const navBtn = document.getElementById(\'navBtn\');\n        const navMenu = document.getElementById(\'navMenu\');\n\n        navBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n            navMenu.classList.toggle(\'is-open\');\n        });\n\n        // 点击菜单项后自动关闭移动端菜单\n        const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll(\'.navbar__link\');\n        navLinks.forEach(function(link) {\n            link.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\n                navMenu.classList.remove(\'is-open\');\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ===== 简单表单提交模拟 =====\n        const contactForm = document.getElementById(\'contactForm\');\n        const formSuccess = document.getElementById(\'formSuccess\');\n\n        contactForm.addEventListener(\'submit\', function(e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            // 模拟发送过程\n            formSuccess.style.display = \'block\';\n            contactForm.reset();\n            // 3秒后逐渐淡出成功提示\n            setTimeout(function() {\n                formSuccess.style.transition = \'opacity 0.5s\';\n                formSuccess.style.opacity = \'0\';\n                setTimeout(function() {\n                    formSuccess.style.display = \'none\';\n                    formSuccess.style.opacity = \'1\';\n                    formSuccess.style.transition = \'\';\n                }, 500);\n            }, 3000);\n        });\n\n        // ===== 平滑滚动 =====\n        const anchorLinks = document.querySelectorAll(\'a[href^=\"#\"]\');\n        anchorLinks.forEach(function(anchor) {\n            anchor.addEventListener(\'click\', function(e) {\n                const targetId = this.getAttribute(\'href\');\n                if (targetId === \'#\') return;\n                const target = document.querySelector(targetId);\n                if (target) {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    const top = target.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.pageYOffset - 64;\n                    window.scrollTo({\n                        top: top,\n                        behavior: \'smooth\'\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n### 页面功能与导航体验\n\n站点围绕展示与联系设计了清晰的浏览路径，并通过简洁的交互提升使用便利性。\n\n- **导航与响应式体验**：页面顶部固定导航栏在移动端会自动折叠为汉堡菜单，点击即可展开或收起导航链接，方便在手机等小屏幕设备上快速浏览。同时，点击导航链接会平滑滚动到对应内容区块，视觉过渡自然。\n- **核心信息展示**：首屏的欢迎横幅清晰点明了站点主题。下方的“功能特性”区域通过四张卡片介绍了服务亮点。紧随其后的“关于区域”以图文结合的方式展示团队背景和关键数据（如项目经验数），让访问者快速建立信任。\n- **表单交互反馈**：底部的“联系我们”表单包含姓名、邮箱和留言字段，在您提交后会给予明确的成功状态提示，并自动重置表单，模拟了完整的提交流程，交互反馈直接。','ai',454880773636513792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 18:35:29','2026-09-08 18:35:29',0),(454900228240334848,'不要出现古风的元素 要现代感 城市感的','user',454879448563617792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 19:52:06','2026-09-09 13:59:10',1),(454900767241953280,'```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>City Pulse · 现代城市体验设计</title>\n    <!-- 所有样式内联，纯原生 HTML/CSS/JS，无任何外部依赖 -->\n    <style>\n        /* ===== 基础变量 / 重置 ===== */\n        :root {\n            --bg-dark: #0B1220;\n            --bg-section: #F6F8FC;\n            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;\n            --primary: #4F7DFF;\n            --accent: #22E0C7;\n            --text-main: #11182B;\n            --text-gray: #5D6B85;\n            --text-light: #8896AB;\n            --border: #E1E8F0;\n            --nav-height: 72px;\n            --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(2, 12, 27, 0.08);\n            --radius: 20px;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        img, svg {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n\n        button {\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            font-family: inherit;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 28px;\n        }\n\n        section {\n            padding: 90px 0;\n        }\n\n        .text-center {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 2.4rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n\n        .section-subtitle {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n            max-width: 620px;\n            margin: 16px auto 50px;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 导航栏 ===== */\n        .navbar {\n            position: sticky;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 100;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            height: var(--nav-height);\n        }\n\n        .navbar .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .logo span {\n            color: var(--primary);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            margin-left: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .logo svg {\n            width: 28px;\n            height: 28px;\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 6px;\n            align-items: center;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a {\n            padding: 8px 18px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            transition: all 0.25s;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a:hover,\n        .nav-menu a.active {\n            background: rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.1);\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff !important;\n            padding: 9px 22px !important;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            margin-left: 10px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.3);\n            transition: all 0.25s;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background: #3A63E8;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            padding: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle span {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--text-main);\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            transition: 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== Hero + 城市抽象图 ===== */\n        .hero {\n            background: \n                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(34, 224, 199, 0.08), transparent 40%),\n                linear-gradient(120deg, #f5f9ff 0%, #fafcff 60%);\n            padding: 80px 0 70px;\n        }\n\n        .hero .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 60px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            flex: 1.1;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            background: rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.09);\n            color: var(--primary);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            padding: 6px 16px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            line-height: 1.15;\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n        }\n\n        .highlight {\n            background: linear-gradient(115deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n        }\n\n        .hero-desc {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 1.08rem;\n            max-width: 540px;\n            margin-bottom: 36px;\n        }\n\n        .btn-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 16px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            padding: 12px 28px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            transition: all 0.25s;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.35);\n        }\n\n        .btn-outline {\n            border: 2px solid var(--border);\n            background: white;\n            color: var(--text-main);\n        }\n\n        .btn-outline:hover {\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n            color: var(--primary);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        .hero-visual {\n            flex: 0.95;\n            background: #0D1425;\n            border-radius: 28px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 15, 40, 0.22);\n            height: 440px;\n            position: relative;\n            outline: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n        }\n\n        .hero-visual svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* 城市抽象图通用 */\n        .abstract-city {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background-color: #111b2c;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 服务卡片 ===== */\n        .services {\n            background: var(--bg-section);\n        }\n\n        .service-grid {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 28px;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: var(--card-bg);\n            border-radius: var(--radius);\n            padding: 36px 30px;\n            flex: 1 1 260px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n            text-align: left;\n            border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-6px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.25);\n            box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(2, 12, 27, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EDF2FF, #E6FFF7);\n            width: 56px;\n            height: 56px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            border-radius: 18px;\n            margin-bottom: 22px;\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .service-card p {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 作品 / 轮播 ===== */\n        .showcase {\n            background: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .simple-carousel {\n            max-width: 920px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            outline: 1px solid var(--border);\n            border-radius: 26px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n        }\n\n        .carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide {\n            min-width: 100%;\n            position: relative;\n            background: #111B2C;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide .urban-card {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 460px;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            padding: 60px 30px 24px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), transparent);\n            color: #fff;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption h3 {\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption p {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n            letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-btn {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            width: 44px;\n            height: 44px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: #111;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            z-index: 5;\n            transition: 0.2s;\n            box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n        }\n\n        .carousel-btn:hover {\n            background: #fff;\n            transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.1);\n        }\n\n        .prev-btn {\n            left: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .next-btn {\n            right: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-indicators {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 20px;\n            right: 22px;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n            z-index: 6;\n        }\n\n        .indicator-dot {\n            width: 8px;\n            height: 8px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n            transition: all 0.25s;\n        }\n\n        .indicator-dot.active-dot {\n            width: 20px;\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 洞察 / tab ===== */\n        .insight {\n            background: var(--bg-section);\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel-card {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: #FFFFFF;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n            padding: 35px 40px 45px;\n        }\n\n        .tab-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            margin-bottom: 28px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);\n            padding-bottom: 14px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn {\n            padding: 8px 22px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            transition: all 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn:hover {\n            background: rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.06);\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn.active-tab {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79,125,255,0.3);\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel {\n            display: none;\n            animation: fadeIn 0.35s;\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel.active-panel {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 28px;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n\n        .panel-svg {\n            width: 260px;\n            height: 190px;\n            border-radius: 18px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            background: #0B1628;\n        }\n\n        .panel-svg svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content h3 {\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content p {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content ul {\n            margin: 12px 0 0 18px;\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 联系表单 ===== */\n        .contact {\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form {\n            max-width: 620px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .form-group label {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input,\n        .form-group textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 13px 16px;\n            border: 2px solid var(--border);\n            border-radius: 14px;\n            font-family: inherit;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            transition: 0.25s;\n            background: #FCFDFF;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input:focus,\n        .form-group textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n            background: #fff;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79,125,255,0.12);\n        }\n\n        .contact-submit {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 15px 24px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-top: 8px;\n            transition: 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        .contact-submit:hover {\n            background: #3b5fe8;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(79,125,255,0.3);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n\n        .form-message {\n            display: none;\n            background: #D5F6EE;\n            color: #066d57;\n            padding: 13px 16px;\n            border-radius: 14px;\n            margin-top: 18px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 页脚 ===== */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--bg-dark);\n            color: #AAB7D6;\n            padding: 50px 0 26px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .footer .logo {\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links {\n            list-style: none;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .copyright {\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            padding-top: 22px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #243047;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #5F6E89;\n        }\n\n        /* 返回顶部 */\n        .back-to-top {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 30px;\n            right: 30px;\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            width: 44px;\n            height: 44px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(79,125,255,0.3);\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            opacity: 0;\n            visibility: hidden;\n            transform: translateY(12px);\n            transition: 0.4s;\n            z-index: 99;\n        }\n\n        .back-to-top.show {\n            opacity: 1;\n            visibility: visible;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        /* ===== 响应式 ===== */\n        @media (max-width: 992px) {\n            .hero .container {\n                flex-direction: column-reverse;\n                text-align: center;\n                gap: 40px;\n            }\n\n            .hero-desc {\n                margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            }\n\n            .btn-group {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-visual {\n                height: 360px;\n                width: 100%;\n                max-width: 680px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: absolute;\n                top: var(--nav-height);\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                background: #fff;\n                padding: 20px;\n                gap: 8px;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n                box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n                transform: translateY(-110%);\n                transition: 0.3s;\n                opacity: 0;\n                pointer-events: none;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.open {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n                opacity: 1;\n                pointer-events: auto;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu a {\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .nav-cta {\n                margin-left: 0;\n            }\n\n            .service-card {\n                max-width: 480px;\n            }\n\n            .carousel-slide .urban-card,\n            .carousel-slide svg {\n                height: 300px;\n            }\n\n            .panel-content.active-panel {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n\n            .panel-svg {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 180px;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                padding: 60px 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .hero-title {\n                font-size: 2.2rem;\n            }\n\n            .section-title {\n                font-size: 2rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- 导航栏 -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\">\n                    <rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"6\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                    <rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"17\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                    <rect x=\"16\" y=\"10\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                </svg>\n                CITY<span>PULSE</span>\n            </a>\n\n            <button class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-label=\"菜单\">\n                <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n            </button>\n\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"active\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#services\">服务</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#projects\">作品</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#insight\">洞察</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"nav-cta\">联络</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n\n        <!-- ===== 现代城市 Hero ===== -->\n        <section id=\"home\" class=\"hero\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                    <div class=\"hero-badge\">◆ 数字空间 · 城市创意</div>\n                    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">\n                        让数字产品<br>\n                        <span class=\"highlight\">与城市共鸣</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"hero-desc\">\n                        我们专注于沉浸式界面体验、智能数据可视化与移动端产品。\n                        以现代城市风格为驱动，为商业和公共领域打造清晰的数字视觉系统。\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"btn-group\">\n                        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">↳ 发起项目</a>\n                        <a href=\"#projects\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">查看案例</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- 城市抽象画 SVG -->\n                <div class=\"hero-visual\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 600\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"城市抽象天际线\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"bgUrban\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#101928\"/>\n                                <stop offset=\"55%\" stop-color=\"#1d2e51\"/>\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#214b74\"/>\n                            </linearGradient>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"glass1\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#2D4263\"/>\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1b263f\"/>\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"600\" fill=\"url(#bgUrban)\"/>\n                        <!-- 楼群背景 -->\n                        <g fill=\"url(#glass1)\" opacity=\"0.6\">\n                            <rect x=\"30\" y=\"270\" width=\"100\" height=\"330\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"170\" y=\"120\" width=\"130\" height=\"480\" rx=\"3\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"360\" y=\"240\" width=\"80\" height=\"360\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"520\" y=\"160\" width=\"120\" height=\"440\" rx=\"3\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"700\" y=\"280\" width=\"90\" height=\"320\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                        </g>\n                        <!-- 近景高光建筑 -->\n                        <g fill=\"#0A162E\">\n                            <rect x=\"45\" y=\"180\" width=\"70\" height=\"420\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"205\" y=\"220\" width=\"60\" height=\"380\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"580\" y=\"140\" width=\"70\" height=\"460\"/>\n                            <polygon points=\"300,600 300,310 360,230 420,330 420,600\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"640\" y=\"190\" width=\"50\" height=\"410\"/>\n                        </g>\n                        <!-- 玻璃窗 / 霓虹线 -->\n                        <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#21D4FD\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\"0.8\">\n                            <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"210\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"225\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"260\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"260\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"180\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"670\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"230\"/>\n                        </g>\n                        <g fill=\"#22E0C7\" opacity=\"0.9\">\n                            <circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"220\" r=\"3\"/>\n                            <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"170\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n                            <circle cx=\"520\" cy=\"300\" r=\"4\"/>\n                            <circle cx=\"690\" cy=\"250\" r=\"2\"/>\n                        </g>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 服务区块 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"services\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">聚焦城市数字体验</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">从产品策略到落地开发，用设计语言链接人与都市科技。</p>\n                <div class=\"service-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-icon\">◉</div>\n                        <h3>界面视觉</h3>\n                        <p>以现代都市的简洁与高效为基调，构建既有高级感又有功能性的界面，让每一个屏幕都具备流线型质感。</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-icon\">⇄</div>\n                        <h3>交互原型</h3>\n                        <p>重视手势、转场、动画反馈，打造如城市交通般顺畅的数字体验。保留合理动效，强化功能理解。</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-icon\">⬢</div>\n                        <h3>前端实现</h3>\n                        <p>使用语义化 HTML/CSS/JavaScript，构建适配全设备的高性能界面。代码整洁，风格与现代开发标准同步。</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 项目案例 / 轮播 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"projects\" class=\"showcase\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">近期项目</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">聚焦城市智慧场景 — 数据、交通、零售与智能终端。</p>\n\n                <div class=\"simple-carousel\" id=\"urbanCarousel\">\n                    <div class=\"carousel-track\" id=\"carouselTrack\">\n\n                        <!-- Slide 1: 暖橙色色调城市大屏 -->\n                        <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"城市数据平台概念\">\n                                <defs>\n                                    <linearGradient id=\"slide1Bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1C1024\"/>\n                                        <stop offset=\"70%\" stop-color=\"#3B1F45\"/>\n                                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#762C3B\"/>\n                                    </linearGradient>\n                                </defs>\n                                <rect width=\"900\" height=\"460\" fill=\"url(#slide1Bg)\"/>\n                                <g fill=\"#161022\">\n                                    <polygon points=\"40,460 40,160 150,160 150,90 230,90 230,180 320,180 320,240 400,240 400,460\"/>\n                                    <polygon points=\"520,460 520,120 650,120 650,260 700,260 700,300 780,300 780,460\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <g fill=\"#EA906C\" opacity=\"0.85\">\n                                    <rect x=\"90\" y=\"180\" width=\"50\" height=\"4\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"110\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"420\" y=\"200\" width=\"45\" height=\"4\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"550\" y=\"160\" width=\"60\" height=\"4\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"710\" y=\"330\" width=\"55\" height=\"4\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <circle cx=\"650\" cy=\"90\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#F8D58A\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"320\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#F8D58A\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n                                <path d=\"M 850 30 L 870 50 M 850 70 L 870 90\" stroke=\"#F8D58A\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                <h3>城市云脑 · 管理后台</h3>\n                                <p>智慧城市数据驾驶舱 / 2025</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Slide 2: 蓝绿霓虹交通 -->\n                        <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"出行智能终端\">\n                                <defs>\n                                    <linearGradient id=\"slide2Bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n                                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0E1C26\"/>\n                                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#155A6A\"/>\n                                    </linearGradient>\n                                </defs>\n                                <rect width=\"900\" height=\"460\" fill=\"url(#slide2Bg)\"/>\n                                <g fill=\"#0D1725\">\n                                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"240\" width=\"120\" height=\"220\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"160\" y=\"140\" width=\"100\" height=\"320\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"340\" y=\"90\" width=\"140\" height=\"370\" fill=\"#0F2230\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"560\" y=\"180\" width=\"90\" height=\"280\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"710\" y=\"110\" width=\"120\" height=\"350\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <g fill=\"#00D9C0\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"4\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"210\" r=\"3\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"740\" cy=\"140\" r=\"3\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <g stroke=\"#66FFE2\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\"0.9\">\n                                    <path d=\"M 130 320 H 180 M 270 290 H 330 M 540 260 H 590 M 660 220 H 710\" fill=\"none\"/>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                <h3>GoCity · 智慧出行</h3>\n                                <p>多模式交通交互系统</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Slide 3: 紫粉科技零售 -->\n                        <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"未来零售终端界面\">\n                                <defs>\n                                    <linearGradient id=\"slide3Bg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#280C3B\"/>\n                                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#141C47\"/>\n                                    </linearGradient>\n                                </defs>\n                                <rect width=\"900\" height=\"460\" fill=\"url(#slide3Bg)\"/>\n                                <g fill=\"#101432\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n                                    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"120\" width=\"170\" height=\"340\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"260\" y=\"200\" width=\"80\" height=\"260\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"430\" y=\"70\" width=\"190\" height=\"390\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"680\" y=\"240\" width=\"150\" height=\"220\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <g fill=\"#D360FF\" opacity=\"0.8\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"520\" cy=\"120\" r=\"5\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"270\" r=\"4\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"200\" r=\"4\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <path d=\"M 590 250 H 750 M 590 270 H 730 M 590 290 H 690\" stroke=\"#F65EF7\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                <h3>MERIDIAN 零售体验</h3>\n                                <p>无人收银 · 现代消费交互</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 控制按钮 -->\n                    <button class=\"carousel-btn prev-btn\" id=\"prevSlide\" aria-label=\"上一张\">‹</button>\n                    <button class=\"carousel-btn next-btn\" id=\"nextSlide\" aria-label=\"下一张\">›</button>\n                    <div class=\"carousel-indicators\" id=\"carouselIndicators\">\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot active-dot\" data-index=\"0\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-index=\"1\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-index=\"2\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 洞察 / Tab ===== -->\n        <section id=\"insight\" class=\"insight\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">城市创新方法论</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">用结构化流程为都市品牌指出清晰方向。</p>\n\n                <div class=\"tab-panel-card\">\n                    <div class=\"tab-buttons\" id=\"tabButtons\">\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn active-tab\" data-tab=\"field\">洞察</button>\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"architecture\">架构</button>\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"delivery\">交付</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel active-panel\" data-panel=\"field\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-svg\">\n                            <!-- 数据洞察 SVG -->\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                                <rect width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#111B30\"/>\n                                <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22D3C5\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"92\" r=\"28\"/>\n                                    <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"40\"/>\n                                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"130\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"40\" r=\"8\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"130\" r=\"12\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"92\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#A78BFA\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"130\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#F472B6\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3>使用者与环境调研</h3>\n                            <p>我们走入城市场景，观察用户与数字产品交互的真实脉络，基于数据做设计决策。</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>现场访谈与可用性测试</li>\n                                <li>行为地图与触点分析</li>\n                                <li>产品体验诊断</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"architecture\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-svg\">\n                            <!-- 信息架构 SVG -->\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                                <rect width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1C1624\"/>\n                                <g stroke=\"#C7A7FF\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\">\n                                    <path d=\"M50 80 H140 V 140 H240\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"60\" width=\"45\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4F7DFF\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"120\" y=\"100\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#22D3C5\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n                                    <rect x=\"230\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#F472B6\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"72\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"112\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"142\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3>系统蓝图与信息架构</h3>\n                            <p>把错综复杂的业务转化为清晰路径。在开发前定义模块、层级和界面逻辑。</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>功能地图 / 流程图</li>\n                                <li>UI 设计系统</li>\n                                <li>状态与权限管理</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"delivery\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-svg\">\n                            <!-- 工程交付 SVG -->\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                                <rect width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#14201B\"/>\n                                <g fill=\"#34D399\">\n                                    <polygon points=\"40,160 40,90 90,90 90,160\"/>\n                                    <polygon points=\"120,160 120,40 190,40 190,160\"/>\n                                    <polygon points=\"220,160 220,110 270,110 270,160\"/>\n                                </g>\n                                <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34D399\" stroke-width=\"3\">\n                                    <path d=\"M150 40 V 160 M160 40 H 190 M120 80 H 190\"/>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3>工程落地与持续迭代</h3>\n                            <p>交付不只是一次性输出，我们与团队持续监测性能与用户反馈，形成进化闭环。</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>模块化前端开发</li>\n                                <li>性能预算与监控</li>\n                                <li>人性化文档与协作</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ===== 联系表单 ===== -->\n        <section id=\"contact\" class=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">开始城市对话</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">无论是创业公司或城市机构，我们期待听见你的数字愿景。</p>\n\n                <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contactForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" placeholder=\"张三\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"email\">邮箱</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"hello@company.com\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"org\">公司/机构 (选填)</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"org\" placeholder=\"城市科技公司\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"message\">需求描述</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"message\" placeholder=\"简单描述项目背景 / 邮箱 / 时间预期…\" required></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"contact-submit\">发送 →</button>\n                    <div class=\"form-message\" id=\"formSuccess\">✓ 已收到消息！我们会尽快与您联络。</div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- 页脚 -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-content\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">CITY<span>PULSE</span></a>\n                <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#home\">首页</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#services\">服务</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#projects\">作品</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#contact\">联系</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"copyright\">\n                © 2025 CITY PULSE · 城市数字交互实验室\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- 返回顶部 -->\n    <button class=\"back-to-top\" id=\"backToTop\" aria-label=\"回到顶部\">↑</button>\n\n    <!-- 原生 JS -->\n    <script>\n        (function () {\n            \'use strict\';\n\n            // 导航汉堡\n            const navToggle = document.getElementById(\'navToggle\');\n            const navMenu = document.getElementById(\'navMenu\');\n            if (navToggle && navMenu) {\n                navToggle.addEventListener(\'click\', () => navMenu.classList.toggle(\'open\'));\n                document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-menu > li > a\').forEach(a => a.addEventListener(\'click\', () => navMenu.classList.remove(\'open\')));\n            }\n\n            // 返回顶部 + 滚动高亮\n            const backTop = document.getElementById(\'backToTop\');\n            const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-menu a:not(.nav-cta)\');\n            const sections = document.querySelectorAll(\'main section[id]\');\n\n            function onScroll() {\n                if (window.scrollY > 350) {\n                    backTop.classList.add(\'show\');\n                } else {\n                    backTop.classList.remove(\'show\');\n                }\n\n                const pos = window.scrollY + 100;\n                let currentId = \'\';\n                sections.forEach(sec => {\n                    if (pos >= sec.offsetTop && pos < sec.offsetTop + sec.offsetHeight) {\n                        currentId = sec.getAttribute(\'id\');\n                    }\n                });\n\n                navLinks.forEach(link => {\n                    link.classList.remove(\'active\');\n                    if (link.getAttribute(\'href\') === \'#\' + currentId) link.classList.add(\'active\');\n                });\n            }\n\n            backTop.addEventListener(\'click\', () => window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' }));\n            window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', onScroll, { passive: true });\n            onScroll();\n\n            // 轮播\n            const track = document.getElementById(\'carouselTrack\');\n            const dots = document.querySelectorAll(\'.indicator-dot\');\n            const prev = document.getElementById(\'prevSlide\');\n            const next = document.getElementById(\'nextSlide\');\n\n            let index = 0;\n            const slideCount = document.querySelectorAll(\'.carousel-slide\').length;\n\n            function jumpTo(i) {\n                if (i < 0) i = slideCount - 1;\n                if (i >= slideCount) i = 0;\n                index = i;\n                track.style.transform = `translateX(-${index * 100}%)`;\n                dots.forEach((d, n) => d.classList.toggle(\'active-dot\', n === index));\n            }\n\n            dots.forEach((dot, i) => dot.addEventListener(\'click\', () => jumpTo(i)));\n            prev.addEventListener(\'click\', () => jumpTo(index - 1));\n            next.addEventListener(\'click\', () => jumpTo(index + 1));\n\n            // 自动轮播但不打扰阅读\n            let timer = setInterval(() => jumpTo(index + 1), 5000);\n            const carousel = document.getElementById(\'urbanCarousel\');\n            carousel.addEventListener(\'mouseenter\', () => clearInterval(timer));\n            carousel.addEventListener(\'mouseleave\', () => { timer = setInterval(() => jumpTo(index + 1), 5000); });\n\n            // Tab 切换\n            const tabBtns = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-btn\');\n            const tabsPanels = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-panel\');\n\n            tabBtns.forEach(btn => {\n                btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    const target = this.dataset.tab;\n                    tabBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove(\'active-tab\'));\n                    this.classList.add(\'active-tab\');\n                    tabsPanels.forEach(p => {\n                        p.classList.remove(\'active-panel\');\n                        if (p.dataset.panel === target) p.classList.add(\'active-panel\');\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // 表单\n            const form = document.getElementById(\'contactForm\');\n            const successMsg = document.getElementById(\'formSuccess\');\n            form.addEventListener(\'submit\', (e) => {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                const name = document.getElementById(\'name\').value.trim();\n                const email = document.getElementById(\'email\').value.trim();\n                const msg = document.getElementById(\'message\').value.trim();\n\n                if (!name || !email || !msg) {\n                    alert(\'请填写完整姓名、邮箱和需求 🙏\');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                successMsg.style.display = \'block\';\n                form.reset();\n                setTimeout(() => successMsg.style.display = \'none\', 3500);\n            });\n        })();\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```','ai',454879448563617792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 19:54:14','2026-09-09 13:59:10',1),(454915453802930176,'能否加入一些动画元素','user',454879448563617792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:52:36','2026-09-09 13:59:10',1),(454915911468605440,'```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>City Pulse · 城市数字化体验</title>\n    <style>\n        /* ============== 设计变量 ============== */\n        :root {\n            --primary: #4F7DFF;\n            --accent: #22E0C7;\n            --bg-dark: #0B1220;\n            --bg-section: #F5F8FE;\n            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;\n            --text-main: #0D172A;\n            --text-gray: #5D6B85;\n            --border: #E3EAF2;\n            --nav-height: 72px;\n            --radius: 22px;\n            --shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(0, 15, 40, 0.08);\n        }\n\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif;\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            background: #fff;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        a,\n        button {\n            font-family: inherit;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n        }\n\n        button {\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            background: transparent;\n        }\n\n        img,\n        svg {\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 28px;\n        }\n\n        section {\n            padding: 90px 0;\n        }\n        .text-center {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n        }\n        .section-subtitle {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            max-width: 640px;\n            margin: 16px auto 54px;\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 滚动显现动画 ============== */\n        .reveal {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(35px);\n            transition: opacity 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.75, 0.4, 1),\n                        transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.75, 0.4, 1);\n            transition-delay: var(--delay, 0s);\n            will-change: opacity, transform;\n        }\n        .reveal.visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 导航栏 ============== */\n        .navbar {\n            position: sticky;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 120;\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            height: var(--nav-height);\n            transition: box-shadow .25s;\n        }\n\n        .navbar .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n        .logo span {\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .logo-deco svg {\n            width: 26px;\n            height: 26px;\n            stroke-width: 2.2;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 4px;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 8px 18px;\n            border-radius: 60px;\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            transition: all 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu a:hover,\n        .nav-menu a.active {\n            background: rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.08);\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff !important;\n            padding: 9px 22px !important;\n            margin-left: 12px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.3);\n        }\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background: #3F68E6;\n            transform: translateY(-1px);\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            padding: 6px;\n        }\n        .nav-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background-color: black;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            transition: 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== HERO 现代城市 ============== */\n        .hero {\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(34,224,199,0.05), transparent 40%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 80%, rgba(79,125,255,0.06), transparent 70%),\n                linear-gradient(125deg, #F6FAFF 0%, #FBFDFE 100%);\n            padding: 80px 0 90px;\n        }\n\n        .hero .container {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            flex: 1.05;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            background: rgba(79, 125, 255, 0.08);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(79,125,255,0.15);\n            color: var(--primary);\n            border-radius: 60px;\n            padding: 5px 14px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.82rem;\n            margin-bottom: 22px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            font-size: 3rem;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            margin-bottom: 22px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title .highlight {\n            background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--primary) 20%, #18C9F5, var(--accent));\n            background-size: 200% auto;\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            animation: gradientFlow 8s ease infinite alternate;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes gradientFlow {\n            0% { background-position: 0% center; }\n            100% { background-position: 100% center; }\n        }\n\n        .hero-desc {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 1.08rem;\n            max-width: 520px;\n            margin-bottom: 34px;\n        }\n\n        .btn-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 16px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            padding: 13px 28px;\n            border-radius: 60px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 0.92rem;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            transition: all .25s;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(79,125,255,0.25);\n        }\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: #3C64E7;\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 11px 24px rgba(79,125,255,0.35);\n        }\n\n        .btn-outline {\n            border: 2px solid var(--border);\n            background: white;\n        }\n        .btn-outline:hover {\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n\n        .btn-arrow {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transition: transform .25s;\n        }\n        .btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {\n            transform: translateX(4px);\n        }\n        .btn-outline:hover .btn-arrow {\n            transform: translateX(-2px);\n        }\n\n        .hero-visual {\n            flex: 0.95;\n            border-radius: 28px;\n            height: 440px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: #0B1220;\n            box-shadow: 0 40px 70px rgba(0, 10, 30, 0.25);\n            outline: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n        }\n\n        .hero-visual svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== Hero SVG 微动效 ============== */\n        .hero-lights circle {\n            animation: lightPulse 2.4s ease infinite alternate;\n            transform-box: fill-box;\n            transform-origin: center;\n        }\n\n        .hero-lights circle:nth-child(2) {\n            animation-delay: .8s;\n        }\n        .hero-lights circle:nth-child(3) {\n            animation-delay: 1.6s;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes lightPulse {\n            0% { opacity: .1; transform: scale(.7); }\n            100% { opacity: .95; transform: scale(1.6); }\n        }\n\n        .hero-neon line {\n            animation: neonFlicker 3.5s infinite;\n        }\n\n        .hero-neon line:nth-child(2) {\n            animation-delay: 1.1s;\n        }\n        .hero-neon line:nth-child(3) {\n            animation-delay: 2.2s;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes neonFlicker {\n            0%, 18%, 24%, 66%, 100% {\n                stroke: #31D9FD;\n                opacity: 0.9;\n                stroke-width: 3;\n            }\n            20%, 22% {\n                stroke: #ffffff;\n                opacity: 0.4;\n                stroke-width: 2;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 服务卡片 ============== */\n        .services {\n            background: var(--bg-section);\n        }\n\n        .service-grid {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 28px;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius);\n            padding: 34px 30px;\n            flex: 1 1 270px;\n            max-width: 350px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n            transition: all .3s;\n            border: 1px solid white;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(79,125,255,0.25);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 15, 40, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            width: 54px;\n            height: 54px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EDF2FF, #E0FEF8);\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n            margin-bottom: 22px;\n            transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover .service-icon {\n            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.08) rotate(2deg);\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n        }\n\n        .service-card p {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        /* 交错延迟 */\n        .service-grid .service-card:nth-child(1) { --delay: .05s; }\n        .service-grid .service-card:nth-child(2) { --delay: .2s; }\n        .service-grid .service-card:nth-child(3) { --delay: .35s; }\n\n        /* ============== 案例 轮播 ============== */\n        .showcase {\n            background: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        .simple-carousel {\n            max-width: 940px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            outline: 1px solid var(--border);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n        }\n\n        .carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            transition: transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.85, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide {\n            min-width: 100%;\n            position: relative;\n            background: #111b2c;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-slide svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 460px;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72), transparent);\n            padding: 70px 30px 26px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-caption h3 {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n        }\n        .carousel-caption p {\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            opacity: .78;\n            letter-spacing: .5px;\n        }\n\n        .carousel-btn {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 50%;\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n            width: 44px;\n            height: 44px;\n            border-radius: 60px;\n            color: #111;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n            z-index: 5;\n            transition: transform .2s;\n        }\n        .carousel-btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.08);\n        }\n\n        .prev-btn { left: 18px; }\n        .next-btn { right: 18px; }\n\n        .carousel-indicators {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 22px;\n            right: 24px;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            z-index: 7;\n        }\n\n        .indicator-dot {\n            width: 7px;\n            height: 7px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all .3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .indicator-dot.active-dot {\n            width: 20px;\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 洞察 / Tab ============== */\n        .insight {\n            background: var(--bg-section);\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel-card {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            padding: 30px 40px 45px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n        }\n\n        .tab-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);\n            padding-bottom: 18px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .tab-btn {\n            padding: 9px 22px;\n            border-radius: 60px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            transition: all .2s;\n        }\n        .tab-btn:hover {\n            background: rgba(79,125,255,0.06);\n            color: var(--primary);\n        }\n        .tab-btn.active-tab {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(79,125,255,0.3);\n        }\n\n        .tab-panel {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        .tab-panel.active-panel {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px;\n            align-items: center;\n            animation: panelFade .5s;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes panelFade {\n            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }\n            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n\n        .panel-svg {\n            width: 260px;\n            height: 190px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border-radius: 18px;\n            background: #111B2C;\n        }\n\n        .panel-svg svg {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content h3 {\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .panel-content p {\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n        }\n\n        .panel-content ul {\n            margin: 14px 0 0 20px;\n            color: var(--text-gray);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        /* 动态点阵背景微效 */\n        .tab-panel-card {\n            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(79,125,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 22px 22px;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 联系表单 ============== */\n        .contact {\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form {\n            max-width: 620px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .form-group label {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.88rem;\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input,\n        .form-group textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            border: 2px solid var(--border);\n            border-radius: 14px;\n            padding: 13px 16px;\n            font-family: inherit;\n            background: #FAFCFF;\n            transition: all .2s;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input:focus,\n        .form-group textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--primary);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79,125,255,0.12);\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .contact-submit {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 15px 28px;\n            border-radius: 60px;\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: all .25s;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .contact-submit:hover {\n            background: #3A63E8;\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(79,125,255,0.35);\n        }\n\n        .form-message {\n            display: none;\n            background: #BCF5EC;\n            color: #0B7261;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 13px 18px;\n            margin-top: 18px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 页脚 ============== */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--bg-dark);\n            color: #AAB8D5;\n        }\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 28px;\n        }\n        .footer-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 28px 0;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .footer .logo {\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .footer-links {\n            list-style: none;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 26px;\n        }\n        .footer-links a {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .copyright {\n            border-top: 1px solid #233048;\n            padding: 18px 0 28px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 返回顶部 ============== */\n        .back-to-top {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 30px;\n            right: 30px;\n            width: 48px;\n            height: 48px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: #fff;\n            font-size: 1.6rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(79,125,255,0.25);\n            transition: all .25s;\n            opacity: 0;\n            visibility: hidden;\n            transform: translateY(14px);\n            z-index: 90;\n        }\n        .back-to-top.show {\n            opacity: 1;\n            visibility: visible;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n        .back-to-top:hover {\n            background: #456DFA;\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        /* ============== 响应式 ============== */\n        @media (max-width: 992px) {\n            .hero .container {\n                flex-direction: column-reverse;\n                text-align: center;\n                gap: 36px;\n            }\n            .hero-desc {\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n            }\n            .btn-group {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n            .hero-visual {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 380px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: absolute;\n                top: var(--nav-height);\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background: white;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: 18px 20px;\n                gap: 4px;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n                transform: translateY(-110%);\n                pointer-events: none;\n                transition: all .35s ease;\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n            .nav-menu.open {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n                opacity: 1;\n                pointer-events: auto;\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu a  {\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n            .nav-cta {\n                margin-left: 0;\n            }\n\n            .service-card {\n                max-width: 480px;\n            }\n\n            .carousel-slide svg {\n                height: 300px;\n            }\n\n            .tab-panel.active-panel {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n            .panel-svg {\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 180px;\n            }\n\n            section {\n                padding: 70px 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .hero-title {\n                font-size: 2.2rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- ========== 导航 ========== -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\n                <span class=\"logo-deco\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"6\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                        <rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"17\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                        <rect x=\"16\" y=\"8\" width=\"6\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </span>\n                CITY<span>PULSE</span>\n            </a>\n\n            <button id=\"navToggle\" class=\"nav-toggle\" aria-label=\"menu\">\n                <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n            </button>\n\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"active\">首页</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#services\">服务</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#projects\">项目</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#insight\">洞察</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"nav-cta\">联系我们</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main>\n        <!-- ========== HERO ========== -->\n        <section id=\"home\" class=\"hero\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"hero-content reveal\">\n                    <div class=\"hero-badge\"> ✦ 城市数字交互体验</div>\n                    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">\n                        创意与科技<br>\n                        <span class=\"highlight\">在都市脉动中</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"hero-desc\">\n                        面向高速生长的城市，我们设计更具未来感的产品界面、数据可视化与交互系统。\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"btn-group\">\n                        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                            开始协作 <span class=\"btn-arrow\">→</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"#projects\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">\n                            观看案例 <span class=\"btn-arrow\">↘</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"hero-visual reveal\" style=\"--delay:.2s\">\n                    <!-- 现代城市氛围 SVG 动画点缀 -->\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 600\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"城市抽象天际线\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"bgGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0B1424\"></stop>\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1D3860\"></stop>\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"600\" fill=\"url(#bgGrad)\"></rect>\n                        <!-- 远楼群 -->\n                        <g fill=\"#1A2F4D\" opacity=\"0.5\">\n                            <rect x=\"20\" y=\"240\" width=\"100\" height=\"360\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"160\" y=\"140\" width=\"150\" height=\"460\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"350\" y=\"200\" width=\"80\" height=\"400\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"490\" y=\"100\" width=\"130\" height=\"500\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"680\" y=\"260\" width=\"90\" height=\"340\"></rect>\n                        </g>\n                        <!-- 近楼简影 -->\n                        <g fill=\"#0D1B2F\">\n                            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"170\" width=\"72\" height=\"430\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"120\" y=\"230\" width=\"66\" height=\"370\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"120\" width=\"120\" height=\"480\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"560\" y=\"160\" width=\"100\" height=\"440\"></rect>\n                            <rect x=\"720\" y=\"210\" width=\"80\" height=\"390\"></rect>\n                        </g>\n\n                        <!-- 发光霓虹线 -->\n                        <g class=\"hero-neon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#21D4FD\" stroke-width=\"3\">\n                            <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"200\"></line>\n                            <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n                            <line x1=\"480\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n                            <line x1=\"665\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"730\" y2=\"120\"></line>\n                        </g>\n\n                        <!-- 闪烁亮点城市之光 -->\n                        <g class=\"hero-lights\" fill=\"#22E0C7\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n                            <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"190\" r=\"2.5\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"620\" cy=\"250\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"350\" r=\"2\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"750\" cy=\"200\" r=\"2.5\"></circle>\n                        </g>\n\n                        <!-- 交通流光带 -->\n                        <g stroke=\"#66E5DC\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 8\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.4\">\n                            <path d=\"M -20 500 L 700 500\"></path>\n                            <path d=\"M 100 530 L 820 530\"></path>\n                        </g>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ========== 服务 ========== -->\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"services\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">城市数字服务</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">从概念到实现，深度贴合都市科技节奏。</p>\n\n                <div class=\"service-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"service-card reveal\">\n                        <div class=\"service-icon\">◈</div>\n                        <h3>界面系统设计</h3>\n                        <p>构建晶晰、锐利的现代界面，强调信息层级与视觉可用性，让产品与城市品牌力保持一致。</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-card reveal\">\n                        <div class=\"service-icon\">⇔</div>\n                        <h3>动态交互实验</h3>\n                        <p>以自然手势与流畅转场，让产品充满神经感。从微动效到复杂界面都有恰当的节奏。</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-card reveal\">\n                        <div class=\"service-icon\">⌗</div>\n                        <h3>前端工程实现</h3>\n                        <p>可访问、高性能的代码实现。灵活架构，适配不同终端的响应式体验。</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ========== 项目/轮播 ========== -->\n        <section id=\"projects\" class=\"showcase\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">代表性作品</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">城市智能屏、零售终端、云端工具 —— 通过数字产品推动城市效率。</p>\n\n                <div class=\"simple-carousel reveal\" id=\"urbanCarousel\">\n                    <div class=\"carousel-track\" id=\"carouselTrack\">\n                        <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" aria-label=\"城市数据平台\">\n                                <rect width=\"900\" height=\"460\" fill=\"#1D1026\"></rect>\n                                <g fill=\"#170F29\">\n                                    <polygon points=\"40,460 40,150 150,150 150,80 260,80 260,180 430,180 430,250 560,250 560,460\"></polygon>\n                                    <polygon points=\"610,460 610,100 740,100 740,220 820,220 820,460\"></polygon>\n                                </g>\n                                <g fill=\"#FD9B6B\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"110\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n                                    <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"170\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n                                    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"90\" width=\"50\" height=\"4\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"620\" y=\"260\" width=\"70\" height=\"4\"></rect>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                <h3>城市云脑 · 运营中心</h3>\n                                <p>超大屏数据可视化 / 2025</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" aria-label=\"城市出行终端\">\n                                <rect width=\"900\" height=\"460\" fill=\"#0B202A\"></rect>\n                                <g fill=\"#102433\">\n                                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"140\" height=\"280\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"300\" y=\"90\" width=\"60\" height=\"370\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"420\" y=\"250\" width=\"120\" height=\"210\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"630\" y=\"120\" width=\"180\" height=\"340\"></rect>\n                                </g>\n                                <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#53F5D2\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n                                    <path d=\"M 180 330 H 250\"></path>\n                                    <path d=\"M 510 220 H 620\"></path>\n                                    <path d=\"M 450 360 H 520\"></path>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                <h3>Flow Metro · 出行服务</h3>\n                                <p>多模式交通混合终端</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"carousel-slide\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 460\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" aria-label=\"未来零售空间\">\n                                <rect width=\"900\" height=\"460\" fill=\"#241032\"></rect>\n                                <g fill=\"#140B24\">\n                                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"200\" width=\"150\" height=\"260\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"270\" y=\"130\" width=\"80\" height=\"330\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"480\" y=\"60\" width=\"190\" height=\"400\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"750\" y=\"190\" width=\"150\" height=\"270\"></rect>\n                                </g>\n                                <circle cx=\"570\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B462FF\"></circle>\n                                <circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"250\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#F66DEA\"></circle>\n                                <rect x=\"510\" y=\"300\" width=\"100\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#A86BFF\"></rect>\n                            </svg>\n                            <div class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                <h3>NEBULA 无人商店</h3>\n                                <p>购买感受的再设计</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button class=\"carousel-btn prev-btn\" id=\"prevSlide\">‹</button>\n                    <button class=\"carousel-btn next-btn\" id=\"nextSlide\">›</button>\n\n                    <div class=\"carousel-indicators\" id=\"carouselIndicators\">\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot active-dot\" data-index=\"0\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-index=\"1\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"indicator-dot\" data-index=\"2\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ========== 洞察/tab ========== -->\n        <section id=\"insight\" class=\"insight\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">工作方法</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">像是城市规划师，先研究人流，再勾勒建筑。</p>\n\n                <div class=\"tab-panel-card reveal\">\n                    <div class=\"tab-buttons\" id=\"tabButtons\">\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn active-tab\" data-tab=\"field\">调研</button>\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"architecture\">构建</button>\n                        <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"delivery\">落地</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel active-panel\" data-panel=\"field\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-svg\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                                <rect width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#101A2C\"></rect>\n                                <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22B8DE\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"90\" r=\"28\"></circle>\n                                    <path d=\"M 80 62 L 200 45 M 100 105 L 200 130\"></path>\n                                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"45\" r=\"10\"></circle>\n                                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"130\" r=\"12\"></circle>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3>理解真实使用场景</h3>\n                            <p>通过人种志调研和数据分析，定义城市场景中的典型用户与任务。</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>用户访谈与现场观察</li>\n                                <li>城市互动触点提取</li>\n                                <li>从噪音中找到决策信号</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"architecture\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-svg\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                                <rect width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#1D1127\"></rect>\n                                <g fill=\"#4F7DFF\">\n                                    <rect x=\"40\" y=\"50\" width=\"50\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"140\" y=\"100\" width=\"45\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#22E0C7\"></rect>\n                                    <rect x=\"230\" y=\"140\" width=\"45\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#F27BD0\"></rect>\n                                </g>\n                                <g stroke=\"#CCB8FF\" fill=\"none\">\n                                    <path d=\"M 70 78 L 165 100 M 165 128 L 255 140\"></path>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3>系统蓝图与模块设计</h3>\n                            <p>根据行为路径拆解功能地图，编排数据流与页面状态。</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>信息架构与任务流</li>\n                                <li>组件化和状态管理</li>\n                                <li>设计规范与可复用资产</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"delivery\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-svg\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                                <rect width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#122317\"></rect>\n                                <g fill=\"#20E59A\">\n                                    <polygon points=\"30,160 30,90 70,90 70,160\"></polygon>\n                                    <polygon points=\"115,160 115,30 160,30 160,160\"></polygon>\n                                    <polygon points=\"210,160 210,100 250,100 250,160\"></polygon>\n                                </g>\n                                <g stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.5\">\n                                    <path d=\"M 133 30 V 77\"></path>\n                                    <path d=\"M 135 160 V 130\"></path>\n                                </g>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"panel-content\">\n                            <h3>透明交付与持续优化</h3>\n                            <p>通过版本迭代、性能监测、用户反馈循环，让产品像城市一样有机更新。</p>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>健壮的前端架构与指标治理</li>\n                                <li>设计与开发的深度协作</li>\n                                <li>监控上线后行为，快速迭代</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- ========== 联系 ========== -->\n        <section id=\"contact\" class=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title text-center\">开启城市项目</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle text-center\">无论您在哪个时区，我们都准备好用设计为你创造新体验。</p>\n\n                <form class=\"contact-form reveal\" id=\"contactForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" placeholder=\"你的名字\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"email\">邮箱</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"hello@city.com\" required>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"org\">公司 / 机构（选填）</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"org\" placeholder=\"创意科技公司\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"message\">项目想法</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"请告诉我们时间节点、目标和遇到的挑战……\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"contact-submit\">\n                        传送需求 <span class=\"btn-arrow\">→</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"form-message\" id=\"formSuccess\">✓ 已成功发送！我们会像城市脉搏一样快速响应。</div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- ========== 页脚 ========== -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-content\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">CITY<span>PULSE</span></a>\n                <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#home\">首页</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#services\">服务</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#projects\">案例</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#contact\">联系</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"copyright\">© 2025 City Pulse | 城市数字产品体验室</div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- 回到顶部 -->\n    <button class=\"back-to-top\" id=\"backToTop\">↥</button>\n\n    <!-- ============ 原生 JS ============ -->\n    <script>\n        (function () {\n            \'use strict\';\n\n            /* ---- 导航 ---- */\n            const navToggle = document.getElementById(\'navToggle\');\n            const navMenu = document.getElementById(\'navMenu\');\n            if (navToggle && navMenu) {\n                navToggle.addEventListener(\'click\', () => navMenu.classList.toggle(\'open\'));\n                document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-menu > li > a\').forEach(link => link.addEventListener(\'click\', () => navMenu.classList.remove(\'open\')));\n            }\n\n            /* ---- 高亮导航 / 返回顶部 ---- */\n            const backTop = document.getElementById(\'backToTop\');\n            const sections = document.querySelectorAll(\'main section[id]\');\n            const navAnchors = document.querySelectorAll(\'.nav-menu a:not(.nav-cta)\');\n\n            function updateScrollState() {\n                if (window.scrollY > 500) {\n                    backTop.classList.add(\'show\');\n                } else {\n                    backTop.classList.remove(\'show\');\n                }\n\n                const currentPos = window.scrollY + 100;\n                let activeId = \'\';\n                sections.forEach(section => {\n                    const top = section.offsetTop;\n                    const bottom = top + section.offsetHeight;\n                    if (currentPos >= top && currentPos < bottom) activeId = section.getAttribute(\'id\');\n                });\n\n                navAnchors.forEach(link => {\n                    link.classList.remove(\'active\');\n                    if (link.getAttribute(\'href\') === `#${activeId}`) link.classList.add(\'active\');\n                });\n            }\n\n            backTop.addEventListener(\'click\', () => window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' }));\n            window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', updateScrollState, { passive: true });\n            updateScrollState();\n\n            /* ---- 轮播逻辑 ---- */\n            const track = document.getElementById(\'carouselTrack\');\n            const slides = document.querySelectorAll(\'.carousel-slide\');\n            const prevBtn = document.getElementById(\'prevSlide\');\n            const nextBtn = document.getElementById(\'nextSlide\');\n            const dots = document.querySelectorAll(\'.indicator-dot\');\n            let current = 0;\n\n            function goTo(index) {\n                if (index < 0) index = slides.length - 1;\n                if (index >= slides.length) index = 0;\n                current = index;\n                track.style.transform = `translateX(-${current * 100}%)`;\n                dots.forEach((dot, i) => {\n                    dot.classList.toggle(\'active-dot\', i === current);\n                });\n            }\n\n            if (prevBtn && nextBtn) {\n                prevBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', () => goTo(current - 1));\n                nextBtn.addEventListener(\'click\', () => goTo(current + 1));\n                dots.forEach(dot => dot.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    goTo(parseInt(this.dataset.index));\n                }));\n\n                /* 自动播放 */\n                let interval = setInterval(() => goTo(current + 1), 6000);\n                const carousel = document.getElementById(\'urbanCarousel\');\n                carousel.addEventListener(\'mouseenter\', () => clearInterval(interval));\n                carousel.addEventListener(\'mouseleave\', () => { interval = setInterval(() => goTo(current + 1), 6000); });\n            }\n\n            /* ---- Tabs ---- */\n            const tabBtns = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-btn\');\n            const tabPanels = document.querySelectorAll(\'.tab-panel\');\n\n            tabBtns.forEach(btn => {\n                btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\n                    const targetTab = this.dataset.tab;\n                    tabBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove(\'active-tab\'));\n                    tabPanels.forEach(p => p.classList.remove(\'active-panel\'));\n                    this.classList.add(\'active-tab\');\n                    document.querySelector(`.tab-panel[data-panel=\"${targetTab}\"]`).classList.add(\'active-panel\');\n                });\n            });\n\n            /* ---- 表单 ---- */\n            const form = document.getElementById(\'contactForm\');\n            const successMsg = document.getElementById(\'formSuccess\');\n\n            form.addEventListener(\'submit\', function (event) {\n                event.preventDefault();\n                const name = document.getElementById(\'name\').value.trim();\n                const email = document.getElementById(\'email\').value.trim();\n                const msg = document.getElementById(\'message\').value.trim();\n\n                if (!name || !email || !msg) {\n                    alert(\'请填写完整姓名、邮箱与项目描述\');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                successMsg.style.display = \'block\';\n                form.reset();\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    successMsg.style.display = \'none\';\n                }, 4000);\n            });\n\n            /* ---- Intersection Observer 滚动显现动画 ---- */\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll(\'.reveal\');\n\n            if (\'IntersectionObserver\' in window) {\n                const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n                    entries.forEach(entry => {\n                        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                            entry.target.classList.add(\'visible\');\n                            observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: \'0px 0px -40px 0px\' });\n\n                revealElements.forEach((el, index) => {\n                    observer.observe(el);\n                });\n            } else {\n                /* 旧浏览器退路 */\n                revealElements.forEach(el => el.classList.add(\'visible\'));\n            }\n        })();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```','ai',454879448563617792,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:54:25','2026-09-09 13:59:10',1),(454916604166299648,'构建一个功能完整的在线商城，包含商品展示、购物车、用户注册登录、订单管理、支付结算等功能。设计现代化的商品卡片布局，支持商品搜索筛选、用户评价、优惠券系统和会员积分功能。','user',454916601909764096,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:57:10','2026-09-09 13:58:57',1),(454916928369221632,'AI回复失败dev.langchain4j.guardrail.OutputGuardrailException: Cannot invoke \"String.trim()\" because \"text\" is null','ai',454916601909764096,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:58:27','2026-09-09 13:58:57',1),(454916941556113408,'构建一个功能完整的在线商城，包含商品展示、购物车、用户注册登录、订单管理、支付结算等功能。设计现代化的商品卡片布局，支持商品搜索筛选、用户评价、优惠券系统和会员积分功能。','user',454916601909764096,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:58:30','2026-09-09 13:58:57',1),(454917174973325312,'AI回复失败dev.langchain4j.exception.InvalidRequestException: {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Invalid assistant message: content or tool_calls must be set\",\"type\":\"invalid_request_error\",\"param\":null,\"code\":\"invalid_request_error\"}}','ai',454916601909764096,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:59:26','2026-09-09 13:58:57',1),(454917187862421504,'构建一个功能完整的在线商城，包含商品展示、购物车、用户注册登录、订单管理、支付结算等功能。设计现代化的商品卡片布局，支持商品搜索筛选、用户评价、优惠券系统和会员积分功能。','user',454916601909764096,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:59:29','2026-09-09 13:58:57',1),(454917285539373056,'AI回复失败dev.langchain4j.exception.InvalidRequestException: {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Invalid assistant message: content or tool_calls must be set\",\"type\":\"invalid_request_error\",\"param\":null,\"code\":\"invalid_request_error\"}}','ai',454916601909764096,447528512765485056,'2026-09-08 20:59:52','2026-09-09 13:58:57',1),(454917298432663552,'构建一个功能完整的在线商城，包含商品展示、购物车、用户注册登录、订单管理、支付结算等功能。设计现代化的商品卡片布局，支持商品搜索筛选、用户评价、优惠券系统和会员积分功能。','user',4549