\n.f-badge {\n  width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 11px; background: var(--gradient); color: #fff;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px;\n}\n.footer-brand p { margin: 16px 0 20px; font-size: 14.5px; color: #94a3b8; max-width: 300px; }\n.f-social { display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n.f-social a {\n  width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px;\n  color: #e2e8f0; transition: all 0.25s ease;\n}\n.f-social a:hover { background: var(--primary); border-color: var(--primary); color: #fff; }\n.footer-col h4 { color: #fff; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n.footer-col a { display: block; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 12px; transition: color 0.2s; }\n.footer-col a:hover { color: var(--primary); }\n.footer-bottom {\n  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding: 22px 0;\n  font-size: 13.5px; color: #64748b;\n}\n.footer-legal { display: flex; gap: 22px; }\n.footer-legal a:hover { color: var(--primary); }\n\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\n  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/HomePage.vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div class=\"home-page\">\n    <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container hero-grid\">\n        <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n          <span class=\"hero-pill\">✨ 全新一代 · 现已发布</span>\n          <h1>ChatGPT 6<br />让每一次对话都产生价值</h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-lead\">\n            更强的推理、更自然的表达、更懂你的意图。ChatGPT 6 融合多模态理解、超长上下文与实时联网能力，成为你工作、学习与创作中最值得信赖的 AI 伙伴。\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"hero-acti