，2 小时快速响应。\', en: \'Local teams in 50+ cities with 2-hour rapid response.\' }\n  }\n]\n\n// 产品服务\nexport const products = [\n  {\n    img: img(\'p-cloud\', 640, 400),\n    tag: { zh: \'云计算\', en: \'Cloud\' },\n    name: { zh: \'云启企业云平台\', en: \'CloudQ Enterprise Platform\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'弹性计算、对象存储与容灾备份一体化服务，助力企业基础设施全面上云，可用性高达 99.99%。\',\n      en: \'One-stop elastic computing, storage and DR backup for a full cloud journey with up to 99.99% SLA.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'p-bigdata\', 640, 400),\n    tag: { zh: \'大数据\', en: \'Big Data\' },\n    name: { zh: \'智数分析引擎\', en: \'Insight Analytics Engine\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'海量数据实时采集、治理与可视化分析，让数据驱动经营决策，充分释放业务增长潜能。\',\n      en: \'Real-time collection, governance and visualization empower data-driven decisions and growth.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'p-ai\', 640, 400),\n    tag: { zh: \'人工智能\', en: \'AI\' },\n    name: { zh: \'星辰 AI 平台\', en: \'Nova AI Platform\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'提供 NLP、视觉识别与智能预测能力，支持私有化部署，助力业务场景智能化升级。\',\n      en: \'NLP, computer vision and forecasting with private deployment to upgrade business scenarios.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'p-office\', 640, 400),\n    tag: { zh: \'协同办公\', en: \'Office\' },\n    name: { zh: \'慧联智慧办公\', en: \'HuiLian Smart Office\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'一站式协同办公、流程审批与知识管理，让团队沟通与协作效率提升 40% 以上。\',\n      en: \'All-in-one collaboration, approvals and KM improve team productivity by over 40%.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'p-iot\', 640, 400),\n    tag: { zh: \'物联网\', en: \'IoT\' },\n    name: { zh: \'万物互联 IoT 平台\', en: \'Omni IoT Platform\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'千万级设备连接管理、边缘计算与远程运维，为智能制造构建稳定可靠的物联网底座。\',\n      en: \'Million-device management, edge computing and remote O&M power smart manufacturing.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'p-sec\', 640, 400),\n    tag: { zh: \'信息安全\', en: \'Security\' },\n    name: { zh: \'盾甲安全防护体系\', en: \'ShieldGuard Security\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'覆盖 Web 防护、数据加密与零信任访问，构建企业全方位的信息安全防御屏障。\',\n      en: \'Web protection, encryption and zero-trust access form an all-round security shield.\'\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n// 客户案例\nexport const cases = [\n  {\n    logo: \'恒\',\n    color: \'#1e5cff\',\n    name: { zh: \'恒通制造集团\', en: \'Hengtong Manufacturing\' },\n    industry: { zh: \'智能制造\', en: \'Smart Manufacturing\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'基于 IoT 平台与数据分析，完成 8 个生产基地数字化改造，实现全流程可视化管理。\',\n      en: \'Digitally transformed 8 plants with IoT and analytics for full process visibility.\'\n    },\n    num: \'30%\',\n    unit: { zh: \'产线效率提升\', en: \'productivity gain\' }\n  },\n  {\n    logo: \'蓝\',\n    color: \'#0ea5e9\',\n    name: { zh: \'蓝海零售集团\', en: \'BlueOcean Retail\' },\n    industry: { zh: \'新零售\', en: \'New Retail\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'智慧门店与会员数据中台建设，支持 2000+ 门店的统一运营与精准营销。\',\n      en: \'Smart stores and CDP power unified operation of 2,000+ outlets.\'\n    },\n    num: \'2000+\',\n    unit: { zh: \'门店智慧运营\', en: \'stores online\' }\n  },\n  {\n    logo: \'国\',\n    color: \'#10b981\',\n    name: { zh: \'国信银行\', en: \'Guoxin Bank\' },\n    industry: { zh: \'金融科技\', en: \'Fintech\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'两地三中心云容灾与分布式核心改造，关键系统全年可用性保持行业领先。\',\n      en: \'Multi-site DR and distributed core keep key systems at industry-leading uptime.\'\n    },\n    num: \'99.99%\',\n    unit: { zh: \'系统可用性\', en: \'system uptime\' }\n  },\n  {\n    logo: \'航\',\n    color: \'#f59e0b\',\n    name: { zh: \'云帆航空物流\', en: \'Yunfan Air Logistics\' },\n    industry: { zh: \'航空物流\', en: \'Air Logistics\' },\n    desc: {\n      zh: \'智能调度与全程可视化系统上线后，干支线协同效率显著提升，运营成本持续优化。\',\n      en: \'Smart scheduling and tracking improved coordination and cut operating costs.\'\n    },\n    num: \'60%\',\n    unit: { zh: \'调度成本优化\', en: \'cost reduced\' }\n  }\n]\n\n// 团队介绍\nexport const team = [\n  {\n    img: img(\'team-chen\', 500, 500),\n    name: { zh: \'陈明远\', en: \'Chen Mingyuan\' },\n    role: { zh: \'创始人 & CEO\', en: \'Founder & CEO\' },\n    desc: { zh: \'前某头部云厂商技术高管，主导过多个千万级云平台建设项目。\', en: \'Ex-senior exec at a top cloud vendor, led multiple 10M-user platforms.\' }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'team-su\', 500, 500),\n    name: { zh: \'苏婉婷\', en: \'Su Wanting\' },\n    role: { zh: \'首席技术官 CTO\', en: \'Chief Technology Officer\' },\n    desc: { zh: \'分布式系统与 AI 算法专家，拥有 20 余项核心发明专利。\', en: \'Expert in distributed systems & AI with 20+ core patents.\' }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'team-wang\', 500, 500),\n    name: { zh: \'王立峰\', en: \'Wang Lifeng\' },\n    role: { zh: \'产品副总裁\', en: \'VP of Product\' },\n    desc: { zh: \'深耕 B 端产品十余年，打造了服务 3000+ 企业的产品矩阵。\', en: \'10+ years in B2B products, built solutions for 3,000+ enterprises.\' }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'team-lin\', 500, 500),\n    name: { zh: \'林小雅\', en: \'Lin Xiaoya\' },\n    role: { zh: \'首席架构师\', en: \'Chief Architect\' },\n    desc: { zh: \'企业级微服务与云原生架构专家，主导多项大型政企项目落地。\', en: \'Cloud-native architect driving large government & enterprise projects.\' }\n  }\n]\n\n// 新闻资讯\nexport const newsList = [\n  {\n    img: img(\'n-fund\', 800, 500),\n    cat: { zh: \'公司动态\', en: \'Company\' },\n    date: \'2024-12-18\',\n    title: { zh: \'华辰科技完成 5 亿元 B 轮融资，加速 AI 平台布局\', en: \'Huachen closes ¥500M Series B to accelerate AI platform\' },\n    summary: {\n      zh: \'本轮融资将主要用于行业大模型研发投入与全国服务网络建设。\',\n      en: \'The round will fund industry LLM R&D and nationwide service expansion.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'n-ai\', 800, 500),\n    cat: { zh: \'产品发布\', en: \'Product\' },\n    date: \'2024-11-06\',\n    title: { zh: \'新一代企业级 AI 大模型一体机正式发布\', en: \'New enterprise AI all-in-one appliance launched\' },\n    summary: {\n      zh: \'开箱即用、数据不出域，帮助政企客户安全落地大模型应用。\',\n      en: \'Out-of-the-box and data-sovereign LLM appliance for secure public & enterprise use.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'n-factory\', 800, 500),\n    cat: { zh: \'行业方案\', en: \'Industry\' },\n    date: \'2024-10-22\',\n    title: { zh: \'华辰助力恒通集团打造智能制造标杆工厂\', en: \'Huachen builds benchmark smart factory with Hengtong\' },\n    summary: {\n      zh: \'项目覆盖 8 大生产基地，设备联网率提升至 95%，交期缩短 20%。\',\n      en: \'Covers 8 plants with 95% machine connectivity and 20% shorter lead times.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'n-award\', 800, 500),\n    cat: { zh: \'荣誉奖项\', en: \'Awards\' },\n    date: \'2024-09-15\',\n    title: { zh: \'华辰科技荣获“数字化转型领军企业”称号\', en: \'Huachen named Digital Transformation Leader\' },\n    summary: {\n      zh: \'凭借卓越的技术实力与交付能力，再次获得行业权威认可。\',\n      en: \'Recognized again for outstanding technology and delivery excellence.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'n-lab\', 800, 500),\n    cat: { zh: \'合作交流\', en: \'Partnership\' },\n    date: \'2024-08-30\',\n    title: { zh: \'华辰与三所高校共建人工智能联合实验室\', en: \'Huachen co-founds AI labs with three universities\' },\n    summary: {\n      zh: \'产学研协同创新，加速前沿人工智能技术在产业中的落地。\',\n      en: \'Collaborative innovation to accelerate frontier AI in industry.\'\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    img: img(\'n-milestone\', 800, 500),\n    cat: { zh: \'公司动态\', en: \'Company\' },\n    date: \'2024-07-12\',\n    title: { zh: \'华辰服务企业客户突破 3000 家\', en: \'Huachen passes 3,000 enterprise clients\' },\n    summary: {\n      zh: \'十五年持续深耕，客户成功理念驱动我们不断前行。\',\n      en: \'15 years of dedication, driven by our customer success philosophy.\'\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/Home.vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <!-- 轮播 -->\n    <BannerCarousel :slides=\"slides\" />\n\n    <!-- 数据亮点 -->\n    <section class=\"stat-bar\">\n      <div class=\"container stat-grid\">\n        <div v-for=\"(s, i) in stats\" :key=\"i\" class=\"stat\">\n          <b>{{ s.num }}</b>\n          <span>{{ s.label }}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 核心优势 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.fEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.fTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.fSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <div v-for=\"(f, i) in feats\" :key=\"i\" class=\"feature\">\n            <span class=\"f-icon\" :style=\"{ background: f.color + \'1a\', color: f.color }\">{{ f.g }}</span>\n            <h3>{{ f.title }}</h3>\n            <p>{{ f.desc }}</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 产品预览 -->\n    <section class=\"section alt\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.pEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.pTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.pSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n          <ProductCard v-for=\"p in featured\" :key=\"p.name\" :p=\"p\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"center\">\n          <router-link to=\"/products\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">{{ ui.viewAll }}</router-link>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 客户案例 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.cEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.cTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.cSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <CaseCard v-for=\"c in cases\" :key=\"c.name\" :c=\"c\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 新闻 -->\n    <section class=\"section alt\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.nEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.nTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.nSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n          <NewsCard v-for=\"n in news\" :key=\"n.title\" :n=\"n\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"center\">\n          <router-link to=\"/news\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">{{ ui.moreNews }}</router-link>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CTA -->\n    <section class=\"cta\">\n      <div class=\"container cta-inner\">\n        <div>\n          <h2>{{ ui.ctaTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.ctaSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <router-link to=\"/contact\" class=\"btn btn-light\">{{ ui.ctaBtn }}</router-link>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { computed } from \'vue\'\nimport BannerCarousel from \'@/components/BannerCarousel.vue\'\nimport ProductCard from \'@/components/ProductCard.vue\'\nimport CaseCard from \'@/components/CaseCard.vue\'\nimport NewsCard from \'@/components/NewsCard.vue\'\nimport { useLocale } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport { pick, heroSlides, features, products, cases, newsList } from \'@/utils/data\'\n\nconst { currentLang, t } = useLocale()\nconst L = computed(() => currentLang.value)\n\nconst homeText = {\n  zh: {\n    fEyebrow: \'我们的优势\', fTitle: \'为什么选择华辰科技\', fSub: \'十五年技术沉淀，构建安全、高效、可扩展的企业数字化底座\',\n    pEyebrow: \'产品与解决方案\', pTitle: \'一站式企业级产品矩阵\', pSub: \'覆盖云、数、智、联、安五大领域，助力业务全面升级\',\n    viewAll: \'查看全部产品\',\n    cEyebrow: \'客户案例\', cTitle: \'深受行业标杆客户信赖\', cSub: \'从制造到金融，3000+ 企业正在与华辰共创价值\',\n    nEyebrow: \'新闻动态\', nTitle: \'行业洞察与最新资讯\', nSub: \'了解华辰的最新动态与技术前沿\',\n    moreNews: \'更多新闻\',\n    ctaTitle: \'准备好开启数字化转型了吗？\', ctaSub: \'预约专属顾问，获取定制化解决方案\', ctaBtn: \'立即预约\'\n  },\n  en: {\n    fEyebrow: \'Why Us\', fTitle: \'Why Choose Huachen Tech\', fSub: \'15 years of expertise building secure, efficient and scalable digital foundations\',\n    pEyebrow: \'Solutions\', pTitle: \'One-stop Enterprise Product Suite\', pSub: \'Covering cloud, data, AI, IoT and security to upgrade your business\',\n    viewAll: \'View All Products\',\n    cEyebrow: \'Customers\', cTitle: \'Trusted by Industry Leaders\', cSub: \'From manufacturing to finance, 3,000+ enterprises create value with us\',\n    nEyebrow: \'News\', nTitle: \'Insights & Latest News\', nSub: \'Stay up to date with Huachen and technology frontiers\',\n    moreNews: \'More News\',\n    ctaTitle: \'Ready to Start Your Digital Transformation?\', ctaSub: \'Talk to a consultant and get a tailored solution\', ctaBtn: \'Book Now\'\n  }\n}\n\nconst ui = computed(() => t(homeText))\n\nconst slides = computed(() =>\n  heroSlides.map((s) => ({\n    img: s.img,\n    tag: pick(s.tag, L.value),\n    title: pick(s.title, L.value),\n    sub: pick(s.sub, L.value),\n    btn1: pick(s.btn1, L.value),\n    btn2: pick(s.btn2, L.value)\n  }))\n)\n\nconst feats = computed(() =>\n  features.map((f) => ({\n    g: f.g,\n    color: f.color,\n    title: pick(f.title, L.value),\n    desc: pick(f.desc, L.value)\n  }))\n)\n\nconst featured = computed(() =>\n  products.slice(0, 3).map((p) => ({\n    img: p.img,\n    tag: pick(p.tag, L.value),\n    name: pick(p.name, L.value),\n    desc: pick(p.desc, L.value),\n    more: L.value === \'zh\' ? \'了解更多\' : \'Learn more\'\n  }))\n)\n\nconst caseData = computed(() =>\n  cases.map((c) => ({\n    logo: c.logo,\n    color: c.color,\n    name: pick(c.name, L.value),\n    industry: pick(c.industry, L.value),\n    desc: pick(c.desc, L.value),\n    num: c.num,\n    unit: pick(c.unit, L.value)\n  }))\n)\n\nconst news = computed(() =>\n  newsList.slice(0, 3).map((n) => ({\n    img: n.img,\n    cat: pick(n.cat, L.value),\n    date: n.date,\n    title: pick(n.title, L.value),\n    summary: pick(n.summary, L.value),\n    more: L.value === \'zh\' ? \'阅读全文\' : \'Read more\'\n  }))\n)\n\nconst stats = computed(() => {\n  const list = L.value === \'zh\'\n    ? [[\'15+\', \'年行业深耕\'], [\'3000+\', \'企业客户\'], [\'98%\', \'客户满意度\'], [\'50+\', \'服务城市\']]\n    : [[\'15+\', \'Years Experience\'], [\'3000+\', \'Enterprise Clients\'], [\'98%\', \'Satisfaction\'], [\'50+\', \'Cities Served\']]\n  return list.map(([num, label]) => ({ num, label }))\n})\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.stat-bar {\n  background: var(--navy);\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 30px 0;\n  margin-top: -1px;\n}\n.stat-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.stat b {\n  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 42px);\n  color: var(--gold);\n  display: block;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n.stat span {\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n.feature {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 30px 24px;\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n.feature:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-6px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  border-color: transparent;\n}\n.f-icon {\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 52px;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.feature h3 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  font-size: 17px;\n}\n.feature p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n.center {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-top: 40px;\n}\n.cta {\n  background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));\n  padding: 56px 0;\n}\n.cta-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 20px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n.cta h2 {\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.cta p {\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);\n}\n.btn-light {\n  background: #fff;\n  color: var(--primary);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n.btn-light:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);\n}\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .stat-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n  .cta-inner {\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/About.vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.title }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.sub }}</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 公司介绍 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container about-grid\">\n        <div class=\"about-img\">\n          <img :src=\"officeImg\" alt=\"office\" />\n          <div class=\"float-card\">\n            <b>3000+</b>\n            <span>{{ ui.clients }}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"about-text\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.eyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.aboutTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.p1 }}</p>\n          <p>{{ ui.p2 }}</p>\n          <div class=\"marks\">\n            <div v-for=\"(m, i) in marks\" :key=\"i\" class=\"mark\">\n              <span class=\"mark-icon\">✓</span>\n              <div><b>{{ m.t }}</b><small>{{ m.d }}</small></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 发展历程 -->\n    <section class=\"section alt\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.mEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.mTitle }}</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline\">\n          <div v-for=\"(m, i) in milestones\" :key=\"i\" class=\"tl-item\">\n            <span class=\"tl-year\">{{ m.year }}</span>\n            <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"tl-body\">\n              <h3>{{ m.title }}</h3>\n              <p>{{ m.desc }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 团队介绍 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.tEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.tTitle }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ ui.tSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <div v-for=\"(m, i) in members\" :key=\"i\" class=\"member\">\n            <div class=\"m-img\"><img :src=\"m.img\" :alt=\"m.name\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n            <div class=\"m-info\">\n              <h3>{{ m.name }}</h3>\n              <span>{{ m.role }}</span>\n              <p>{{ m.desc }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { computed } from \'vue\'\nimport { useLocale } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport { pick, team } from \'@/utils/data\'\n\nconst { currentLang, t } = useLocale()\nconst L = computed(() => currentLang.value)\n\nconst officeImg = \'https://picsum.photos/seed/office-team/760/560\'\n\nconst dict = {\n  zh: {\n    title: \'关于华辰科技\', sub: \'用技术创造价值，以服务成就客户\',\n    eyebrow: \'公司简介\', aboutTitle: \'十五年深耕，做企业数字化转型的长期伙伴\',\n    p1: \'华辰数字科技有限公司成立于 2009 年，总部位于上海，是一家专注于云计算、大数据、人工智能及企业软件服务的国家高新技术企业。我们始终坚持以客户为中心，以创新为驱动，助力各行业客户构建数字化核心能力。\',\n    p2: \'目前公司拥有研发人员 800 余名，在北京、深圳、杭州、成都等地设立分支机构，服务客户覆盖制造、金融、零售、能源、政务等多个关键领域。\',\n    clients: \'客户信赖之选\',\n    marks: [\n      { t: \'自主研发\', d: \'200+ 项软件著作权\' },\n      { t: \'资质认证\', d: \'CMMI5 / ISO27001\' },\n      { t: \'生态合作\', d: \'与华为、阿里、腾讯深度合作\' }\n    ],\n    mEyebrow: \'发展历程\', mTitle: \'与时代同行的每一步\',\n    tEyebrow: \'核心团队\', tTitle: \'专业 · 热爱 · 担当\', tSub: \'汇聚行业顶尖人才，以工程化方法打磨每一款产品\'\n  },\n  en: {\n    title: \'About Huachen\', sub: \'Create value with technology, achieve customers with service\',\n    eyebrow: \'Who We Are\', aboutTitle: \'15 years as a long-term partner in digital transformation\',\n    p1: \'Founded in 2009 and headquartered in Shanghai, Huachen Digital Technology is a national high-tech enterprise focused on cloud computing, big data, AI and enterprise software services. Customer-centric and innovation-driven, we help clients build core digital capabilities.\',\n    p2: \'With 800+ R&D staff and offices in Beijing, Shenzhen, Hangzhou and Chengdu, we serve manufacturing, finance, retail, energy and government sectors.\',\n    clients: \'Trusted Clients\',\n    marks: [\n      { t: \'In-house R&D\', d: \'200+ software copyrights\' },\n      { t: \'Certifications\', d: \'CMMI5 / ISO27001\' },\n      { t: \'Ecosystem\', d: \'Partners with Huawei, Alibaba, Tencent\' }\n    ],\n    mEyebrow: \'Milestones\', mTitle: \'Every step in step with the era\',\n    tEyebrow: \'Our Team\', tTitle: \'Professional · Passionate · Responsible\', tSub: \'Top talent united by engineering excellence\'\n  }\n}\nconst ui = computed(() => t(dict))\n\nconst marks = computed(() =>\n  (L.value === \'zh\' ? ui.value.marks : ui.value.marks).map((m) => ({ t: m.t, d: m.d }))\n)\n\nconst milestones = computed(() => {\n  const list = L.value === \'zh\'\n    ? [\n        { year: \'2009\', title: \'公司成立\', desc: \'华辰科技在上海正式成立，主营系统集成与软件外包。\' },\n        { year: \'2014\', title: \'云服务启航\', desc: \'发布企业级云平台，成为首批可信云服务认证企业。\' },\n        { year: \'2018\', title: \'全国化布局\', desc: \'完成 A 轮融资，业务覆盖全国 30 余个省市。\' },\n        { year: \'2021\', title: \'AI 战略升级\', desc: \'成立人工智能研究院，发布行业 AI 平台与算法中台。\' },\n        { year: \'2024\', title: \'迈向全球化\', desc: \'完成 B 轮融资，AI 大模型一体化解决方案规模化落地。\' }\n      ]\n    : [\n        { year: \'2009\', title: \'Founded\', desc: \'Founded in Shanghai, focusing on system integration and software outsourcing.\' },\n        { year: \'2014\', title: \'Cloud Launch\', desc: \'Released enterprise cloud platform, among first Trusted Cloud certified vendors.\' },\n        { year: \'2018\', title: \'Nationwide\', desc: \'Completed Series A, serving over 30 provinces and cities.\' },\n        { year: \'2021\', title: \'AI Upgrade\', desc: \'Established AI Research Institute, launched industry AI platform.\' },\n        { year: \'2024\', title: \'Going Global\', desc: \'Completed Series B, scaled LLM-integrated solutions.\' }\n      ]\n  return list\n})\n\nconst members = computed(() =>\n  team.map((m) => ({\n    img: m.img,\n    name: pick(m.name, L.value),\n    role: pick(m.role, L.value),\n    desc: pick(m.desc, L.value)\n  }))\n)\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.about-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;\n  gap: 56px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.about-img {\n  position: relative;\n}\n.about-img img {\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 420px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n.float-card {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: -18px;\n  bottom: 30px;\n  background: #fff;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 18px 24px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  text-align: center;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);\n}\n.float-card b {\n  color: var(--primary);\n  font-size: 30px;\n  display: block;\n}\n.float-card span {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n.about-text h2 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n.about-text > p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n}\n.marks {\n  margin-top: 22px;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.mark {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 14px;\n  align-items: center;\n  background: var(--light);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n.mark-icon {\n  width: 30px;\n  height: 30px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: #fff;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.mark b {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  display: block;\n}\n.mark small {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n/* 时间线 */\n.timeline {\n  position: relative;\n  max-width: 880px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.timeline::before {\n  content: \'\';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 50%;\n  top: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 2px;\n  background: var(--border);\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n}\n.tl-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 40px;\n  margin-bottom: 36px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.tl-item:nth-child(odd) .tl-body {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n.tl-year {\n  width: 90px;\n  text-align: center;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: #fff;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  padding: 6px 0;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n.tl-dot {\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 3px solid var(--primary);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n.tl-body {\n  flex: 1;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 18px 22px;\n}\n.tl-body h3 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.tl-body p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n/* 团队 */\n.member {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n.member:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-6px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n.m-img {\n  height: 250px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.m-img img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  transition: transform 0.5s;\n}\n.member:hover .m-img img {\n  transform: scale(1.06);\n}\n.m-info {\n  padding: 18px 20px 22px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.m-info h3 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n.m-info > span {\n  display: inline-block;\n  color: var(--primary);\n  background: rgba(30, 92, 255, 0.08);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  padding: 3px 12px;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  margin: 6px 0 10px;\n}\n.m-info p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .about-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    gap: 40px;\n  }\n  .timeline::before,\n  .tl-dot {\n    left: 44px;\n  }\n  .tl-item {\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n  .tl-item:nth-child(odd) .tl-body {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .tl-year {\n    width: 76px;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/Products.vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.title }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.sub }}</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n          <ProductCard v-for=\"p in items\" :key=\"p.name\" :p=\"p\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section alt process\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ ui.prEyebrow }}</span>\n          <h2>{{ ui.prTitle }}</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"steps\">\n          <div v-for=\"(s, i) in steps\" :key=\"i\" class=\"step\">\n            <span class=\"step-no\">{{ i + 1 }}</span>\n            <h3>{{ s.t }}</h3>\n            <p>{{ s.d }}</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { computed } from \'vue\'\nimport ProductCard from \'@/components/ProductCard.vue\'\nimport { useLocale } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport { pick, products } from \'@/utils/data\'\n\nconst { currentLang, t } = useLocale()\nconst L = computed(() => currentLang.value)\n\nconst dict = {\n  zh: {\n    title: \'产品与解决方案\', sub: \'覆盖云、数、智、联、安五大领域的一站式企业数字化产品矩阵\',\n    prEyebrow: \'服务流程\', prTitle: \'从咨询到交付的全流程保障\'\n  },\n  en: {\n    title: \'Products & Solutions\', sub: \'One-stop enterprise digital portfolio across cloud, data, AI, IoT and security\',\n    prEyebrow: \'Process\', prTitle: \'End-to-end delivery assurance\'\n  }\n}\nconst ui = computed(() => t(dict))\n\nconst items = computed(() =>\n  products.map((p) => ({\n    img: p.img,\n    tag: pick(p.tag, L.value),\n    name: pick(p.name, L.value),\n    desc: pick(p.desc, L.value),\n    more: L.value === \'zh\' ? \'了解更多\' : \'Learn more\'\n  }))\n)\n\nconst steps = computed(() => {\n  const list = L.value === \'zh\'\n    ? [\n        { t: \'需求诊断\', d: \'资深顾问深入调研业务场景与现状\' },\n        { t: \'方案设计\', d: \'定制化架构设计与实施路线图\' },\n        { t: \'敏捷交付\', d: \'专业交付团队分阶段快速上线\' },\n        { t: \'持续运营\', d: \'7×24 运维与产品持续迭代优化\' }\n      ]\n    : [\n        { t: \'Discovery\', d: \'Senior consultants analyze your scenarios\' },\n        { t: \'Solution Design\', d: \'Customized architecture & roadmap\' },\n        { t: \'Agile Delivery\', d: \'Phased rollout by expert teams\' },\n        { t: \'Managed Ops\', d: \'24/7 operations & continuous iteration\' }\n      ]\n  return list\n})\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.steps {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n  counter-reset: step;\n}\n.step {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 34px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  position: relative;\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n.step:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-6px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n.step-no {\n  width: 46px;\n  height: 46px;\n  margin: 0 auto 16px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #7aa5ff);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n}\n.step h3 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.step p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .steps {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\n  .steps {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/News.vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.title }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.sub }}</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"news-feature\" v-if=\"feature\">\n          <img :src=\"feature.img\" :alt=\"feature.title\" />\n          <div class=\"nf-body\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">{{ feature.cat }}</span>\n            <h2>{{ feature.title }}</h2>\n            <p>{{ feature.summary }}</p>\n            <div class=\"nf-meta\">\n              <time>{{ feature.date }}</time>\n              <span class=\"btn-more\">{{ ui.readMore }}</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-3\">\n          <NewsCard v-for=\"n in rest\" :key=\"n.title\" :n=\"n\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { computed } from \'vue\'\nimport NewsCard from \'@/components/NewsCard.vue\'\nimport { useLocale } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport { pick, newsList } from \'@/utils/data\'\n\nconst { currentLang, t } = useLocale()\nconst L = computed(() => currentLang.value)\n\nconst dict = {\n  zh: { title: \'新闻资讯\', sub: \'了解华辰最新动态、产品发布与行业洞察\', readMore: \'阅读全文\' },\n  en: { title: \'News & Insights\', sub: \'Latest updates, product launches and industry insights\', readMore: \'Read Full Article\' }\n}\nconst ui = computed(() => t(dict))\n\nconst map = (n) => ({\n  img: n.img,\n  cat: pick(n.cat, L.value),\n  date: n.date,\n  title: pick(n.title, L.value),\n  summary: pick(n.summary, L.value),\n  more: ui.value.readMore\n})\n\nconst all = computed(() => newsList.map(map))\nconst feature = computed(() => all.value[0])\nconst rest = computed(() => all.value.slice(1))\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.news-feature {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--light);\n  margin-bottom: 34px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.news-feature img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  min-height: 280px;\n}\n.nf-body {\n  padding: 34px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.nf-body h2 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px);\n  margin: 12px 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n.nf-body p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.nf-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n.nf-meta time {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .news-feature {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .news-feature img {\n    max-height: 240px;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/Contact.vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.title }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.sub }}</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container contact-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"info-cards\">\n          <div v-for=\"(c, i) in infos\" :key=\"i\" class=\"info-card card\">\n            <span class=\"info-icon\">{{ c.icon }}</span>\n            <h3>{{ c.t }}</h3>\n            <p>{{ c.d }}</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"contact-main\">\n          <div class=\"form-panel\">\n            <h2>{{ ui.formTitle }}</h2>\n            <p class=\"form-sub\">{{ ui.formSub }}</p>\n            <form @submit.prevent=\"submit\">\n              <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"field\">\n                  <label>{{ ui.name }}</label>\n                  <input v-model=\"form.name\" required :placeholder=\"ui.namePh\" />\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"field\">\n                  <label>{{ ui.phone }}</label>\n                  <input v-model=\"form.phone\" required :placeholder=\"ui.phonePh\" />\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"field\">\n                <label>Email</label>\n                <input v-model=\"form.email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@company.com\" />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"field\">\n                <label>{{ ui.msg }}</label>\n                <textarea v-model=\"form.msg\" rows=\"4\" required :placeholder=\"ui.msgPh\"></textarea>\n              </div>\n              <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary submit-btn\">{{ ui.sendBtn }}</button>\n              <p v-if=\"sent\" class=\"success\">✓ {{ ui.success }}</p>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"side\">\n            <div class=\"map-box\">\n              <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/map-hq/560/400\" alt=\"location\" />\n              <span class=\"map-pin\">📍 {{ ui.hq }}</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bus-time\">\n              <h3>{{ ui.timeTitle }}</h3>\n              <p>周一至周五 Mon-Fri · 9:00 - 18:00</p>\n              <p>周六 Sat · 9:30 - 17:30</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, computed, reactive } from \'vue\'\nimport { useLocale, commonDict } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\nconst { t } = useLocale()\n\nconst dict = {\n  zh: {\n    title: \'联系我们\', sub: \'期待与您交流，共同开启数字化新征程\',\n    formTitle: \'在线留言\', formSub: \'留下您的需求，专属顾问将在 1 个工作日内与您联系\',\n    name: \'您的称呼\', namePh: \'请输入您的姓名\', phone: \'联系电话\', phonePh: \'请输入手机号\',\n    msg: \'需求描述\', msgPh: \'请简单描述您的业务需求…\',\n    sendBtn: \'提交留言\', success: \'提交成功，我们将在 1 个工作日内与您联系！\',\n    addrT: \'公司地址\', addr: \'上海市浦东新区世纪大道 100 号\',\n    phoneT: \'服务热线\', mailT: \'商务邮箱\', timeT: \'营业时间\', timeTitle: \'工作时间\',\n    hq: \'华辰科技上海总部\'\n  },\n  en: {\n    title: \'Contact Us\', sub: \'Let\\\'s talk and start a new digital journey together\',\n    formTitle: \'Leave a Message\', formSub: \'Tell us your needs and a consultant will reply within 1 business day\',\n    name: \'Your Name\', namePh: \'Enter your name\', phone: \'Phone\', phonePh: \'Enter phone number\',\n    msg: \'Message\', msgPh: \'Briefly describe your requirements…\',\n    sendBtn: \'Send Message\', success: \'Submitted successfully. We will contact you within 1 business day!\',\n    addrT: \'Address\', addr: \'100 Century Ave, Pudong, Shanghai\',\n    phoneT: \'Hotline\', mailT: \'Business Email\', timeT: \'Working Hours\', timeTitle: \'Business Hours\',\n    hq: \'Huachen HQ, Shanghai\'\n  }\n}\nconst ui = computed(() => t(dict))\nconst common = computed(() => t(commonDict))\n\nconst form = reactive({ name: \'\', phone: \'\', email: \'\', msg: \'\' })\nconst sent = ref(false)\n\nfunction submit() {\n  sent.value = true\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    sent.value = false\n    Object.keys(form).forEach((k) => (form[k] = \'\'))\n  }, 4000)\n}\n\nconst infos = computed(() => [\n  { icon: \'📍\', t: ui.value.addrT, d: common.value.addr },\n  { icon: \'📞\', t: ui.value.phoneT, d: common.value.phone },\n  { icon: \'✉️\', t: ui.value.mailT, d: common.value.mail },\n  { icon: \'🕘\', t: ui.value.timeT, d: \'Mon-Fri 9:00-18:00\' }\n])\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.info-cards {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n.info-card {\n  padding: 26px 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.info-icon {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.info-card h3 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.info-card p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n.contact-main {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;\n  gap: 34px;\n}\n.form-panel {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 36px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n.form-panel h2 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  font-size: 24px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n.form-sub {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n.row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.field label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--navy);\n  margin-bottom: 7px;\n}\n.field input,\n.field textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 11px 14px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border 0.25s;\n  background: #fbfcff;\n}\n.field input:focus,\n.field textarea:focus {\n  border-color: var(--primary);\n  background: #fff;\n}\n.submit-btn {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.success {\n  margin-top: 14px;\n  color: #16a34a;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.side {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 24px;\n  align-content: start;\n}\n.map-box {\n  position: relative;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n}\n.map-box img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 300px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n.map-pin {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 14px;\n  bottom: 14px;\n  background: rgba(11, 35, 80, 0.86);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n}\n.bus-time {\n  background: var(--light);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 22px 26px;\n}\n.bus-time h3 {\n  color: var(--navy);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.bus-time p {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 992px) {\n  .info-cards {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n  .contact-main {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\n  .row {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .info-cards {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 读取目录 根目录\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 修改文件 src/pages/Home.vue\n\n替换前：\n```\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <CaseCard v-for=\"c in cases\" :key=\"c.name\" :c=\"c\" />\n        </div>\n```\n\n替换后：\n```\n        <div class=\"grid grid-4\">\n          <CaseCard v-for=\"c in caseData\" :key=\"c.name\" :c=\"c\" />\n        </div>\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 修改文件 src/components/ServiceWidget.vue\n\n替换前：\n```\nconst open = ref(false)\nconst draft = ref(\'\')\nconst msgs = ref([])\nconst bodyEl = ref(null)\nconst quick = [\'产品报价\', \'预约演示\', \'技术支持\']\n\nfunction ask(i) {\n  push(\'user\', quick[i])\n  reply()\n}\n```\n\n替换后：\n```\nconst open = ref(false)\nconst draft = ref(\'\')\nconst msgs = ref([])\nconst bodyEl = ref(null)\nconst quick = computed(() =>\n  ui.value.csOnline === \'在线\'\n    ? [\'产品报价\', \'预约演示\', \'技术支持\']\n    : [\'Get a quote\', \'Book a demo\', \'Tech support\']\n)\n\nfunction ask(i) {\n  push(\'user\', quick.value[i])\n  reply()\n}\n```\n\n\n项目文件全部就绪，已生成完整的企业官网（共 21 个文件）。\n\n**生成完毕提示：**\n\n已基于 Vue 3 + Vite + Vue Router（hash 模式）完成「华辰数字科技」专业企业官网，包含：\n\n- **五大页面**：首页（轮播图、核心优势、产品预览、客户案例、新闻动态、转化 CTA）、关于我们（公司介绍、发展历程时间线、核心团队）、产品服务（六类产品卡片、服务流程）、新闻资讯（头条 + 资讯列表）、联系我们（信息卡片、留言表单、地图展示）\n- **功能组件**：响应式导航栏（移动端抽屉菜单）、页脚、自动播放轮播图、产品/新闻/案例卡片、右下角在线客服浮窗（可对话、快捷提问）\n- **多语言切换**：全站中英文一键切换（导航、页脚、客服、页面文案与数据均实时响应）\n- **商务风格**：深蓝 + 品牌蓝配色、卡片悬浮动效、页面切换过渡，全面适配桌面端 / 平板端 / 移动端\n- **工程配置**：支持子路径部署（base: \'./\'）、`@` 路径别名、构建与开发脚本齐备','ai',455192482062401536,447528512765485056,'2026-09-09 15:17:00','2026-09-09 15:23:41',1),(455196124786184192,'设计一个专业的企业官网，包含公司介绍、产品服务展示、新闻资讯、联系我们等页面。采用商务风格的设计，包含轮播图、产品展示卡片、团队介绍、客户案例展示，支持多语言切换和在线客服功能。','user',455196122760335360,455174745437188096,'2026-09-09 15:27:53','2026-09-09 15:36:24',1),(455197117686992896,'\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 null\n```null\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>华信科技集团 - 数智赋能 · 连接未来</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 null\n```null\n{\n  \"name\": \"enterprise-website\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"vue\": \"^3.3.4\",\n    \"vue-router\": \"^4.2.4\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^4.2.3\",\n    \"vite\": \"^4.4.5\"\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 null\n```null\nimport { defineConfig } from \'vite\'\nimport vue from \'@vitejs/plugin-vue\'\nimport { fileURLToPath, URL } from \'node:url\'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  base: \'./\',\n  plugins: [vue()],\n  resolve: {\n    alias: {\n      \'@\': fileURLToPath(new URL(\'./src\', import.meta.url))\n    }\n  }\n})\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 null\n```null\nimport { createApp } from \'vue\'\nimport App from \'./App.vue\'\nimport router from \'./router\'\nimport \'./styles/global.css\'\n\ncreateApp(App).use(router).mount(\'#app\')\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 index.html\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>华信科技集团 - 数智赋能 · 连接未来</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 package.json\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"enterprise-website\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"vue\": \"^3.3.4\",\n    \"vue-router\": \"^4.2.4\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^4.2.3\",\n    \"vite\": \"^4.4.5\"\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 vite.config.js\n```js\nimport { defineConfig } from \'vite\'\nimport vue from \'@vitejs/plugin-vue\'\nimport { fileURLToPath, URL } from \'node:url\'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  base: \'./\',\n  plugins: [vue()],\n  resolve: {\n    alias: {\n      \'@\': fileURLToPath(new URL(\'./src\', import.meta.url))\n    }\n  }\n})\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/main.js\n```js\nimport { createApp } from \'vue\'\nimport App from \'./App.vue\'\nimport router from \'./router\'\nimport \'./styles/global.css\'\n\ncreateApp(App).use(router).mount(\'#app\')\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/styles/global.css\n```css\n:root {\n  --primary: #0e2a56;\n  --primary-2: #123a75;\n  --blue: #2563eb;\n  --blue-2: #3b82f6;\n  --sky: #eef4ff;\n  --gold: #e8a33d;\n  --text: #33415c;\n  --muted: #69758d;\n  --line: #e7ecf5;\n  --bg: #ffffff;\n  --bg-soft: #f6f8fc;\n  --radius: 14px;\n  --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(14, 42, 86, 0.08);\n  --shadow-hover: 0 16px 38px rgba(14, 42, 86, 0.16);\n  --font: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\nhtml { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\nbody { font-family: var(--font); color: var(--text); background: var(--bg); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; }\nimg { max-width: 100%; display: block; }\na { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }\nul { list-style: none; }\nbutton { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; border: none; background: none; }\n\n.container { width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n.section { padding: 72px 0; }\n.section.bg-soft { background: var(--bg-soft); }\n\n.sec-head { text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 44px; }\n.sec-tag { display: inline-block; color: var(--blue); background: var(--sky); font-size: 13px; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.sec-title { font-size: 30px; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.sec-sub { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }\n\n.btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 11px 26px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; transition: all .25s; line-height: 1.4; }\n.btn-primary { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }\n.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-2); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, .3); }\n.btn-outline { border: 1px solid #c9d6ea; color: var(--primary); background: #fff; }\n.btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }\n.btn-white { background: #fff; color: var(--primary); }\n.btn-white:hover { background: var(--sky); }\n.btn-ghost-light { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6); color: #fff; }\n.btn-ghost-light:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); }\n\n.grid { display: grid; gap: 24px; }\n.g2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n.g3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n.g4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\n\n.card { background: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow: hidden; transition: transform .3s, box-shadow .3s; }\n.card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }\n\n.banner { position: relative; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-2) 60%, #1e4fae 100%); padding: 66px 0 56px; overflow: hidden; }\n.banner::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; right: -120px; top: -120px; width: 360px; height: 360px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,.35), transparent 70%); }\n.banner::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: -80px; bottom: -160px; width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(232,163,61,.25), transparent 70%); }\n.banner .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.banner h1 { font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n.banner p { margin-top: 12px; opacity: .88; font-size: 16px; max-width: 640px; }\n.crumb { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; opacity: .75; }\n.crumb a:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n\n.tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--sky); color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; }\n.tag.gold { background: #fdf3e0; color: #c77800; }\n.tag.green { background: #e7f6ec; color: #1c9d55; }\n\n.fade-enter-active, .fade-leave-active { transition: opacity .25s ease; }\n.fade-enter-from, .fade-leave-to { opacity: 0; }\n\n@media (max-width: 992px) {\n  .g3, .g4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .section { padding: 56px 0; }\n  .sec-title { font-size: 26px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .g2, .g3, .g4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .banner h1 { font-size: 26px; }\n  .container { padding: 0 16px; }\n}\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/router/index.js\n```js\nimport { createRouter, createWebHashHistory } from \'vue-router\'\n\nconst routes = [\n  { path: \'/\', name: \'home\', component: () => import(\'@/pages/Home.vue\'), meta: { title: \'首页\' } },\n  { path: \'/about\', name: \'about\', component: () => import(\'@/pages/About.vue\'), meta: { title: \'关于我们\' } },\n  { path: \'/products\', name: \'products\', component: () => import(\'@/pages/Products.vue\'), meta: { title: \'产品服务\' } },\n  { path: \'/news\', name: \'news\', component: () => import(\'@/pages/News.vue\'), meta: { title: \'新闻资讯\' } },\n  { path: \'/contact\', name: \'contact\', component: () => import(\'@/pages/Contact.vue\'), meta: { title: \'联系我们\' } },\n  { path: \'/:pathMatch(.*)*\', redirect: \'/\' }\n]\n\nconst router = createRouter({\n  history: createWebHashHistory(),\n  routes,\n  scrollBehavior() { return { top: 0 } }\n})\n\nexport default router\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/utils/i18n.js\n```js\nimport { ref, computed } from \'vue\'\nimport { messages } from \'@/data/content\'\n\nconst lang = ref(\'zh\')\nconst ui = computed(() => messages[lang.value])\n\nfunction setLang(l) {\n  lang.value = l\n  document.title = (l === \'zh\' ? \'华信科技集团 - 数智赋能 · 连接未来\' : \'Huaxin Tech Group - Intelligence Connects the Future\')\n}\n\nexport { lang, ui, setLang }\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/data/content.js\n```js\n// ===== 双语静态文案 =====\nexport const messages = {\n  zh: {\n    brand: \'华信科技集团\',\n    slogan: \'数智赋能 · 连接未来\',\n    nav: { home: \'首页\', about: \'关于我们\', products: \'产品服务\', news: \'新闻资讯\', contact: \'联系我们\' },\n    langBtn: \'EN\',\n    common: { more: \'了解更多\', all: \'查看全部\', contact: \'立即咨询\', submit: \'提交信息\', success: \'提交成功，我们会尽快与您联系！\' },\n    footer: {\n      intro: \'华信科技集团成立于 2015 年，是国内领先的企业数字化服务商，致力于为全球客户提供云计算、大数据与人工智能一体化解决方案。\',\n      quick: \'快速导航\', service: \'联系方式\', hotline: \'全国服务热线\', email: \'商务合作邮箱\', address: \'北京市海淀区中关村软件园 8 号创新大厦 18 层\',\n      worktime: \'工作日 9:00 - 18:00 提供服务\',\n      copyright: \'© 2025 华信科技集团股份有限公司 版权所有\',\n      icp: \'京ICP备2025012345号-1\'\n    },\n    home: { featureT: \'为什么选择华信\', featureSub: \'十年技术沉淀，值得托付的数字化伙伴\', productT: \'核心产品与服务\', productSub: \'以技术驱动业务增长，助力企业全面数智化转型\', caseT: \'客户成功案例\', caseSub: \'覆盖金融、制造、零售、政务等核心行业\', newsT: \'新闻与洞察\', newsSub: \'了解华信最新动态与行业前沿观点\', ctaT: \'准备好开启您的数字化转型之旅了吗？\', ctaBtn: \'联系我们获取方案\' },\n    about: { storyTitle: \'以技术为核 · 以客户为先\', ctaTitle: \'加入我们，共创数字化未来\', ctaBtn: \'了解更多招聘信息\', valuesTitle: \'核心价值观\', teamTitle: \'核心管理团队\' },\n    products: { filterTitle: \'按领域筛选产品\' },\n    news: { filterTitle: \'按分类浏览资讯\', tagAll: \'全部\', detail: \'阅读全文\', fold: \'收起\' },\n    contact: { infoTitle: \'欢迎垂询，我们期待与您的合作\', formTitle: \'在线留言\', name: \'您的称呼\', email: \'邮箱地址\', phone: \'联系电话\', company: \'公司名称\', message: \'留言内容\', placeholderMsg: \'请简要描述您的需求或合作意向…\', csNotice: \'在线客服工作时间为工作日 9:00 - 18:00\' }\n  },\n  en: {\n    brand: \'Huaxin Tech Group\',\n    slogan: \'Smart Technology · Connected Future\',\n    nav: { home: \'Home\', about: \'About Us\', products: \'Products & Services\', news: \'News\', contact: \'Contact\' },\n    langBtn: \'中文\',\n    common: { more: \'Learn More\', all: \'View All\', contact: \'Contact Us\', submit: \'Submit\', success: \'Submitted! We will contact you soon.\' },\n    footer: {\n      intro: \'Founded in 2015, Huaxin Tech Group is a leading enterprise digitalization service provider offering integrated cloud, big data and AI solutions to global clients.\',\n      quick: \'Quick Links\', service: \'Contact Info\', hotline: \'Service Hotline\', email: \'Business Email\', address: \'18F, Innovation Tower No.8, Zhongguancun Software Park, Haidian, Beijing\',\n      worktime: \'Available on weekdays 9:00 - 18:00\',\n      copyright: \'© 2025 Huaxin Tech Group Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.\',\n      icp: \'ICP: 京ICP备2025012345号-1\'\n    },\n    home: { featureT: \'Why Choose Huaxin\', featureSub: \'A decade of expertise as your trustworthy digital partner\', productT: \'Core Products & Services\', productSub: \'Technology-driven growth for your full digital transformation\', caseT: \'Customer Success Stories\', caseSub: \'Trusted across finance, manufacturing, retail and government\', newsT: \'News & Insights\', newsSub: \'Latest updates and industry perspectives from Huaxin\', ctaT: \'Ready to start your digital transformation journey?\', ctaBtn: \'Talk to our experts\' },\n    about: { storyTitle: \'Technology First · Customer Focused\', ctaTitle: \'Join us to build a digital future together\', ctaBtn: \'Explore Career Opportunities\', valuesTitle: \'Core Values\', teamTitle: \'Leadership Team\' },\n    products: { filterTitle: \'Filter by Solution Area\' },\n    news: { filterTitle: \'Browse by Category\', tagAll: \'All\', detail: \'Read More\', fold: \'Collapse\' },\n    contact: { infoTitle: \'We look forward to cooperating with you\', formTitle: \'Send us a Message\', name: \'Your Name\', email: \'Email\', phone: \'Phone\', company: \'Company\', message: \'Message\', placeholderMsg: \'Briefly describe your needs or intention…\', csNotice: \'Online support is available on weekdays 9:00 - 18:00\' }\n  }\n}\n\n// ===== 轮播图 =====\nexport const slides = [\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxslide1/1500/640\', title: { zh: \'以科技创新，驱动企业数字化未来\', en: \'Driving the Digital Future with Innovation\' }, sub: { zh: \'华信科技为千行百业提供云计算、大数据与人工智能一体化解决方案，助力企业实现安全、高效、可持续的增长。\', en: \'Huaxin delivers integrated cloud, big data and AI solutions that help enterprises grow securely, efficiently and sustainably.\' }, cta: { zh: \'了解更多\', en: \'Learn More\' }, route: \'/about\' },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxslide2/1500/640\', title: { zh: \'新一代云智算一体化平台\', en: \'Next-Gen Cloud & AI Integration Platform\' }, sub: { zh: \'混合多云管理、弹性算力调度、行业大模型应用，让每一次业务创新都更快一步。\', en: \'Hybrid multi-cloud management, elastic compute and industry LLM applications — accelerate every business innovation.\' }, cta: { zh: \'查看产品\', en: \'View Products\' }, route: \'/products\' },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxslide3/1500/640\', title: { zh: \'深耕行业十余载，服务超 500 家头部客户\', en: \'A Decade of Excellence Serving 500+ Top Clients\' }, sub: { zh: \'从金融到制造、从零售到政务，华信以可靠的服务赢得客户的长期信赖。\', en: \'From finance to manufacturing, retail to government — trust built on reliable service.\' }, cta: { zh: \'了解我们\', en: \'About Us\' }, route: \'/about\' }\n]\n\n// ===== 数据统计 =====\nexport const stats = [\n  { num: \'500+\', label: { zh: \'企业客户\', en: \'Enterprise Clients\' } },\n  { num: \'12\', label: { zh: \'行业深耕年限\', en: \'Years of Expertise\' } },\n  { num: \'300+\', label: { zh: \'技术研发人员\', en: \'R&D Engineers\' } },\n  { num: \'99.99%\', label: { zh: \'服务可用性\', en: \'Service Availability\' } }\n]\n\n// ===== 产品与服务 =====\nexport const categories = [\n  { key: \'all\', label: { zh: \'全部\', en: \'All\' } },\n  { key: \'cloud\', label: { zh: \'云计算\', en: \'Cloud Computing\' } },\n  { key: \'bigdata\', label: { zh: \'大数据\', en: \'Big Data\' } },\n  { key: \'ai\', label: { zh: \'人工智能\', en: \'Artificial Intelligence\' } },\n  { key: \'security\', label: { zh: \'信息安全\', en: \'Cyber Security\' } },\n  { key: \'iot\', label: { zh: \'物联网\', en: \'IoT\' } }\n]\n\nexport const products = [\n  { id: 1, cat: \'cloud\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxp1/640/420\', title: { zh: \'云智算一体化平台\', en: \'Cloud & AI Platform\' }, desc: { zh: \'覆盖私有云、公有云与混合云的一站式管理与算力调度平台，提供弹性扩容、成本优化与统一运维能力。\', en: \'One-stop multi-cloud management and compute orchestration with elastic scaling, cost optimization and unified operations.\' }, points: { zh: [\'一键混合多云纳管\', \'弹性算力按需调度\', \'全链路运维监控\'], en: [\'One-click multi-cloud onboarding\', \'On-demand elastic compute\', \'Full-stack monitoring\'] } },\n  { id: 2, cat: \'bigdata\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxp2/640/420\', title: { zh: \'数据洞察分析引擎\', en: \'Insight Analytics Engine\' }, desc: { zh: \'实时数据仓库与智能 BI 一体化平台，帮助企业打通数据孤岛，让经营决策有数可依、有据可循。\', en: \'Real-time data warehouse and intelligent BI platform that breaks data silos and empowers data-driven decisions.\' }, points: { zh: [\'实时流式计算\', \'低代码可视化报表\', \'智能经营分析\'], en: [\'Real-time stream computing\', \'Low-code visual reports\', \'Intelligent analysis\'] } },\n  { id: 3, cat: \'ai\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxp3/640/420\', title: { zh: \'智能对话客服机器人\', en: \'Smart Conversational Bot\' }, desc: { zh: \'基于行业大模型与知识图谱的智能客服，支持多轮对话、情绪识别与人工无缝转接，大幅降低服务成本。\', en: \'LLM-powered customer service bot with multi-turn dialogue, sentiment detection and seamless human handover.\' }, points: { zh: [\'多轮对话理解\', \'意图识别精准率 95%+\', \'7×24 小时在线\'], en: [\'Multi-turn dialogue\', \'95%+ intent accuracy\', \'24/7 availability\'] } },\n  { id: 4, cat: \'security\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxp4/640/420\', title: { zh: \'零信任安全防护体系\', en: \'Zero-Trust Security Suite\' }, desc: { zh: \'基于零信任架构的动态身份认证、终端管控与数据加密方案，全面护航企业核心资产与业务合规。\', en: \'Zero-trust identity verification, endpoint control and encryption to protect critical assets and ensure compliance.\' }, points: { zh: [\'持续身份验证\', \'微隔离与数据防泄漏\', \'等保 2.0 合规\'], en: [\'Continuous verification\', \'Micro-segmentation & DLP\', \'MLPS 2.0 compliance\'] } },\n  { id: 5, cat: \'cloud\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxp5/640/420\', title: { zh: \'企业数字化协同套件\', en: \'Enterprise Collaboration Suite\' }, desc: { zh: \'涵盖 OA、流程审批与知识管理的一体化协同平台，让组织沟通更高效、流程更规范、知识可沉淀。\', en: \'Unified suite covering OA, workflow approval and knowledge management for agile and efficient organizations.\' }, points: { zh: [\'流程低代码编排\', \'移动端原生体验\', \'知识库智能检索\'], en: [\'Low-code workflow\', \'Native mobile experience\', \'Smart knowledge search\'] } },\n  { id: 6, cat: \'iot\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxp6/640/420\', title: { zh: \'物联网连接管理平台\', en: \'IoT Connectivity Platform\' }, desc: { zh: \'亿级设备接入的物联网平台，提供设备管理、规则引擎与边缘计算能力，支撑智慧工厂与智慧园区场景。\', en: \'IoT platform supporting 100M+ devices with device management, rule engine and edge computing for smart plants and parks.\' }, points: { zh: [\'海量设备接入\', \'边缘端协同计算\', \'数字孪生可视化\'], en: [\'Massive device onboarding\', \'Edge-cloud collaboration\', \'Digital twin visualization\'] } }\n]\n\n// ===== 团队 =====\nexport const team = [\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxt1/400/460\', name: { zh: \'陈建国\', en: \'Jianguo Chen\' }, role: { zh: \'创始人兼首席执行官\', en: \'Founder & CEO\' }, bio: { zh: \'曾任国际知名云计算企业大中华区技术总监，拥有 20 年企业服务与架构设计经验。\', en: \'Former Greater China CTO at a global cloud vendor with 20 years of enterprise architecture experience.\' } },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxt2/400/460\', name: { zh: \'林雅婷\', en: \'Yating Lin\' }, role: { zh: \'首席技术官\', en: \'Chief Technology Officer\' }, bio: { zh: \'人工智能领域博士，主导多项国家级科研项目，带领团队构建自研行业大模型。\', en: \'PhD in AI, leading national research programs and Huaxin’s industry LLM platform.\' } },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxt3/400/460\', name: { zh: \'王俊峰\', en: \'Junfeng Wang\' }, role: { zh: \'首席运营官\', en: \'Chief Operating Officer\' }, bio: { zh: \'深耕企业服务行业 15 年，曾服务多家世界 500 强客户的数字化落地项目。\', en: \'15 years in enterprise services, having delivered digital programs for Fortune 500 clients.\' } },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxt4/400/460\', name: { zh: \'赵雨晴\', en: \'Yuqing Zhao\' }, role: { zh: \'副总裁 · 解决方案\', en: \'VP of Solutions\' }, bio: { zh: \'专注于金融与制造行业数字化转型，主导交付超过 80 个中大型标杆项目。\', en: \'Focused on finance and manufacturing transformation, delivering 80+ flagship projects.\' } }\n]\n\n// ===== 客户案例 =====\nexport const cases = [\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxc1/640/420\', client: { zh: \'华东银行\', en: \'Huadong Bank\' }, industry: { zh: \'金融科技\', en: \'FinTech\' }, desc: { zh: \'通过数据洞察引擎与智能风控体系，将信贷审批时效提升 60%，年节约运营成本超千万元。\', en: \'With the analytics engine and intelligent risk control, loan approval time was cut by 60% saving millions yearly.\' }, metric: { zh: \'效率提升 60%\', en: \'60% Faster\' } },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxc2/640/420\', client: { zh: \'星辰制造集团\', en: \'Stellar Manufacturing\' }, industry: { zh: \'智能制造\', en: \'Smart Manufacturing\' }, desc: { zh: \'依托物联网平台构建数字孪生工厂，实现设备 OEE 提升 18%，生产异常响应缩短至 5 分钟内。\', en: \'Digital twin factory built on the IoT platform lifted equipment OEE by 18% and cut anomaly response to 5 minutes.\' }, metric: { zh: \'OEE +18%\', en: \'OEE +18%\' } },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxc3/640/420\', client: { zh: \'云栖零售连锁\', en: \'Yunqi Retail\' }, industry: { zh: \'智慧零售\', en: \'Smart Retail\' }, desc: { zh: \'智能客服机器人全年服务超 800 万人次，解决率 78%，人力成本下降近四成。\', en: \'The smart bot served 8M+ requests a year with a 78% resolution rate and 40% lower labor costs.\' }, metric: { zh: \'解决率 78%\', en: \'78% Resolved\' } },\n  { img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxc4/640/420\', client: { zh: \'滨海新区政务云\', en: \'Binhai E-Government\' }, industry: { zh: \'智慧政务\', en: \'Smart Government\' }, desc: { zh: \'零信任安全体系保障 200 余个政务系统平稳运行，全年重保期间零重大安全事件。\', en: \'Zero-trust security safeguarded 200+ government systems with zero major incidents all year.\' }, metric: { zh: \'安全零事故\', en: \'Zero Incidents\' } }\n]\n\n// ===== 新闻资讯 =====\nexport const newsTags = [\n  { key: \'company\', zh: \'公司动态\', en: \'Company News\' },\n  { key: \'product\', zh: \'产品发布\', en: \'Product Launch\' },\n  { key: \'industry\', zh: \'行业洞察\', en: \'Industry Insight\' }\n]\n\nexport const news = [\n  { id: 1, date: \'2025-03-18\', tag: \'product\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxn1/720/440\', title: { zh: \'华信发布新一代云智算一体化平台 3.0\', en: \'Huaxin Releases Cloud & AI Platform 3.0\' }, summary: { zh: \'新版本深度融合行业大模型与弹性算力调度，帮助企业平均降低 30% 云资源成本。\', en: \'The new release deeply integrates industry LLMs with elastic compute, cutting cloud costs by 30% on average.\' }, content: { zh: \'本次发布的 3.0 版本在原有多云管理能力基础上，新增了智能算力预测、大模型应用编排与 FinOps 成本治理三大模块。平台已通过多项权威认证，并率先在金融、能源等行业完成试点验证，未来将持续为更多客户提供普惠、可靠的云智算服务。\', en: \'Building on multi-cloud management, version 3.0 adds intelligent capacity forecasting, LLM orchestration and FinOps cost governance. Certified by leading authorities and piloted in finance and energy, the platform brings affordable and reliable AI computing to more customers.\' } },\n  { id: 2, date: \'2025-02-26\', tag: \'company\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxn2/720/440\', title: { zh: \'华信科技完成 3 亿元 C 轮融资\', en: \'Huaxin Closes RMB 300M Series C Round\' }, summary: { zh: \'本轮融资由多家头部投资机构联合领投，资金将主要用于行业大模型研发与全球化市场布局。\', en: \'Led by leading institutional investors, the funding will accelerate industry LLM R&D and global expansion.\' }, content: { zh: \'华信科技近日宣布完成 C 轮融资，累计融资金额已超过 8 亿元人民币。公司表示，未来三年将重点加码行业大模型、数据安全与海外市场三大方向，持续加大研发投入占比至营收的 25% 以上，为企业的智能化转型提供更坚实的技术底座。\', en: \'Huaxin announced the close of its Series C round, bringing total funding to over RMB 800 million. Over the next three years the company will invest more than 25% of revenue in industry LLMs, data security and overseas markets to underpin client transformation.\' } },\n  { id: 3, date: \'2025-01-15\', tag: \'industry\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxn3/720/440\', title: { zh: \'2025 企业数字化十大趋势展望\', en: \'Top 10 Digital Trends for 2025\' }, summary: { zh: \'从 Agentic AI 到数据资产入表，华信研究院发布年度重磅报告，为企业战略规划提供参考。\', en: \'From agentic AI to data-as-asset accounting, Huaxin Research releases its annual trend report.\' }, content: { zh: \'报告指出，2025 年企业数字化将呈现十大趋势：Agentic AI 全面进入生产场景、一体化数据平台成为刚需、零信任安全持续下沉、绿色计算与可持续 IT 兴起等。报告建议企业以“场景驱动、数据贯通、组织协同”三位一体推进转型，避免重复建设与数据孤岛。\', en: \'The report highlights ten trends for 2025 including agentic AI in production, unified data platforms, pervasive zero-trust and sustainable IT. Enterprises are advised to advance transformation with scenario-driven, data-connected and organizationally-aligned roadmaps.\' } },\n  { id: 4, date: \'2024-12-08\', tag: \'company\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxn4/720/440\', title: { zh: \'华信科技荣获“年度数字化转型服务商”大奖\', en: \'Huaxin Wins Digital Transformation Service Provider of the Year\' }, summary: { zh: \'凭借在金融、制造等行业突出的实践成果，华信科技在年度数字化峰会上再获行业殊荣。\', en: \'Huaxin was honored for outstanding achievements in finance and manufacturing at the annual digital summit.\' }, content: { zh: \'在近日举办的年度数字化产业峰会上，华信科技凭借 80 余个标杆项目的交付能力与客户高满意度，荣获“年度数字化转型服务商”奖项。评委会认为，华信在方案落地深度与创新技术应用之间找到了良好平衡，具备可复制、可推广的行业方法论。\', en: \'At the annual digital industry summit, Huaxin received the Digital Transformation Service Provider award for delivering 80+ benchmark projects with high client satisfaction, praised for balancing deep implementation with innovative technology.\' } },\n  { id: 5, date: \'2024-11-20\', tag: \'product\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxn5/720/440\', title: { zh: \'智能客服机器人全新升级，支持 24 种方言\', en: \'Smart Bot Upgrade Now Supports 24 Dialects\' }, summary: { zh: \'升级后的智能客服在语音识别与方言理解方面取得突破，进一步扩大服务覆盖面。\', en: \'The upgraded bot achieves breakthroughs in speech recognition and dialect understanding.\' }, content: { zh: \'此次升级采用自研的语音大模型与迁移学习框架，使机器人能够自然理解粤语、四川话、闽南语等 24 种常见方言。在试点客户中，方言场景的首次解决率提升至 71%，极大改善了老年用户与下沉市场的服务体验。\', en: \'Built on in-house speech LLMs and transfer learning, the bot now understands 24 dialects including Cantonese and Sichuanese. In pilot deployments, first-contact resolution in dialect scenarios reached 71%, greatly improving service for wider audiences.\' } },\n  { id: 6, date: \'2024-10-30\', tag: \'industry\', img: \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxn6/720/440\', title: { zh: \'《企业数据安全白皮书》正式发布\', en: \'Enterprise Data Security White Paper Released\' }, summary: { zh: \'白皮书系统梳理了数据要素流通的安全治理框架，助力企业在合规前提下释放数据价值。\', en: \'The white paper outlines a governance framework for secure data circulation while unlocking business value.\' }, content: { zh: \'华信安全研究院联合多家机构发布《企业数据安全白皮书》，围绕数据分级分类、流通确权、跨境合规与 AI 安全四方面提出 30 余条落地建议，帮助企业在“数据二十条”政策背景下建立前瞻性、可持续的安全治理体系。\', en: \'Together with partner institutions, Huaxin Security Research released a white paper offering 30+ practical recommendations on data classification, circulation rights, cross-border compliance and AI safety under China’s data policies.\' } }\n]\n\n// ===== 首页特性 =====\nexport const features = [\n  { icon: \'🛡️\', title: { zh: \'安全可信\', en: \'Secure & Trusted\' }, text: { zh: \'通过等保三级与 ISO 27001 认证，构建纵深防御体系，守护每一次数据交互。\', en: \'Certified to MLPS-3 and ISO 27001 with defense-in-depth to protect every interaction.\' } },\n  { icon: \'🚀\', title: { zh: \'敏捷交付\', en: \'Agile Delivery\' }, text: { zh: \'标准化产品 + 场景化定制双轮驱动，项目平均上线周期缩短 40%。\', en: \'Standard products plus scenario-based customization cut average delivery time by 40%.\' } },\n  { icon: \'🤝\', title: { zh: \'全栈服务\', en: \'Full-Stack Service\' }, text: { zh: \'从咨询规划、方案设计到实施运维与持续运营，提供全生命周期的陪伴式服务。\', en: \'End-to-end support from consulting and design to implementation, operations and growth.\' } },\n  { icon: \'💡\', title: { zh: \'持续创新\', en: \'Continuous Innovation\' }, text: { zh: \'研发投入占比超 25%，与顶尖高校共建联合实验室，保持技术领先优势。\', en: \'Over 25% of revenue invested in R&D with university joint labs to stay ahead of the curve.\' } },\n  { icon: \'🌍\', title: { zh: \'全球布局\', en: \'Global Reach\' }, text: { zh: \'服务网络覆盖东南亚、中东与欧洲市场，支持多语言、多时区、多法规交付。\', en: \'Service network across SEA, Middle East and Europe supporting multi-language delivery.\' } },\n  { icon: \'📈\', title: { zh: \'成效可见\', en: \'Proven Results\' }, text: { zh: \'以业务价值为导向，用可量化的指标体系帮助客户实现降本增效与业绩增长。\', en: \'Value-oriented approach with measurable KPIs that deliver tangible cost savings and growth.\' } ]\n]\n\n// ===== 公司里程碑 =====\nexport const milestones = [\n  { year: \'2015\', title: { zh: \'公司创立\', en: \'Company Founded\' }, text: { zh: \'华信科技在北京正式成立，专注云计算基础服务。\', en: \'Huaxin was founded in Beijing, focusing on cloud infrastructure services.\' } },\n  { year: \'2018\', title: { zh: \'业务全国化\', en: \'National Expansion\' }, text: { zh: \'完成 A 轮融资，成立上海、深圳、成都三大研发中心。\', en: \'Series A closed; R&D centers established in Shanghai, Shenzhen and Chengdu.\' } },\n  { year: \'2020\', title: { zh: \'平台化战略\', en: \'Platform Strategy\' }, text: { zh: \'发布云智算平台与数据洞察引擎，客户突破 200 家。\', en: \'Launched the Cloud & AI platform and analytics engine, passing 200 clients.\' } },\n  { year: \'2022\', title: { zh: \'行业大模型\', en: \'Industry LLMs\' }, text: { zh: \'发布自研行业大模型，成立 AI 研究院，荣获国家级高新技术企业认证。\', en: \'Released industry LLMs, founded the AI Research Institute and earned national high-tech status.\' } },\n  { year: \'2024\', title: { zh: \'扬帆出海\', en: \'Going Global\' }, text: { zh: \'完成 C 轮融资，开启东南亚与中东市场布局，服务客户超 500 家。\', en: \'Series C closed, expanding to SEA and the Middle East with 500+ clients served.\' } }\n]\n\n// ===== 价值观 =====\nexport const values = [\n  { icon: \'🎯\', title: { zh: \'客户至上\', en: \'Customer First\' }, text: { zh: \'始终站在客户角度思考问题，成就客户就是成就自己。\', en: \'Always think from the customer’s perspective — their success is our success.\' } },\n  { icon: \'🧠\', title: { zh: \'求实创新\', en: \'Innovation & Integrity\' }, text: { zh: \'坚持长期主义，鼓励大胆尝试，用严谨的态度打磨每一个细节。\', en: \'Long-term oriented, boldly experimental, and rigorous in every detail.\' } },\n  { icon: \'🤲\', title: { zh: \'开放共赢\', en: \'Open & Win-Win\' }, text: { zh: \'与伙伴、客户与员工共享价值，构建可持续的行业生态。\', en: \'Share value with partners, clients and employees to build a sustainable ecosystem.\' } }\n]\n\n// ===== 公司故事 =====\nexport const story = {\n  imgs: [\'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxs1/640/420\', \'https://picsum.photos/seed/hxs2/640/420\'],\n  paragraphs: {\n    zh: [\'华信科技集团成立于 2015 年，总部位于北京，是一家专注于企业数字化转型的国家级高新技术企业。公司现有员工 1200 余人，其中技术研发人员占比超过 60%，服务网络覆盖全国 30 余个城市。\', \'自成立以来，华信始终以“让数字技术普惠每一家企业”为使命，围绕云计算、大数据、人工智能三大技术底座，构建了从咨询规划到实施运营的完整服务体系。\', \'目前，华信已为超过 500 家政府机构与大型企业提供数字化服务，客户遍布金融、制造、零售、能源、政务等行业，并荣获多项行业大奖与权威认证。\'],\n    en: [\'Founded in 2015 and headquartered in Beijing, Huaxin Tech Group is a national high-tech enterprise dedicated to enterprise digital transformation. With 1,200+ employees (60%+ in R&D), we serve clients across 30+ cities nationwide.\', \'Committed to making digital technology accessible to every business, Huaxin has built a complete service system spanning consulting, implementation and operations on three pillars: cloud, big data and AI.\', \'Today we have delivered digital services to 500+ government agencies and enterprises across finance, manufacturing, retail, energy and government, earning numerous industry awards and certifications.\']\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/App.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport NavBar from \'@/components/NavBar.vue\'\nimport Footer from \'@/components/Footer.vue\'\nimport CustomerService from \'@/components/CustomerService.vue\'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"app\">\n    <NavBar />\n    <main class=\"page-main\">\n      <router-view v-slot=\"{ Component }\">\n        <transition name=\"fade\" mode=\"out-in\">\n          <component :is=\"Component\" />\n        </transition>\n      </router-view>\n    </main>\n    <Footer />\n    <CustomerService />\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.app { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n.page-main { flex: 1; }\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/components/NavBar.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } from \'vue\'\nimport { useRoute } from \'vue-router\'\nimport { lang, ui, setLang } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\nconst route = useRoute()\nconst menus = [\n  { path: \'/\', key: \'home\' },\n  { path: \'/about\', key: \'about\' },\n  { path: \'/products\', key: \'products\' },\n  { path: \'/news\', key: \'news\' },\n  { path: \'/contact\', key: \'contact\' }\n]\nconst scrolled = ref(false)\nconst open = ref(false)\n\nfunction onScroll() {\n  scrolled.value = window.scrollY > 10\n}\nfunction isActive(p) {\n  return p === \'/\' ? route.path === \'/\' : route.path.startsWith(p)\n}\nfunction toggleLang() {\n  setLang(lang.value === \'zh\' ? \'en\' : \'zh\')\n}\nfunction closeMenu() { open.value = false }\n\nonMounted(() => { window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', onScroll); onScroll() })\nonUnmounted(() => window.removeEventListener(\'scroll\', onScroll))\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <header class=\"navbar\" :class=\"{ scrolled }\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <router-link to=\"/\" class=\"brand\" @click=\"closeMenu\">\n        <span class=\"brand-logo\">HX</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">{{ ui.brand }}</span>\n      </router-link>\n\n      <nav class=\"nav-links\" :class=\"{ open }\">\n        <router-link\n          v-for=\"m in menus\" :key=\"m.key\" :to=\"m.path\"\n          class=\"nav-link\" :class=\"{ active: isActive(m.path) }\"\n          @click=\"closeMenu\">{{ ui.nav[m.key] }}</router-link>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div class=\"nav-tools\">\n        <button class=\"lang-btn\" @click=\"toggleLang\" :title=\"ui.langBtn === \'EN\' ? \'English\' : \'中文\'\">\n          {{ ui.langBtn }}\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"hamburger\" :class=\"{ active: open }\" @click=\"open = !open\" aria-label=\"menu\">\n          <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.navbar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; background: rgba(255,255,255,.95); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--line); transition: box-shadow .3s; }\n.navbar.scrolled { box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(14,42,86,.1); }\n.nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 70px; gap: 24px; }\n.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }\n.brand-logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 9px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--primary)); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: .5px; }\n.brand-name { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); letter-spacing: 1px; white-space: nowrap; }\n.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 6px; }\n.nav-link { padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); font-size: 15px; transition: all .25s; }\n.nav-link:hover { color: var(--blue); background: var(--sky); }\n.nav-link.active { color: #fff; background: var(--blue); }\n.nav-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n.lang-btn { border: 1px solid #c9d6ea; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--primary); background: #fff; transition: all .25s; }\n.lang-btn:hover { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }\n.hamburger { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; padding: 8px; }\n.hamburger span { width: 22px; height: 2px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 2px; transition: .3s; }\n.hamburger.active span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }\n.hamburger.active span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }\n.hamburger.active span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }\n\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .hamburger { display: flex; }\n  .nav-links { position: fixed; top: 70px; left: 0; right: 0; flex-direction: column; background: #fff; padding: 12px 20px 20px; gap: 4px; box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(14,42,86,.12); transform: translateY(-130%); transition: transform .3s; }\n  .nav-links.open { transform: translateY(0); }\n  .nav-link { padding: 12px 16px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/components/Footer.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-grid\">\n      <div class=\"f-col f-about\">\n        <div class=\"f-brand\">\n          <span class=\"f-logo\">HX</span>\n          <span>{{ ui.brand }}</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"f-intro\">{{ ui.footer.intro }}</p>\n        <div class=\"f-social\">\n          <span class=\"s-icon\" title=\"LinkedIn\">in</span>\n          <span class=\"s-icon\" title=\"X\">𝕏</span>\n          <span class=\"s-icon\" title=\"WeChat\">微</span>\n          <span class=\"s-icon\" title=\"YouTube\">▶</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"f-col\">\n        <h4>{{ ui.footer.quick }}</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><router-link to=\"/about\">{{ ui.nav.about }}</router-link></li>\n          <li><router-link to=\"/products\">{{ ui.nav.products }}</router-link></li>\n          <li><router-link to=\"/news\">{{ ui.nav.news }}</router-link></li>\n          <li><router-link to=\"/contact\">{{ ui.nav.contact }}</router-link></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"f-col\">\n        <h4>{{ ui.footer.service }}</h4>\n        <ul class=\"f-contact\">\n          <li><i>☎</i> {{ ui.footer.hotline }}：<b>400-888-2365</b></li>\n          <li><i>✉</i> {{ ui.footer.email }}：<b>contact@huaxin-tech.com</b></li>\n          <li><i>📍</i> {{ ui.footer.address }}</li>\n          <li><i>🕘</i> {{ ui.footer.worktime }}</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container f-bottom\">\n      <span>{{ ui.footer.copyright }}</span>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"f-icp\">{{ ui.footer.icp }}</a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.footer { background: #0a1c3a; color: #c7d2e6; margin-top: auto; }\n.footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 40px; padding: 54px 24px 36px; }\n.f-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: #fff; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.f-logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 9px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-2), var(--blue)); display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; }\n.f-intro { margin: 18px 0 22px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2; max-width: 340px; }\n.f-social { display: flex; gap: 10px; }\n.s-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .25s; }\n.s-icon:hover { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); color: #fff; }\n.f-col h4 { color: #fff; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; position: relative; padding-bottom: 10px; }\n.f-col h4::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 28px; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--gold); }\n.f-col ul li { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; }\n.f-col ul a:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n.f-contact li { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; }\n.f-contact i { font-style: normal; width: 16px; text-align: center; }\n.f-contact b { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }\n.f-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; color: #8fa0bd; }\n.f-icp:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; padding: 40px 24px 28px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/components/HeroCarousel.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\nconst props = defineProps({ slides: { type: Array, required: true } })\nconst current = ref(0)\nlet timer = null\n\nfunction next() { current.value = (current.value + 1) % props.slides.length }\nfunction prev() { current.value = (current.value - 1 + props.slides.length) % props.slides.length }\nfunction go(i) { current.value = i; restart() }\nfunction restart() { clearInterval(timer); timer = setInterval(next, 5000) }\n\nonMounted(() => { restart() })\nonUnmounted(() => clearInterval(timer))\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <transition-group name=\"slide\">\n      <div v-for=\"(s, i) in slides\" v-show=\"i === current\" :key=\"s.img\" class=\"hero-slide\">\n        <img :src=\"s.img\" :alt=\"s.title[lang]\" class=\"hero-bg\" />\n        <div class=\"hero-mask\"></div>\n        <div class=\"container hero-content\">\n          <h1>{{ s.title[lang] }}</h1>\n          <p>{{ s.sub[lang] }}</p>\n          <router-link :to=\"s.route\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">{{ s.cta[lang] }} →</router-link>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </transition-group>\n\n    <button class=\"arrow prev\" @click=\"prev\" aria-label=\"prev\">‹</button>\n    <button class=\"arrow next\" @click=\"next\" aria-label=\"next\">›</button>\n\n    <div class=\"dots\">\n      <span\n        v-for=\"(s, i) in slides\" :key=\"i\"\n        class=\"dot\" :class=\"{ on: i === current }\"\n        @click=\"go(i)\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.hero { position: relative; height: 560px; overflow: hidden; }\n.hero-slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\n.hero-bg { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n.hero-mask { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(8,24,54,.92) 12%, rgba(8,24,54,.62) 48%, rgba(8,24,54,.25)); }\n.hero-content { position: relative; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; color: #fff; z-index: 2; padding-top: 70px; }\n.hero-content h1 { font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.3; max-width: 640px; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.hero-content p { margin: 20px 0 30px; max-width: 580px; font-size: 17px; opacity: .9; line-height: 1.9; }\n.arrow { position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); z-index: 3; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); color: #fff; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; transition: .25s; }\n.arrow:hover { background: var(--blue); }\n.prev { left: 20px; } .next { right: 20px; }\n.dots { position: absolute; bottom: 26px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 9px; z-index: 3; }\n.dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.45); cursor: pointer; transition: all .3s; }\n.dot.on { width: 26px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--gold); }\n.slide-enter-active, .slide-leave-active { transition: opacity .8s ease; }\n.slide-enter-from, .slide-leave-to { opacity: 0; }\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .hero { height: 430px; }\n  .hero-content h1 { font-size: 30px; }\n  .hero-content p { font-size: 15px; }\n  .arrow { display: none; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/components/ProductCard.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\ndefineProps({ product: { type: Object, required: true } })\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <article class=\"p-card\">\n    <div class=\"p-img\">\n      <img :src=\"product.img\" :alt=\"product.title[lang]\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-body\">\n      <h3>{{ product.title[lang] }}</h3>\n      <p class=\"p-desc\">{{ product.desc[lang] }}</p>\n      <ul class=\"p-points\">\n        <li v-for=\"(pt, i) in product.points[lang]\" :key=\"i\">✓ {{ pt }}</li>\n      </ul>\n      <router-link to=\"/contact\" class=\"p-more\">{{ ui.common.more }} →</router-link>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.p-card { background: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); transition: all .3s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n.p-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: transparent; }\n.p-img { overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16/10; }\n.p-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .5s; }\n.p-card:hover .p-img img { transform: scale(1.07); }\n.p-body { padding: 22px 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }\n.p-body h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 18px; }\n.p-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 10px 0 14px; line-height: 1.8; flex: 1; }\n.p-points { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.p-points li { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); background: var(--bg-soft); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; }\n.p-more { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; transition: .2s; }\n.p-more:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/components/CustomerService.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, nextTick } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\nconst open = ref(false)\nconst msg = ref(\'\')\nconst listEl = ref(null)\nconst typing = ref(false)\nconst messages = ref([\n  { from: \'bot\', text: { zh: \'您好，欢迎访问华信科技！我是智能助手小华，很高兴为您服务 😊\', en: \'Hello! Welcome to Huaxin Tech. I am Xiaohua, your AI assistant 😊\' } }\n])\n\nconst quickQA = [\n  { q: { zh: \'你们有哪些产品？\', en: \'What products do you offer?\' }, a: { zh: \'我们提供云计算、大数据、人工智能、信息安全与物联网等六大领域的解决方案，可前往“产品服务”页面查看详情。\', en: \'We offer solutions in cloud, big data, AI, cyber security and IoT. Visit the Products page for details.\' } },\n  { q: { zh: \'如何获取产品报价？\', en: \'How can I get a quote?\' }, a: { zh: \'您可以点击右下角“联系我们”或拨打 400-888-2365，我们会安排专属顾问在 1 个工作日内与您联系并提供定制方案。\', en: \'Please contact us via the Contact page or call 400-888-2365. A dedicated consultant will reply within 1 business day.\' } },\n  { q: { zh: \'是否有售后技术支持？\', en: \'Do you provide after-sales support?\' }, a: { zh: \'当然，我们提供 7×24 小时技术运维支持与专属客户成功经理服务，确保系统稳定运行。\', en: \'Certainly! We offer 24/7 operations support and a dedicated customer success manager for your business.\' } }\n]\n\nfunction toggle() { open.value = !open.value }\n\nasync function send(text) {\n  const content = (text || msg.value).trim()\n  if (!content) return\n  messages.value.push({ from: \'user\', text: content })\n  msg.value = \'\'\n  typing.value = true\n  scrollDown()\n  await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 900))\n  typing.value = false\n  const found = quickQA.find(q => content.includes(q.q[lang.value].slice(0, 6)))\n  const reply = found\n    ? found.a[lang.value]\n    : (lang.value === \'zh\'\n        ? \'感谢您的留言！您的需求已记录，人工客服会尽快跟进。如需紧急协助，请拨打 400-888-2365。\'\n        : \'Thanks for your message! It has been recorded and our team will follow up soon. For urgent help, call 400-888-2365.\')\n  messages.value.push({ from: \'bot\', text: reply })\n  scrollDown()\n}\n\nfunction quick(q) {\n  messages.value.push({ from: \'user\', text: q.q[lang.value] })\n  typing.value = true\n  scrollDown()\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    typing.value = false\n    messages.value.push({ from: \'bot\', text: q.a[lang.value] })\n    scrollDown()\n  }, 900)\n}\n\nfunction scrollDown() {\n  nextTick(() => { if (listEl.value) listEl.value.scrollTop = listEl.value.scrollHeight })\n}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"cs\">\n    <button class=\"cs-float\" :class=\"{ on: open }\" @click=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"customer service\">\n      <span v-if=\"!open\" class=\"cs-icon\">💬</span>\n      <span v-else class=\"cs-icon\">✕</span>\n    </button>\n\n    <transition name=\"cs\">\n      <div v-if=\"open\" class=\"cs-panel\">\n        <div class=\"cs-head\">\n          <div class=\"cs-avatar\">小华</div>\n          <div>\n            <b>华信智能客服</b>\n            <span class=\"online\"><i></i> {{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'在线\' : \'Online\' }}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"cs-body\" ref=\"listEl\">\n          <div v-for=\"(m, i) in messages\" :key=\"i\" class=\"msg\" :class=\"m.from\">\n            <div class=\"bubble\">{{ m.text }}</div>\n          </div>\n          <div v-if=\"typing\" class=\"msg bot\"><div class=\"bubble typing\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"cs-quick\">\n          <button v-for=\"(q, i) in quickQA\" :key=\"i\" @click=\"quick(q)\">{{ q.q[lang] }}</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"cs-input\">\n          <input\n            v-model=\"msg\" type=\"text\"\n            :placeholder=\"lang === \'zh\' ? \'请输入您的问题…\' : \'Type your question…\'\"\n            @keyup.enter=\"send()\" />\n          <button @click=\"send()\">➤</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </transition>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.cs-float { position: fixed; right: 22px; bottom: 22px; z-index: 200; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-2), var(--blue)); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(37,99,235,.45); display: grid; place-items: center; transition: transform .3s; }\n.cs-float:hover { transform: scale(1.08); }\n.cs-icon { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1; }\n.cs-float.on { background: var(--primary); }\n.cs-panel { position: fixed; right: 22px; bottom: 92px; z-index: 200; width: 340px; max-width: calc(100vw - 32px); background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(14,42,86,.28); overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 460px; }\n.cs-head { background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary), var(--blue)); color: #fff; padding: 15px 18px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }\n.cs-avatar { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); color: var(--primary); font-weight: 800; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; }\n.cs-head b { display: block; font-size: 15px; }\n.online { font-size: 12px; opacity: .85; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }\n.online i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4ade80; display: inline-block; }\n.cs-body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; background: var(--bg-soft); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }\n.msg { display: flex; }\n.msg.bot { justify-content: flex-start; }\n.msg.user { justify-content: flex-end; }\n.bubble { max-width: 80%; padding: 9px 13px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; }\n.bot .bubble { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top-left-radius: 3px; }\n.user .bubble { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-top-right-radius: 3px; }\n.typing { display: flex; gap: 4px; padding: 12px 14px; }\n.typing span { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #9aa7bd; animation: blink 1.2s infinite; }\n.typing span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; }\n.typing span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }\n@keyframes blink { 0%,60%,100% { opacity: .3; } 30% { opacity: 1; } }\n.cs-quick { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding: 10px 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.cs-quick button { font-size: 12px; color: var(--blue); background: var(--sky); border-radius: 14px; padding: 4px 11px; transition: .2s; }\n.cs-quick button:hover { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }\n.cs-input { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.cs-input input { flex: 1; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; outline: none; }\n.cs-input input:focus { border-color: var(--blue); }\n.cs-input button { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-size: 15px; }\n.cs-input button:hover { background: var(--primary); }\n.cs-enter-active, .cs-leave-active { transition: all .3s ease; }\n.cs-enter-from, .cs-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px) scale(.96); }\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/Home.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport HeroCarousel from \'@/components/HeroCarousel.vue\'\nimport ProductCard from \'@/components/ProductCard.vue\'\nimport { slides, stats, features, products, cases, news } from \'@/data/content\'\n\nconst caseIdx = ref(0)\nconst newsCards = news.slice(0, 3)\nconst featureIcons = features.map(f => f.icon)\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <!-- 轮播 -->\n    <HeroCarousel :slides=\"slides\" />\n\n    <!-- 数据统计 -->\n    <section class=\"stat-band\">\n      <div class=\"container stat-grid\">\n        <div v-for=\"(s, i) in stats\" :key=\"i\" class=\"stat\">\n          <b>{{ s.num }}</b>\n          <span>{{ s.label[lang] }}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 产品特性 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">HX ADVANTAGE</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ ui.home.featureT }}</h2>\n          <p class=\"sec-sub\">{{ ui.home.featureSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid g3\">\n          <div v-for=\"(f, i) in features\" :key=\"i\" class=\"feature card\">\n            <div class=\"f-icon\">{{ f.icon }}</div>\n            <h3>{{ f.title[lang] }}</h3>\n            <p>{{ f.text[lang] }}</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 产品服务预览 -->\n    <section class=\"section bg-soft\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">SOLUTIONS</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ ui.home.productT }}</h2>\n          <p class=\"sec-sub\">{{ ui.home.productSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid g3\">\n          <ProductCard v-for=\"p in products.slice(0, 3)\" :key=\"p.id\" :product=\"p\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec-more\">\n          <router-link to=\"/products\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">{{ ui.common.all }} →</router-link>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 客户案例 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">CASES</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ ui.home.caseT }}</h2>\n          <p class=\"sec-sub\">{{ ui.home.caseSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"case-grid\">\n          <div v-for=\"(c, i) in cases\" :key=\"i\" class=\"case-card card\">\n            <div class=\"c-img\"><img :src=\"c.img\" :alt=\"c.client[lang]\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <span class=\"c-badge\">{{ c.metric[lang] }}</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-body\">\n              <h3>{{ c.client[lang] }}</h3>\n              <span class=\"tag gold\">{{ c.industry[lang] }}</span>\n              <p>{{ c.desc[lang] }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 新闻预览 -->\n    <section class=\"section bg-soft\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">NEWS</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ ui.home.newsT }}</h2>\n          <p class=\"sec-sub\">{{ ui.home.newsSub }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid g3\">\n          <article v-for=\"n in newsCards\" :key=\"n.id\" class=\"news-card card\">\n            <router-link to=\"/news\" class=\"n-img\"><img :src=\"n.img\" :alt=\"n.title[lang]\" loading=\"lazy\" /></router-link>\n            <div class=\"n-body\">\n              <div class=\"n-meta\">\n                <span class=\"tag\">{{ n.tag === \'company\' ? (lang === \'zh\' ? \'公司动态\' : \'Company\') : n.tag === \'product\' ? (lang === \'zh\' ? \'产品发布\' : \'Product\') : (lang === \'zh\' ? \'行业洞察\' : \'Insight\') }}</span>\n                <time>{{ n.date }}</time>\n              </div>\n              <router-link to=\"/news\"><h3>{{ n.title[lang] }}</h3></router-link>\n              <p>{{ n.summary[lang] }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec-more\">\n          <router-link to=\"/news\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">{{ ui.common.viewAll || ui.common.all }} →</router-link>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CTA -->\n    <section class=\"cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container cta-inner\">\n        <h2>{{ ui.home.ctaT }}</h2>\n        <p>{{ ui.brand }} · {{ ui.slogan }}</p>\n        <router-link to=\"/contact\" class=\"btn btn-white\">{{ ui.home.ctaBtn }} →</router-link>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.stat-band { background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2)); padding: 40px 0; }\n.stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; }\n.stat { text-align: center; color: #fff; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); }\n.stat:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.stat b { display: block; font-size: 36px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 800; }\n.stat span { font-size: 14px; opacity: .85; }\n.feature { padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; }\n.f-icon { width: 60px; height: 60px; margin: 0 auto 16px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--sky); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 28px; }\n.feature h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.feature p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }\n.sec-more { text-align: center; margin-top: 36px; }\n.case-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 26px; }\n.c-img { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16/9; overflow: hidden; }\n.c-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .5s; }\n.case-card:hover .c-img img { transform: scale(1.06); }\n.c-badge { position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 14px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--primary); font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 13px; border-radius: 20px; }\n.c-body { padding: 20px 22px 24px; }\n.c-body h3 { color: var(--primary); display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px; }\n.c-body p { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }\n.n-img { display: block; aspect-ratio: 16/9; overflow: hidden; }\n.n-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .5s; }\n.news-card:hover .n-img img { transform: scale(1.06); }\n.n-body { padding: 18px 20px 20px; }\n.n-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.n-meta time { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }\n.n-body h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.5; transition: .2s; }\n.news-card:hover h3 { color: var(--blue); }\n.n-body p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }\n.cta-band { background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary), #1e4fae 60%, var(--blue)); color: #fff; }\n.cta-inner { padding: 60px 24px; text-align: center; }\n.cta-inner h2 { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.cta-inner p { opacity: .8; margin-bottom: 26px; }\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .case-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .stat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; }\n  .stat:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }\n  .stat { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); padding-bottom: 14px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/About.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport { team, milestones, values, story } from \'@/data/content\'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"banner\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.nav.about }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.slogan }} —— {{ ui.about.storyTitle }}</p>\n        <div class=\"crumb\"><router-link to=\"/\">首页</router-link> / {{ ui.nav.about }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 公司故事 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container story\">\n        <div class=\"story-imgs\">\n          <img :src=\"story.imgs[0]\" alt=\"company\" />\n          <img class=\"img-float\" :src=\"story.imgs[1]\" alt=\"office\" />\n          <div class=\"img-card\">\n            <b>2015</b>\n            <span>{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'成立至今\' : \'Since 2015\' }}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"story-text\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">ABOUT US</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\" style=\"text-align:left\">{{ ui.about.storyTitle }}</h2>\n          <p v-for=\"(p, i) in story.paragraphs[lang]\" :key=\"i\">{{ p }}</p>\n          <div class=\"story-points\">\n            <div><b>1200+</b><span>{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'团队成员\' : \'Team Members\' }}</span></div>\n            <div><b>30+</b><span>{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'服务城市\' : \'Cities Served\' }}</span></div>\n            <div><b>25%</b><span>{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'研发投入占比\' : \'R&D Investment\' }}</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 核心价值观 -->\n    <section class=\"section bg-soft\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">VALUES</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ ui.about.valuesTitle }}</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid g3\">\n          <div v-for=\"(v, i) in values\" :key=\"i\" class=\"value-card card\">\n            <span class=\"v-icon\">{{ v.icon }}</span>\n            <h3>{{ v.title[lang] }}</h3>\n            <p>{{ v.text[lang] }}</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 发展里程碑 -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">MILESTONES</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'发展历程\' : \'Milestones\' }}</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timeline\">\n          <div v-for=\"(m, i) in milestones\" :key=\"i\" class=\"tl-item\" :class=\"{ right: i % 2 === 1 }\">\n            <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"tl-card\">\n              <b class=\"tl-year\">{{ m.year }}</b>\n              <h3>{{ m.title[lang] }}</h3>\n              <p>{{ m.text[lang] }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 核心团队 -->\n    <section class=\"section bg-soft\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"sec-head\">\n          <span class=\"sec-tag\">TEAM</span>\n          <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ ui.about.teamTitle }}</h2>\n          <p class=\"sec-sub\">{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'一群志同道合的行业专家，为共同愿景而努力\' : \'Industry experts united by a shared vision\' }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid g4\">\n          <div v-for=\"(t, i) in team\" :key=\"i\" class=\"team-card\">\n            <div class=\"t-img\"><img :src=\"t.img\" :alt=\"t.name[lang]\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n            <div class=\"t-info\">\n              <h3>{{ t.name[lang] }}</h3>\n              <span>{{ t.role[lang] }}</span>\n              <p>{{ t.bio[lang] }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CTA -->\n    <section class=\"cta\">\n      <div class=\"container cta-inner\">\n        <h2>{{ ui.about.ctaTitle }}</h2>\n        <router-link to=\"/contact\" class=\"btn btn-white\">{{ ui.about.ctaBtn }} →</router-link>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }\n.story-imgs { position: relative; padding: 20px; }\n.story-imgs > img { border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }\n.img-float { position: absolute; width: 55%; right: -8px; bottom: -8px; border: 6px solid #fff; }\n.img-card { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 30px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--primary)); color: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }\n.img-card b { font-size: 24px; color: var(--gold); display: block; }\n.img-card span { font-size: 12px; }\n.story-text p { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 2; }\n.story-points { display: flex; gap: 28px; margin-top: 24px; }\n.story-points b { display: block; font-size: 22px; color: var(--blue); }\n.story-points span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }\n.value-card { padding: 30px 24px; text-align: center; }\n.v-icon { width: 58px; height: 58px; margin: 0 auto 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sky); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 26px; }\n.value-card h3 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.value-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }\n.timeline { position: relative; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 0; }\n.timeline::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px; background: linear-gradient(var(--sky), var(--blue-2)); transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 2px; }\n.tl-item { position: relative; width: 50%; padding: 0 44px 36px 0; }\n.tl-item.right { left: 50%; padding: 0 0 36px 44px; }\n.tl-dot { position: absolute; right: -9px; top: 8px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; border: 5px solid var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--sky); z-index: 1; }\n.tl-item.right .tl-dot { left: -9px; right: auto; }\n.tl-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: .3s; }\n.tl-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--blue-2); }\n.tl-year { color: var(--blue); font-size: 20px; }\n.tl-card h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 16px; margin: 6px 0 4px; }\n.tl-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }\n.team-card { border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: .3s; text-align: center; }\n.team-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }\n.t-img { aspect-ratio: 4/4.2; overflow: hidden; }\n.t-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; filter: saturate(.92); }\n.team-card:hover .t-img img { transform: scale(1.05); transition: .5s; }\n.t-info { padding: 16px 18px 20px; }\n.t-info h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 16px; }\n.t-info span { color: var(--blue); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n.t-info p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.8; }\n.cta { background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--blue), var(--primary)); }\n.cta-inner { padding: 56px 24px; text-align: center; color: #fff; }\n.cta-inner h2 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }\n  .timeline::before { left: 12px; }\n  .tl-item, .tl-item.right { width: 100%; left: 0; padding: 0 0 28px 40px; }\n  .tl-dot, .tl-item.right .tl-dot { left: 4px; right: auto; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/Products.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, computed } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport ProductCard from \'@/components/ProductCard.vue\'\nimport { products, categories } from \'@/data/content\'\n\nconst active = ref(\'all\')\nconst filtered = computed(() =>\n  active.value === \'all\' ? products : products.filter(p => p.cat === active.value)\n)\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"banner\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.nav.products }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.home.productSub }}</p>\n        <div class=\"crumb\"><router-link to=\"/\">首页</router-link> / {{ ui.nav.products }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"filter-bar\">\n          <span class=\"filter-title\">{{ ui.products.filterTitle }}</span>\n          <div class=\"chips\">\n            <button\n              v-for=\"c in categories\" :key=\"c.key\"\n              class=\"chip\" :class=\"{ on: active === c.key }\"\n              @click=\"active = c.key\">{{ c.label[lang] }}</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid g3\">\n          <ProductCard v-for=\"p in filtered\" :key=\"p.id\" :product=\"p\" />\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 服务流程 -->\n        <div class=\"process\">\n          <div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:34px\">\n            <span class=\"sec-tag\">PROCESS</span>\n            <h2 class=\"sec-title\">{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'全流程服务保障\' : \'Full-Service Process\' }}</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"grid g4\">\n            <div v-for=\"(s, i) in (lang === \'zh\'\n                ? [[\'咨询诊断\', \'深入调研业务现状，输出数字化转型评估报告\'], [\'方案设计\', \'结合行业最佳实践，定制专属技术解决方案\'], [\'敏捷实施\', \'敏捷迭代交付，最短时间实现业务价值\'], [\'持续运营\', \'7×24 运维保障与持续优化，陪伴业务成长\']]\n                : [[\'Consulting\', \'Deep-dive into your business and deliver a digital maturity assessment\'], [\'Design\', \'Tailor a solution based on industry best practices\'], [\'Delivery\', \'Agile iterations deliver business value fast\'], [\'Managed Service\', \'24/7 operations support and continuous optimization\']])\" :key=\"i\" class=\"step\">\n              <span class=\"step-num\">0{{ i + 1 }}</span>\n              <h3>{{ s[0] }}</h3>\n              <p>{{ s[1] }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.filter-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }\n.filter-title { font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }\n.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; }\n.chip { padding: 7px 20px; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; transition: .25s; }\n.chip:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }\n.chip.on { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(37,99,235,.3); }\n.process { margin-top: 64px; }\n.step { background: var(--bg-soft); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 26px 22px; position: relative; border-top: 3px solid var(--blue); text-align: left; }\n.step-num { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(37,99,235,.22); line-height: 1; }\n.step h3 { color: var(--primary); margin: 10px 0 8px; }\n.step p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/News.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, computed } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport { news, newsTags } from \'@/data/content\'\n\nconst active = ref(\'all\')\nconst expanded = ref(null)\nconst filtered = computed(() =>\n  active.value === \'all\' ? news : news.filter(n => n.tag === active.value)\n)\nfunction tagName(key) {\n  const t = newsTags.find(x => x.key === key)\n  return t ? t[lang.value] : key\n}\nfunction toggle(id) {\n  expanded.value = expanded.value === id ? null : id\n}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"banner\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.nav.news }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.home.newsSub }}</p>\n        <div class=\"crumb\"><router-link to=\"/\">首页</router-link> / {{ ui.nav.news }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"news-toolbar\">\n          <div class=\"chips\">\n            <button\n              class=\"chip\" :class=\"{ on: active === \'all\' }\" @click=\"active = \'all\'\">{{ ui.news.tagAll }}</button>\n            <button\n              v-for=\"t in newsTags\" :key=\"t.key\"\n              class=\"chip\" :class=\"{ on: active === t.key }\"\n              @click=\"active = t.key\">{{ t[lang] }}</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"news-list\">\n          <article v-for=\"n in filtered\" :key=\"n.id\" class=\"news-item card\" :class=\"{ open: expanded === n.id }\">\n            <div class=\"n-left\">\n              <img :src=\"n.img\" :alt=\"n.title[lang]\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"n-right\">\n              <div class=\"n-top\">\n                <span class=\"tag green\">{{ tagName(n.tag) }}</span>\n                <time>{{ n.date }}</time>\n              </div>\n              <h2>{{ n.title[lang] }}</h2>\n              <p class=\"n-summary\">{{ n.summary[lang] }}</p>\n              <transition name=\"exp\">\n                <div v-if=\"expanded === n.id\" class=\"n-content\">\n                  <p>{{ n.content[lang] }}</p>\n                </div>\n              </transition>\n              <button class=\"n-toggle\" @click=\"toggle(n.id)\">\n                {{ expanded === n.id ? ui.news.fold : ui.news.detail }}\n                <span>{{ expanded === n.id ? \'↑\' : \'↓\' }}</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.news-toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; }\n.chip { padding: 7px 20px; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; transition: .25s; }\n.chip:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }\n.chip.on { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-color: var(--blue); }\n.news-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.news-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr; }\n.n-left { overflow: hidden; }\n.n-left img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .5s; }\n.news-item:hover .n-left img { transform: scale(1.05); }\n.n-right { padding: 22px 26px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n.n-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.n-top time { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }\n.n-right h2 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.n-summary { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }\n.n-content { margin-top: 14px; padding: 16px 18px; background: var(--bg-soft); border-left: 3px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 6px; }\n.n-content p { color: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 2; }\n.n-toggle { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; }\n.n-toggle:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n.exp-enter-active, .exp-leave-active { transition: opacity .3s, transform .3s; }\n.exp-enter-from, .exp-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n@media (max-width: 720px) {\n  .news-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .n-left { aspect-ratio: 16/8; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/pages/Contact.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\nconst form = ref({ name: \'\', email: \'\', phone: \'\', company: \'\', message: \'\' })\nconst done = ref(false)\nconst sending = ref(false)\n\nfunction submit() {\n  if (!form.value.name || !form.value.message) return\n  sending.value = true\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    sending.value = false\n    done.value = true\n  }, 900)\n}\nfunction resetForm() {\n  done.value = false\n  form.value = { name: \'\', email: \'\', phone: \'\', company: \'\', message: \'\' }\n}\n\nconst infoCards = [\n  { icon: \'📞\', label: { zh: \'服务热线\', en: \'Hotline\' }, value: \'400-888-2365\' },\n  { icon: \'✉️\', label: { zh: \'商务邮箱\', en: \'Email\' }, value: \'contact@huaxin-tech.com\' },\n  { icon: \'📍\', label: { zh: \'总部地址\', en: \'Headquarters\' }, value: { zh: \'北京市海淀区中关村软件园 8 号创新大厦 18 层\', en: \'18F Innovation Tower No.8, Zhongguancun Software Park, Beijing\' } },\n  { icon: \'🕘\', label: { zh: \'工作时间\', en: \'Working Hours\' }, value: { zh: \'周一至周五 9:00 - 18:00\', en: \'Mon - Fri 9:00 - 18:00\' } }\n]\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"banner\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>{{ ui.nav.contact }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ ui.contact.infoTitle }}</p>\n        <div class=\"crumb\"><router-link to=\"/\">首页</router-link> / {{ ui.nav.contact }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container contact-wrap\">\n        <!-- 左侧信息 -->\n        <div class=\"c-info\">\n          <h2>{{ ui.contact.infoTitle }}</h2>\n          <p class=\"c-tip\">{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'无论是咨询产品方案、获取报价还是洽谈合作，我们都将第一时间响应。\' : \'Whether you need a demo, a quote or partnership — we respond promptly.\' }}</p>\n          <div class=\"info-list\">\n            <div v-for=\"(c, i) in infoCards\" :key=\"i\" class=\"info-row\">\n              <span class=\"info-icon\">{{ c.icon }}</span>\n              <div>\n                <b>{{ c.label[lang] }}</b>\n                <p>{{ typeof c.value === \'object\' ? c.value[lang] : c.value }}</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <img class=\"office-img\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/hxoffice/640/300\" alt=\"office\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <p class=\"cs-note\">💬 {{ ui.contact.csNotice }}</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 右侧表单 -->\n        <div class=\"c-form card\">\n          <div v-if=\"done\" class=\"form-success\">\n            <span class=\"ok-icon\">✓</span>\n            <h3>{{ ui.common.success }}</h3>\n            <p>{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'我们的顾问将在 1 个工作日内与您联系。\' : \'Our consultant will contact you within 1 business day.\' }}</p>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"resetForm\">{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'再提交一条\' : \'Send Another\' }}</button>\n          </div>\n          <template v-else>\n            <h3>{{ ui.contact.formTitle }}</h3>\n            <p class=\"form-sub\">* {{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'为必填项\' : \'required fields\' }}</p>\n            <div class=\"form-grid\">\n              <div class=\"field\">\n                <label>{{ ui.contact.name }} <i>*</i></label>\n                <input v-model=\"form.name\" :placeholder=\"lang === \'zh\' ? \'请输入您的姓名\' : \'Your name\'\" />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"field\">\n                <label>{{ ui.contact.email }} <i>*</i></label>\n                <input v-model=\"form.email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\" />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"field\">\n                <label>{{ ui.contact.phone }}</label>\n                <input v-model=\"form.phone\" :placeholder=\"lang === \'zh\' ? \'手机号码\' : \'Phone number\'\" />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"field\">\n                <label>{{ ui.contact.company }}</label>\n                <input v-model=\"form.company\" :placeholder=\"lang === \'zh\' ? \'公司名称\' : \'Company name\'\" />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"field full\">\n                <label>{{ ui.contact.message }} <i>*</i></label>\n                <textarea v-model=\"form.message\" rows=\"5\" :placeholder=\"ui.contact.placeholderMsg\"></textarea>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-actions\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" :disabled=\"sending\" @click=\"submit\">\n                {{ sending ? (lang === \'zh\' ? \'提交中…\' : \'Sending…\') : ui.common.submit }}\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"resetForm\">{{ lang === \'zh\' ? \'清空\' : \'Reset\' }}</button>\n            </div>\n          </template>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.contact-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: start; }\n.c-info h2 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.c-tip { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.info-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.info-row { display: flex; gap: 14px; }\n.info-icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; flex: none; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--sky); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 21px; }\n.info-row b { color: var(--primary); font-size: 14px; display: block; }\n.info-row p { color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }\n.office-img { border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.cs-note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); background: var(--sky); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; }\n.c-form { padding: 30px 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }\n.c-form h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 20px; }\n.form-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin: 2px 0 18px; }\n.form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }\n.field label { display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.field label i { color: #e05252; font-style: normal; }\n.field input, .field textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 14px; font-family: inherit; outline: none; background: var(--bg-soft); transition: .25s; resize: vertical; }\n.field input:focus, .field textarea:focus { border-color: var(--blue); background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,.1); }\n.field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n.form-actions { margin-top: 20px; display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: .6; cursor: wait; }\n.form-success { text-align: center; padding: 40px 10px; }\n.ok-icon { width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e7f6ec; color: #1c9d55; font-size: 34px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 0 auto 18px; }\n.form-success h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 20px; }\n.form-success p { color: var(--muted); margin: 10px 0 22px; font-size: 14px; }\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .contact-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\n  .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .c-form { padding: 24px 20px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 修改文件 src/pages/Home.vue\n\n替换前：\n```\n<script setup>\nimport { ref } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport HeroCarousel from \'@/components/HeroCarousel.vue\'\nimport ProductCard from \'@/components/ProductCard.vue\'\nimport { slides, stats, features, products, cases, news } from \'@/data/content\'\n\nconst caseIdx = ref(0)\nconst newsCards = news.slice(0, 3)\nconst featureIcons = features.map(f => f.icon)\n</script>\n```\n\n替换后：\n```\n<script setup>\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\nimport HeroCarousel from \'@/components/HeroCarousel.vue\'\nimport ProductCard from \'@/components/ProductCard.vue\'\nimport { slides, stats, features, products, cases, news } from \'@/data/content\'\n\nconst newsCards = news.slice(0, 3)\n</script>\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 修改文件 src/pages/Home.vue\n\n替换前：\n```\n        <div class=\"sec-more\">\n          <router-link to=\"/news\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">{{ ui.common.viewAll || ui.common.all }} →</router-link>\n        </div>\n```\n\n替换后：\n```\n        <div class=\"sec-more\">\n          <router-link to=\"/news\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">{{ ui.common.all }} →</router-link>\n        </div>\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 读取目录 根目录\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 读取目录 src\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 读取目录 src/pages\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 读取目录 src/components\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 写入文件 src/components/HeroCarousel.vue\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n\nconst props = defineProps({ slides: { type: Array, required: true } })\nconst current = ref(0)\nlet timer = null\n\nfunction next() { current.value = (current.value + 1) % props.slides.length }\nfunction prev() { current.value = (current.value - 1 + props.slides.length) % props.slides.length }\nfunction go(i) { current.value = i; restart() }\nfunction restart() { clearInterval(timer); timer = setInterval(next, 5000) }\nfunction pause() { clearInterval(timer) }\n\nonMounted(() => { restart() })\nonUnmounted(() => clearInterval(timer))\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"hero\" @mouseenter=\"pause\" @mouseleave=\"restart\">\n    <div v-for=\"(s, i) in slides\" :key=\"i\" class=\"hero-slide\" :class=\"{ active: i === current }\">\n      <img :src=\"s.img\" :alt=\"s.title[lang]\" class=\"hero-bg\" />\n      <div class=\"hero-mask\"></div>\n      <div class=\"container hero-content\">\n        <h1>{{ s.title[lang] }}</h1>\n        <p>{{ s.sub[lang] }}</p>\n        <router-link :to=\"s.route\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">{{ s.cta[lang] }} →</router-link>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"arrow prev\" @click=\"prev\" aria-label=\"prev\">‹</button>\n    <button class=\"arrow next\" @click=\"next\" aria-label=\"next\">›</button>\n\n    <div class=\"dots\">\n      <span\n        v-for=\"(s, i) in slides\" :key=\"i\"\n        class=\"dot\" :class=\"{ on: i === current }\"\n        @click=\"go(i)\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<style scoped>\n.hero { position: relative; height: 560px; overflow: hidden; }\n.hero-slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity 1s ease, visibility 1s; }\n.hero-slide.active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }\n.hero-bg { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n.hero-mask { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(8,24,54,.92) 12%, rgba(8,24,54,.62) 48%, rgba(8,24,54,.25)); }\n.hero-content { position: relative; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; color: #fff; z-index: 2; padding-top: 70px; }\n.hero-content h1 { font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.3; max-width: 640px; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n.hero-content p { margin: 20px 0 30px; max-width: 580px; font-size: 17px; opacity: .9; line-height: 1.9; }\n.arrow { position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); z-index: 3; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); color: #fff; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; transition: .25s; }\n.arrow:hover { background: var(--blue); }\n.prev { left: 20px; } .next { right: 20px; }\n.dots { position: absolute; bottom: 26px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 9px; z-index: 3; }\n.dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.45); cursor: pointer; transition: all .3s; }\n.dot.on { width: 26px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--gold); }\n@media (max-width: 860px) {\n  .hero { height: 430px; }\n  .hero-content h1 { font-size: 30px; }\n  .hero-content p { font-size: 15px; }\n  .arrow { display: none; }\n}\n</style>\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 修改文件 src/components/CustomerService.vue\n\n替换前：\n```\nimport { ref, nextTick } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n```\n\n替换后：\n```\nimport { ref, nextTick } from \'vue\'\nimport { lang } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n```\n\n\n\n\n[工具调用] 修改文件 src/components/Footer.vue\n\n替换前：\n```\n<script setup>\nimport { lang, ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n</script>\n```\n\n替换后：\n```\n<script setup>\nimport { ui } from \'@/utils/i18n\'\n</script>\n```\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[执行结束]\n\n\n\n## 网站生成完毕\n\n已完成华信科技集团企业官网全部工程文件的创建，包括：\n\n- **工程配置**：`index.html`、`package.json`、`vite.config.js`（`./` 基础路径 + `@` 别名）\n- **应用核心**：`main.js`、`App.vue`、路由（Hash 模式）、全局样式、中英文国际化工具\n- **通用组件**：导航栏、页脚、首页轮播、产品卡片、智能客服浮窗\n- **五个页面**：首页、关于我们、产品服务、新闻资讯、联系我们\n- **数据文件**：涵盖产品、案例、团队、里程碑、资讯及完整双语文案的模拟数据\n\n所有页面采用统一响应式布局，支持桌面 / 平板 / 移动端适配，图片均使用占位图服务加载。','ai',455196122760335360,455174745437188096,'2026-09-09 15:31:50','2026-09-09 15:36:24',1),(455197162725429248,'AI回复失败com.hoops.genwithzero.common.exception.BusinessException: Vue 项目构建失败，请查看后端日志','ai',455196122760335360,455174745437188096,'2026-09-09 15:32:00','2026-09-09 15:36:24',1);
